<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">-Chala</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yesu Kirisito Wɩɛ Abama Ŋii Ganaŋkʋ Luka Sabɩɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yesu Kirisito Wɩɛ Abama Ŋii Ganaŋkʋ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sabɩɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kpɩnɩdɩ dʋɔ sɛ Luka sabɩɛ tanɛ gana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Bɩnɛ Tiyofilosi, bakpa fɔɩ n mʋ jaga ba wʋsɛ dʋɔ sabɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ kɔŋ tɩba daa tɩba na si. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Ba sabɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii Yesu kpalɛnara baa tɩŋtɩŋ chɩŋkpɩɛ mʋ ba asa na, na baa ba yɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii tʋmɩra ŋii Yesu yɩɛ saŋa gaa wʋ wɩɛ daa jaŋ na, lɩɩ saŋa gaa wʋ fara wʋ dɩtʋm na. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, ma tɩŋtɩŋ ma kɩɛ bʋrʋkʋma naŋ na dieli lɩɩ dɩ faratɩŋ, dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ dɩdaga na maŋ gba maa sabɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii dɔŋa dʋɔ ganaŋkʋ ŋɩ wɩɛ dieli na fa nyaŋ, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />na nyaa jiŋ gʋ wɩɛ ŋii ba kalaa nyaŋ na kpiniŋ yɩɛ gasiŋteŋ.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ lʋrʋ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Yudatina Juo Hɛrɔdɩ saŋa na, Ɩsʋɔ sei wʋrʋ cha wʋ wɩɛ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Sakariya. Wʋ cha kpi Abiya seina dikpeŋ gaa dʋɔ. Wʋ alʋ cha wʋ yɩɛ Elisabeti wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ sei Arɔŋ ganana bie bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Sakariya na wʋ alʋ Elisabeti ba chirigi Ɩsʋɔ asanaŋ. Baa kpaŋ Ɩsʋɔ mbara na wʋ wɩɛ apɔgʋsa dʋɔ na dieli. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ba ŋmɛ fɔɩ ama ba n lʋrʋ bachaasɛ ɛ. Akala takɩɛ Elisabeti yɩɛ alʋ pamkpaŋtɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Wɩɩ darɛ Sakariya a tʋm Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ, akala takɩɛ dɩ tala seina dikpeŋ gaa wʋ kpi ga dʋɔ na tʋm saŋa. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ba lɔ mbi lɩsɛ ɩ ganaŋkʋ Ɩsʋɔ seina ayɩɛsa akala sɛ wʋ n ju Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ ga tʋʋ tii galifeŋsa. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Saŋa gaa wʋ a tʋʋ ɩnsɛnsɩ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ gaa naŋ na, yela bakapa wɩɛ asʋŋ baa jɔ dɩga.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ lɩsɛ wʋ wʋsɛ kalaa ɩ yela wʋ sɩmɩɛɩ gadiesa dɩgbɩŋgbɩŋ gaa baa tʋʋ ɩnsɛnsɩ ga dʋɔ na jɩsaŋ dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Gʋ Sakariya na ɩ na, wʋ digela karɛ ɩ sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ ɩ <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ama Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sakariya, n baa yela nyɩŋtɩɛ a chaŋ nyaŋ. Akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ nyii n dɩga. Nya alʋ Elisabeti aja lʋrʋ bu baalɛ fa nyaŋ na nyaa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Wʋ a yela nyaa yu asadi galaŋ, sɛ bakpa fɔɩ gba aja yu asadi wʋ lʋrʋ dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Akala takɩɛ wʋ a yɩɛ wʋkpa janɛ Ɩsʋɔ asanaŋ. Ŋɩ n tiri sɛ wʋ n nyʋɔ wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ yaa sʋlʋŋ adoŋtina a. Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ aja su wʋ tɩba pɔɩ na baa lʋrʋ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Wʋ a yela Isiralitina fɔɩ aja bɔrɛ kɔŋ ba Ɩsʋɔ jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Wʋ a pala Kpaŋjuo asanaŋ Ɩsʋɔ feliŋ na Ɩsʋɔ ɔja Eliya yikuo naŋ, na wʋ a biliŋi juo aba asa kɔŋ ba bie dʋɔ na wʋ a yela dɩlɛ naŋ doŋtina a gaa yɩɛ kpiŋjimtina takɩɛ ba chirigisa, na wʋ a desina bakpa daa Kpaŋjuo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Sɛ sei Sakariya tasɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be aaŋ ja yela na maa lɩɛdi sɛ ŋina yɩɛ gasiŋteŋ? Akala takɩɛ maŋ na ma alʋ kpiniŋ dɩ ŋmɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Sɛ gabʋɔ wʋŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maŋ n nyina Gabireli wʋŋ ma sɩmɩɛɩ Ɩsʋɔ asanaŋ, sɛ wʋ kpiri maŋ sɛ ma n gaa tawɩ wɩɛ abama ŋina fa nyaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Gʋ nya n lɩɛ ma wɩɛ ŋii ŋii kɔŋ ŋɩ saŋa gabam naŋ di na dʋɔ ɔ, dɩtɩɛna nyaa yɩɛ namu ga tala wɩɩ gaa dɩmʋŋ wɩɛ ŋina aja kɔŋ tɩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Saŋa gana naŋ na, bakpa baa dana Sakariya yela baa yɩyɩɛ bʋrʋ gaa ga yɩɛ sɛ wʋ taŋgɩlɛ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ na. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Saŋa gaa wʋ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ gaa naŋ na, wʋ aa ti dɩlɛ wʋ a tawɩ ba jaŋ ŋ. Ba na gʋ wʋ yu Ɩsʋɔ lɩsɛ kalaa Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ gaa naŋ. Akala takɩɛ wʋ pam sɛ wʋ chamɩna wʋ a yɩɛ daasɛ wɩɛ wʋ a kalaa ba. Ama wʋ n dɩlɛ tawɩ ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Gʋ wʋ tʋŋ gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ju gɩtɛ na, wʋ bɔrɛ ju dɩɛ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ŋina wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, wʋ alʋ Elisabeti yu fɩlɩ sɛ wʋ mʋ wʋ wʋsɛ wɩsɛ waa dʋɔ gafɩtasɛ sɩnʋŋ. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩsʋɔ n yɩɛ ŋina fa maŋ. Gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ŋina naŋ, Ɩsʋɔ wɩɩ ma dʋɔ sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ asaju lɩɩ ma dʋɔ bakapa asa naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu lʋrʋ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Gʋ Elisabeti fɩlɩ yu gafɩtasɛ lʋrʋ na, Ɩsʋɔ ti bɔrɛ kpiri gabʋɔ Gabireli sɛ wʋ n ju Nasarati gaa ga wɩɛ Galaliya tibi dʋɔ na, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />sɛ wʋ n ju wuboloŋpu wʋŋ wʋ ba jiŋ baalɛ sɛ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Mariya. Ba mʋ ɩ fa Yosefu sarɛ. Yosefu yɩɛ Juo Dawidi ganana bie bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ yɩlɩ Mariya tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ wʋŋ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɩ n dʋɔ. Ɩsʋɔ kpi n dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Sɛ Mariya wʋsɛ yɔgɔsɛ ɩ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ wɩɛ ŋii dʋɔ sɛ wʋ fa nfɩɛrɛ sɛ be yɩlɩ duluŋ naŋ mɩnaŋ? <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ama Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mariya n baa yela nyɩŋtɩɛ a chaŋ nyaŋ! Ɩsʋɔ wɩɩ n dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Kɩɛ, nyaa yu fɩlɩ na nyaa lʋrʋ bu baalɛ na nyaa si ɩ yɩrɛ sɛ Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Wʋ a yɩɛ wʋkpa janɛ na baa yagɛ ɩ Ɩsʋɔ Wʋjanɛ wʋŋ Bu. Ɩsʋɔ, Ɩsʋɔ wʋŋ aja mʋ wʋ duluŋ naŋ juo Dawidi juorigbeli gaa fa ɩ, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />wʋ a di Yakubu waa dʋɔ gakpaa. Wʋ Juori taŋ gɩtɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Sɛ Mariya tasɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma ba jiŋ baalɛ ɛ, aja yɩɛ sɩnɛ na ŋina a kɔŋ tɩba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ aja kɔŋ n dʋɔ, na Ɩsʋɔ Wʋjanɛ wʋŋ doŋ aja gaa fu n dʋɔ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, n bu wʋŋ nyaa lʋrʋ ɩ na wʋ a yɩɛ dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ na baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Bu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Kɩɛ, Elisabeti wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ n lʋŋtɛ na a kɔŋ wʋ a gaa lʋrʋ wʋ gɩnʋmʋŋsarɛ saŋa naŋ. Wʋŋ sɛ bakpa a tawɩ sɛ wʋ aa lʋrʋ na gba dɔŋna fɩlɩ gafɩtasɛ lʋʋrʋ. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Akala takɩɛ bʋrʋ taŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ baa dɩlɛ yɩɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Sɛ Mariya tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ tʋmɩrɛ bɛ. Ŋɩ n yɩɛ fa maŋ takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ nya tawɩ na.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ lɩɩ wʋ jaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariya ju ga bʋɔ Elisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Wɩɛ akalisa ŋarɛ wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, Mariya kʋlʋ bileŋ ju dɩɛ garɛ ga wɩɛ bʋrɔŋsɛ dʋɔ Yuda tibi dʋɔ na naŋ, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />sɛ wʋ ju Sakariya waa dʋɔ ga yɩlɩ wʋ alʋ Elisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Gʋ Elisabeti nyii Mariya yɩlɩ na, sɛ wʋchaa wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛ wʋ lorinaŋ na jigisi. Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ gaa su Elisabeti tɩba. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Sɛ wʋ fuba na doŋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kusee n nyina nyaŋ ala kpiniŋ naŋ sɛ kusee n nyina bu wʋŋ nyaa lʋrʋ na. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Be n yɩɛ sɛ jilima ŋina kɔŋ ma dʋɔ sɛ Kpaŋjuo wʋnaa gaa bʋɔ ma dʋɔ? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Kɩɛ, gʋ ma nyii n yɩlɩ na, sɛ wʋchaa wʋŋ mʋ asadi jigisi ma lorinaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Kusee n nyina nyaŋ wʋŋ nya lɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii wʋ tawɩ fa nyaŋ na di sɛ ŋɩ kɔŋ tɩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariya kalɩɛwʋ numba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Sɛ Mariya tawɩ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;&lt;Ma sʋbʋ n kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />sɛ ma sʋbʋ asadi Ɩsʋɔ wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ Mɔlɔgɩrɛ<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Akala takɩɛ wʋ nyiŋi wʋ alʋ tʋmɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">maŋ wʋŋ ma n daga a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">lɩɩ jaŋ mʋ a ju na, gɩnanaŋ ŋii ŋii kɔŋ na kpiniŋ aja yagɛ maŋ sɛ wʋŋ ba yɩɛ ɩ kusee.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Akala takɩɛ, Ɩsʋɔ Doŋtɛ wʋŋ n yɩɛ wɩɛ a janɩɛ ŋina fa maŋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">Wʋ yɩrɛ n nyina dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Wʋ a wɩɩ baa baa se ɩ na gɩyɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">lɩɩ jaŋ gɩnanaŋ mʋ ga tala chifuo gɩnanaŋ dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Wʋ mʋ wʋ pam yɩɛ yikuo wɩɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">Sɛ wʋ puseŋ baa baa kʋna ba wʋsɛ adugbe ba agela naŋ na.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Wʋ a kʋna juoneŋ ba juorigbeliŋ dʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">sɛ wʋ jiŋna baa baa kɔna ba wʋsɛ tie na adugbe.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Wʋ yela sɛ ayɔŋtina yu abʋrɩ abama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">ama baa ba yɩɛ akpaŋtatina na bɩrɛ, ba ju pamɩɛ kpaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Wʋ chɔna wʋ bakpa Isiralitina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">sɛ wʋ nyiŋi sɛ wʋ wɩɩ ba gɩyɔŋ<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Abiraham na wʋ tietina gɩyɔŋ gakpaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">ganaŋkʋ wʋ tawɩ ba gɩnanaŋ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Sɛ Mariya cha Elisabeti jaŋ aja yɩɛ gafɩtasɛ atoro pɔɩ sɛ wʋ bɔrɛ ju dɩɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ wʋŋ lʋrʋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Gʋ Elisabeti lʋrʋ talɛ na, wʋ lʋrʋ bu baalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Baa wʋ na ba chaɩ tirina na wʋ lʋŋtina nyii gʋ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɩ wʋ gɩyɔŋ fɔɩ, sɛ wʋ na ba kpiniŋ asadi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Gʋ wʋchafɔlɩɛ wʋŋ yu wɩɛ jiŋinara na, ba kɔŋ na baa gaa kara wʋ baŋlɛ, nafʋɔ ba ja sɛ baa mʋ wʋ juo Sakariya yɩrɛ si ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Sɛ wʋnaa tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Aye! Baa yagɛ sɛ Yohane.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Sɛ ba tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N lʋŋtɩrɛ naŋ wʋrʋ taŋ sɛ baa yagɛ dɩmʋŋ yɩrɛ gana a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Sɛ ba mʋ ba pamɩɛ mʋ yɩɛ daasɛ kalaa Sakariya yɩrɛ gaa wʋ a ja sɛ ba n mʋ si wʋchaa wʋŋ na. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sɛ wʋ mʋ wʋ pam yɩɛ daasɛ kalaa ba sɛ ba n mʋ bʋrʋ ga sabɩɛsa kɔna ɩ, sɛ wʋ sabɩɛ ga dʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋ yɩrɛ n nyina Yohane.&gt;&gt; Sɛ dɩ yɩɛ wʋkʋma doba. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Gabʋanaŋ sɛ Sakariya nʋɔ fulu sɛ wʋ nʋɔjʋlʋŋ buoli sɛ wʋ dɩlɛ wʋ a tawɩ sɛ wʋ mʋ kalɩɛwʋ fa Ɩsʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ baa wʋ na ba ba chaɩ tirina na kpiniŋ, na bakpa baa ba chaɩ dɩɛsɛ ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ bʋrɔŋsɛ dʋɔ Yudiya tibi dʋɔ na kpiniŋ a tawɩ dɩmʋŋ wɩɛ ŋina. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ nyii dɩmʋŋ wɩɛ ŋina na, wʋ fa ŋɩ nfɩɛrɛ sɛ wʋ tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be sɛ wʋchaa wina a kɔŋ wʋ a gaa yɩɛ?&gt;&gt; Akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ pam jagaɩ wʋ dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sakariya kpie numba kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ su Yohane wʋjuo Sakariya tɩba, sɛ wʋ gbala sɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />&lt;&lt;Kalɩɛwʋ n ju fa Ɩsʋɔ, Isirali Ɩsʋɔ wʋŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Akala takɩɛ wʋ kɔŋ gaa mɔlɔgɩ wʋ bakpa.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Wʋ fa daa Mɔlɔgɩrɛ doŋ-tɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">lɩɩ wʋ tʋmɩrɛ Juo Dawidi lʋŋtɩrɛ naŋ, <verse eid="LUK 1:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />[ganaŋkʋ wʋ cha pala na wʋ bajana baa ba wʋsɛ yɩɛ dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ sɛ ba cha laŋ na dʋɔ tawɩ si sɛ,]<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Wʋ a kɔŋ gaa mɔlɔgɩ daa lɩɩ daa badʋŋna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">na baa baa kɔla daa na kpiniŋ pamɩɛ naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Wʋ a wɩɩ daa duluŋ gɩyɔŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">na wʋ a nyiŋi dɩkɔŋ chɩrɩchɩrɩ.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Wʋ ka ntaŋ fa daa duluŋ Abiraham<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />sɛ, wʋ a lɩsɛ daa lɩɩ daa badʋŋna pamɩɛ naŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">na wʋ a yela dɩ tʋm ɩ yela nyɩŋtɩɛ ba chamɩna daa a,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />na chɩrɩchɩrɩ na chirigi naŋ wʋ asanaŋ daa nkpa gɩyɩɛnɩŋ kpiniŋ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Sɛ Sakariya tawɩ wʋbu Yohane sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baa yagɛ nyaŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Wʋjanɛ ɔja.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">Akala takɩɛ nyaa pala daa Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ asanaŋ na nyaa desina gbɩɛ si da ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Nyaa yela na wʋ bakpa a jiŋ gʋ ba dɩsʋbʋ mʋ chɩɛ dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">sɛ ba yu mɔlɔgɩ.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ wʋŋ wʋ wɩɩ daa gɩyɔŋ dʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">wʋ yela sɛ wiita lɩɩ fa daa.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Sɛ dɩ ŋmaŋi fa baa ba chaɩ giteŋteŋbiri naŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">na baa ba wɩɛ sɩŋ giteŋteŋbiri naŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">na wʋ a gie daa nafara mʋ pala wʋsɛfɩɛ gbɩɛ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Sɛ wʋchaa wʋŋ bɩɩ sɛ wʋ yɩɛ doŋ feliŋ naŋ. Sɛ wʋ cha ifuli dʋɔ ga tala gʋ wʋ lɩsɛ wʋ wʋsɛ kalaa Isiralitina.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu lʋrʋ dʋɔ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matiyo 1:18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Dɩmʋŋ gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ŋina naŋ na, Juo Kayisa Agusitusi dʋ sɛ ba n kalaa bakpa Roma tibi kpiniŋ dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Dɩmʋŋ bakpa kalɩŋ ŋina n nyina ŋii ŋɩ dɔŋ asanaŋ saŋa gaa Kireniyosi yɩɛ Siriya tibi dʋɔ kɩɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Sɛ wʋkʋma wina ju wʋ dɩɛnaŋ na wʋ a ga sabɩɛ wʋ yɩrɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ Yosefu lɩɩ Nasarati gaa ga wɩɛ Galaliya tibi dʋɔ ju Betilehem, Juo Dawidi dɩɛ gaa ga wɩɛ Yudiya tibi dʋɔ. Akala takɩɛ wʋ lɩɩ Juo Dawidi lʋŋtɩrɛ naŋ bɛ sɛ wʋ yɩɛ wʋ ganana bie. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Sɛ Yosefu na Mariya wʋŋ ba mʋ ɩ fa ɩ sarɛ na ju baa ga sabɩɛ ba yɩrɩɛ. Na Mariya dɔŋ na fɩlɩ. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Gʋ ba wɩɛ dɩmaŋ na, sɛ dʋŋɩwʋ chaŋ Mariya, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />sɛ wʋ lʋrʋ wʋbu asanaŋtɛ bu baalɛ. Sɛ wʋ mʋ apaŋtaŋ mɩlɩ ɩ, wʋ mʋ ɩ ga duosi namɩɛ adiya dɩdaka naŋ. Akala takɩɛ ba n yu diduwei mʋɔra danɛ gaa naŋ ŋ.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Feŋ kpara na Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Dɩmʋŋ saŋa gana na, feŋ kpara barɛ cha ba wɩɛ Betilehem tibi dʋɔ salɛ gatʋŋgʋrʋ baa kɩɛ ba feŋ dikpeŋ dɩmʋŋ yuluma gana. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋrʋ lɩsɛ wʋ wʋsɛ kalaa ba sɛ Ɩsʋɔ jilima ŋmaŋi logo ba sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ama Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa yela na nyɩŋtɩɛ a chaŋ amɩɛ. Ma chamɩna Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ abama ŋii ŋii mʋ asadi fa bakpa kpiniŋ na bɛ maa kɔna amɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Jaŋ, ba lʋrʋ Mɔlɔgɩrɛ fa amɩɛ Juo Dawidi dɩɛ naŋ, wʋŋ n nyina Kirisito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kirisito tie akala sɛ Mɔlɔgɩrɛ. Girikitina a yagɛ ɩ sɛ Kirisito sɛ Yudatina a yagɛ ɩ sɛ Mesaya</char></note> Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ŋina aaŋ ja yɩɛ amɩɛ daasɛ wɩɛ, ɩ na ba mʋ apaŋtaŋ mɩlɩ wʋchaa fɔlɛ wʋ duwei namɩɛ adiya dɩdaka naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ fɔɩ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe gaa kpi gabʋɔ wʋŋ dʋɔ, sɛ ba kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ sɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;Jilima n ju fa Ɩsʋɔ wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛ adugbe na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">sɛ wʋsɛfɩɛ n ju fa bakpa baa Ɩsʋɔ wɩɩ ba dʋɔ tibi dʋɔ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Gʋ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ baa lɩɩ ba jaŋ bɔrɛ ju Ɩsʋɔ adugbe na, sɛ feŋ kpara baa tawɩ dɔŋa sɛ, &lt;&lt;N yela na dɩ ju Betilehem ga kɩɛ bʋrʋ gaa ga yɩɛ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ tawɩ ŋɩ wɩɛ fa daa na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ba yɩɛ bileŋ ju ga ja na Yosefu na Mariya na wʋchaa fɔlɛ wʋŋ wʋ duwei namɩɛ adiya dɩdaka gaa naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Gʋ ba na ɩ na, ba tawɩ fa wʋkʋma ŋii Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ gaa tawɩ ba lɩɩ wʋchaa wʋŋ dʋɔ na. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Sɛ dɩ yɩɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ nyii feŋ kpara baa wɩɛ ŋii ba tawɩ na doba. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ama Mariya bɩrɛ, wʋ mʋ wɩɛ ŋii wɩsɛ wʋ digela naŋ wʋ a fa ŋɩ dʋɔ nfɩɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Gʋ feŋ kpara baa bɔrɛ baa kɔnɛ na, ba mʋ yɩlɩ na kalɩɛwʋ fa Ɩsʋɔ lɩɩ ŋii ba nyii sɛ ba naa na dʋɔ ganaŋkʋ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ tawɩ ba na.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba si Yesu yɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Gʋ wʋchaa wʋŋ di wɩɛ jiŋinara, sɛ baa kara wʋ baŋlɛ na, sɛ ba si ɩ yɩrɛ sɛ Yesu. Yɩrɛ gaa Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ wʋŋ tawɩ si pɔɩ sɛ ba yu wʋ fɩlɩ na.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Gʋ saŋa talɛ gʋ ba n ju ga yɩɛ iniesi saŋ lɩsɛ ganaŋkʋ Mosesi mbara kalaa na, Yosefu na Mariya ba mʋ wʋchaa wʋŋ ju Yerusalem Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ na baa ga mʋ ɩ fa Ɩsʋɔ <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />[ganaŋkʋ ba sabɩɛ Mosesi mbara naŋ sɛ,&lt;&lt;Bu baalɛ asanaŋtɛ kʋma yɩɛ dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ fa Ɩsʋɔ bɛ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Ɛsa 13:2</ref>.</char></note>] <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Na baa diesi gadiesa ganaŋkʋ Mosesi mbara kalaa na sɛ ba n mʋ, &lt;&lt;Juori gakuosɛ bala yaa gakuo bisi bala ju ga diesi gadiesa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Dɩmʋŋ saŋa gana na, baalɛ wʋrʋ cha wʋ wɩɛ Yerusalem baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Simiyoŋ. Wʋ yɩɛ wʋkpa wʋ chirigisa sɛ wʋ a se Ɩsʋɔ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ wɩɛ wʋ dʋɔ. Wʋ dana saŋa gaa Ɩsʋɔ aja mɔlɔgɩ Isirali. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ cha lɩsɛ kalaa ɩ sɛ wʋ a sɩŋ ŋ, amʋɔ wʋ na Kirisito wʋŋ Ɩsʋɔ lɩsɛ ɩ na. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ yela sɛ Simoŋ ju Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ. Gʋ Yesu lʋrʋda baa mʋ ɩ ju tʋm danɛ naŋ ga yɩɛ ganaŋkʋ Mosesi mbara kalaa na, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simoŋ mʋ ɩ chaŋ wʋ pamɩɛ naŋ sɛ wʋ mʋ kalɩɛwʋ fa Ɩsʋɔ tawɩ sɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo Ɩsʋɔ, ŋii nya tawɩ si na kɔŋ tɩba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">dɩtɩɛna bɩrɛ, tii nya tʋmɩrɛ gbɩɛ wʋsɛfɩɛ naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Akala takɩɛ ma asa na nya Mɔlɔgɩrɛ wʋŋ.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Wʋŋ nya fɩla desina si bakpa kpiniŋ na.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Wʋŋ n nyina ŋmaŋi fa baa ba ba yɩɛ Yudatina na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">na wʋ a mʋ jilima kɔna wʋ bakpa Isiralitina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Wɩɛ ŋii Simoŋ tawɩ lɩɩ wʋchaa wʋŋ dʋɔ na yɩɛ wʋ lʋrʋda doba. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Sɛ Simiyoŋ yɩɛ ba kusee sɛ wʋ tawɩ Mariya sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɩɛ, wʋchaa wina wɩɛ takɩɛ wʋŋ aaŋ ja wʋ a mʋ salɩŋ na kʋlʋ kɔna Isiralitina, na wʋ a yɩɛ daasɛ ŋii bakpa aja tawɩ chicha <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />na ŋii yela bakpa fɔɩ nyienaŋ wɩɛ a lɩɩ ifuli. Sɛ nyaŋ gba yuo dabɩla aja sɔ nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Dɩmʋŋ saŋa gana naŋ, anʋmʋŋsarɛ wʋrʋ cha wʋ wɩɛ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Ana, wʋ yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ ɔja alʋ jaŋ bɛ. Wʋ juo n nyina Fanuweli wʋŋ wʋ lɩɩ Asa buonɔ naŋ. Wʋ saa sɛ wʋ cha wʋ baalɛ jaŋ bɩŋsɛ lɩkaarɛ sɛ wʋ baalɛ sɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Wʋ cha gikula bɩŋsɛ ŋɩnara na anara. Wʋ n lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ ŋ, ama wiita na yuluma wʋ wɩɛ dɩmaŋ wʋ a tʋm, wʋ a chaŋ nʋɔ pɔgʋ yela wʋ a jɔ dɩga wʋ a fa Ɩsʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Gʋ Simoŋ saŋ wʋ a tawɩ na, sɛ Ana kɔŋ ba jaŋ sɛ wʋ yɩlɩ Ɩsʋɔ, sɛ wʋ tawɩ wʋchaa wʋŋ wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ fa bakpa baa ba dana Ɩsʋɔ mɔlɔgɩ ŋii wʋ a mɔlɔgɩ Yerusalem dɩɛ na.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Gʋ Yosefu na Mariya ba yɩɛ bʋrʋkʋma taŋ ganaŋkʋ Ɩsʋɔ mbara kalaa na, ba bɔrɛ ju ba dɩɛnaŋ Nasarati. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Sɛ wʋchaa wʋŋ bɩɩ. Sɛ wʋ yɩɛ doŋ sɛ wʋ yu kpiŋjim, sɛ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɩ wɩɛ wʋ dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wʋchaa Yesu wɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Bɩriŋnʋɔ kʋma Yesu lʋrʋda a ju Yerusalem baa di nyiŋi asadi adiya di gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ŋii. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Gʋ Yesu dɩ bɩŋsɛ gifi ala na, ba ju baa ga di wɩɩ di ganaŋkʋ Yudatina ayɩɛsa a kalaa na. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Gʋ ba di asadi adiya di taŋ sɛ wʋ lʋrʋda baa bɔrɛ baa ju dɩɛ na, Yesu dʋɔ Yerusalem, yela wʋ lʋrʋda ba jiŋ ŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Na ba jiŋ sɛ wʋ kpi ba dikpeŋ gaa dʋɔ bɛ, dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ba pala wɩɩ gana kpiniŋ pɔɩ sɛ ba fara baa ja ɩ ba lʋŋtina naŋ na ba dɩɛtina naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Gʋ ba n na ɩ na, ba bɔrɛ ju Yerusalem na baa ga ja ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Wɩɛ atoro wɩɩ na, ba na ɩ wʋ cha ɩ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ bakalaasa baa jaŋ wʋ a nyii ba jaŋ yela wʋ a tasɛ ba wɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ nyii wʋ wɩɛ na, dɩ yɩɛ ɩ doba lɩɩna wʋ tie nyii na wʋ nʋɔ lɩsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Gʋ Yesu lʋrʋda na ɩ na, dɩ yɩɛ ba doba. Sɛ wʋnaa tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mabu, be n yɩɛ sɛ nya yɩɛ daa dɩmʋŋ? Kɩɛ, maŋ na njuo daa asa chɩbɛ dɩ ja nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ dʋɔ sɛ ɩ ja maŋ? Ɩ ba jiŋ sɛ ŋɩ tiri gʋ maa cha Majuo waa dʋɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ama ba n nyii wɩɛ ŋii wʋ tawɩ ba na tie ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Sɛ Yesu kpaŋ wʋ lʋrʋda bɔrɛ ju Nasarati yela wʋ a nyii ba dɩ tawɩ. Ama Mariya mʋ wɩɛ ŋina wɩsɛ wʋ nyinaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Sɛ Yesu bɩɩ sɛ wʋ bɩɩ kpiŋjim naŋ, sɛ wʋ yu Ɩsʋɔ na bakpa asa naŋ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɩ.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ wʋŋ tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matiyo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maakɩ 1:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Gʋ Roma Juo janɛ Tiberosi Kayisa yɩɛ Juo bɩŋsɛ gifi anʋŋ naŋ na, Pontiyosi Pilato n cha wʋ nyina Yudiya tibi dʋɔ kɩɛrɛ, sɛ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ dʋɔ yɩɛ Galaliya Juo, sɛ wʋ ŋmɩɛtɩ Filipo dʋɔ yɩɛ Ituriya na Tirakonitisi Juo, sɛ Lisaniyasi yɩɛ Abilene Juo. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Dɩmʋŋ saŋa gana sɛ Anasi na Kayifasi yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ sei bɩnɩɛ naŋ bɩnɛ. Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ kɔŋ Yohane wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ Sakariya bu na jaŋ ifuli dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, wʋ ju dɩɛsɛ ŋii ŋɩ logo Yodaŋ buo na ga tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N biliŋi lɩɩ amɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ naŋ na ɩ kɔŋ Ɩsʋɔ jaŋ na maa sɔ amɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ sɔ, na wʋ a mʋ amɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ amɩɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ganaŋkʋ Ɩsʋɔ ɔja Yisaya chɩŋkpɩɛ sabɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ si sɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Lofu garɛ kuusi ifuli dʋɔ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">desina gbɩɛ si fa Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">na ɩ chirigi gbɩɛ fa ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Dɩtaka kʋma aja su</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">sɛ bʋrɔŋ na bʋrɔŋ bie kʋma aja sirigi na ŋii tatɩrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Gbɩɛsɛ anyɔŋsa aja chirigi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Gbɩɛsɛ awarɩɛsa aja yɩɛ tɔlɛtɔlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Bakpa kpiniŋ aja na nya Mɔlɔgɩrɛ wʋŋ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Yis 40:3-5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Sɛ Yohane tawɩ jama baa baa kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ sɛ wʋŋ sɔ ba Ɩsʋɔ sɔ na sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ baa ɩ kɩɛna takɩɛ dʋmɩɛ sɔrɛtina, Mmʋɔ n jɔ amɩɛ nyienaŋ sɛ n se lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ biŋbira ŋii wʋ chamɩna wʋ a kɔŋ amɩɛ dʋɔ na? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />N yela na amɩɛ ayɩɛsa a kalaa takɩɛ ɩ biliŋi lɩɩ amɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ naŋ. N baa fara ɩ fa nfɩɛrɛ sɛ, &lt;Abiraham yɩɛ daa duluŋ bɛ.&gt; Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, Ɩsʋɔ a dɩlɛ mʋ bʋɛ ŋina yɩɛ ganana bie fa Abiraham. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ba fɩla mʋ dɩkpaŋfa ga jaga dasɛ ŋii lira dʋɔ, daŋ kʋma gaa gaa si bie abama na, baa wʋŋ ga lɔ na baa mʋ lɔ dʋ bʋala naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Sɛ jama baa tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɩnɛ sɛ dɩ n yɩɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Sɛ Yohane lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛna gagbasɛ ala na, wʋŋ mʋ garɛ fa wʋŋ wʋ tana na. Sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛna adiya dʋɔ na, wʋŋ yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Lampo lɩɛra gba kɔŋ gaa tawɩ ɩ sɛ wʋŋ sɔ ba Ɩsʋɔ sɔ. Sɛ ba tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, sɩnɛ sɛ dɩ n yɩɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Sɛ Yohane lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa lɩɛ lampo kii ganaŋkʋ dɩdaga na ɩ lɩɛ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Sɛ yuo yuora baa barɛ gba kɔŋ gaa tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɩnɛ sɛ dɩ n yɩɛ?&gt;&gt; Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa ŋɩrɛ wʋrʋ doŋ dʋɔ lɩɛ wʋ aterembie yaa n baa yɩɛ akarɩɛ jaga wʋrʋ. N yela amɩɛ asa a su amɩɛ kɩmtʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Na bakpa baa a kɩɛ Nkpalɩɛrɛ wʋŋ gbɩɛ yela baa fa nfɩɛrɛ sɛ Yohane n nyina Kirisito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudatina a yagɛ Kirisito sɛ Mesaya </char></note> wʋŋ. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ bakpa baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maŋ bɩrɛ maa mʋ lɩŋ sɔ amɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ sɔ. Ama wʋŋ wʋ a kɔŋ ma wʋrʋgbɩɛ na yɩɛ wʋ janɛ kii maŋ, ma n daga na maa luuŋ buoli wʋ asibita ganyasɛ ɛ. Wʋŋ bɩrɛ, Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ ŋii na bʋala sɛ wʋ a mʋ sɔ amɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Wʋ chamɩna bʋrʋ gafalɩsa wʋ pam naŋ na wʋ a mʋ fala lɩsɛ gamɩsɛ lɩɩ duofu naŋ ŋɩ dɩkpalaŋ naŋ, na wʋ a kui bie ŋii dʋ wʋ dichonkon naŋ. Ama duofu ŋii bɩrɛ, wʋ a tʋ ŋɛ bʋala gaa gaa dum na naŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yohane pala gbɩɛsɛ fɔɩ dʋɔ tawɩ dʋ bakpa sɛ wʋ tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ Wɩɛ Abama ŋii fa ba.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Yohane tawɩ baŋ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ akala takɩɛ wʋ lɩɛ Hɛrɔdɩya wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ wʋ nabu alʋ na saa, na wɩɛ asʋbʋɛ ŋii wʋ yɩɛ kpi na kpiniŋ. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ama dɩsʋbʋ gaa Juo Hɛrɔdɩ ti bɔrɛ yɩɛ kpi na n nyina sɛ wʋ tɔ Yohane danɛ dɩtʋɔtɩŋ.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane sɔ Yesu Ɩsʋɔ sɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matiyo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maakɩ 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Gʋ Yohane a sɔ bakpa baa kpiniŋ Ɩsʋɔ sɔ na, wʋ sɔ Yesu gba. Gʋ Yesu a jɔ dɩga na, sɛ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe fulu <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ tibi wʋ dʋɔ takɩɛ juori gakuo. Sɛ lofu lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe kɔŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ n nyina Mabu wʋŋ maa ja n wɩɛ, ma asa su n dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu duluŋ naŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matiyo 1:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Saŋa gaa Yesu fara wʋ dɩtʋm na, wʋ a yɩɛ takɩɛ bɩŋsɛ nkuo na sala. Sɛ bakpa a fa nfɩɛrɛ sɛ wʋjuo n nyina Yosefu. Yosefu wʋjuo n nyina Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli wʋjuo n nyina Matati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Matati wʋjuo n nyina Lewi, Lewi wʋjuo n nyina Meliki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Meliki wʋjuo n nyina Janayi, Janayi wʋjuo n nyina Yosefu.<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefu wʋjuo n nyina Matatiyasi, Matatiyasi wʋjuo n nyina Amosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amosi wʋjuo n nyina Nahum, Nahum wʋjuo n nyina Esili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Esili wʋjuo n nyina Nagayi,<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagayi wʋjuo n nyina Maati, Maati wʋjuo n nyina Matatiyasi, Matatiyasi wʋjuo n nyina Semeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Semeni wʋjuo n nyina Yoseki, Yoseki wʋjuo n nyina Yoda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda wʋjuo n nyina Yowanaŋ, Yowanaŋ wʋjuo n nyina Resa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Resa wʋjuo n nyina Serubabeli, Serubabeli wʋjuo n nyina Salatiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Salatiya, wʋjuo n nyina Neri,<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri wʋjuo n nyina Meliki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Meliki wʋjuo n nyina Adi, Adi wʋjuo n nyina Kosam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosam wʋjuo n nyina Elimadam, Elimadam wʋjuo n nyina Eri.<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eri wʋjuo n nyina Yosuwa, Yosuwa wʋjuo n nyina Eliyasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliyasa wʋjuo n nyina Yorim, Yorim wʋjuo n nyina Matati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Matati wʋjuo n nyina Lewi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lewi wʋjuo n nyina Simiyoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simiyoŋ wʋjuo n nyina Yuda, Yuda wʋjuo n nyina Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yosefu wʋjuo n nyina Yonam, Yonam wʋjuo n nyina Eliyakim,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakim wʋjuo n nyina Meliya, Meliya wʋjuo n nyina Mena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Mena wʋjuo n nyina Matata, Matata wʋjuo n nyina Nataŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Nataŋ wʋjuo n nyina Dawidi,<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dawidi wʋjuo n nyina Yese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Yese wʋjuo n nyina Obedi, Obedi wʋjuo n nyina Bowasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Bowasi wʋjuo n nyina Salimoŋ, Salimoŋ wʋjuo n nyina Naasoŋ,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Naasoŋ wʋjuo n nyina Aminadabi, Aminadabi wʋjuo n nyina Ram,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Ram wʋjuo n nyina Hesiroŋ, Hesiroŋ wʋjuo n nyina Peresi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Peresi wʋjuo n nyina Yuda,<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda wʋ juo n nyina Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yakubu wʋjuo n nyina Isaki, Isaki wʋjuo n nyina Abiraham,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Abiraham wʋjuo n nyina Tara, Tara wʋjuo n nyina Naho,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naho wʋjuo n nyina Serugi, Serugi wʋjuo n nyina Rawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Rawu wʋjuo n nyina Faleki, Faleki wʋjuo n nyina Eberi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Eberi wʋjuo n nyina Sela.<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sela wʋ juo n nyina Kenaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kenaŋ wʋjuo n nyina Afasadi, Afasadi wʋjuo n nyina Sem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Sem wʋjuo n nyina Nowa, Nowa wʋjuo n nyina Lameki,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki wʋjuo n nyina Metusala, Metusala wʋjuo n nyina Enoki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Enoki wʋjuo n nyina Jareti, Jareti wʋjuo n nyina Mahaleli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahaleli wʋjuo n nyina Kenaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kayinani wʋjuo n nyina Enosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enosi wʋjuo n nyina Seti, Seti wʋjuo n nyina Adam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Sɛ Adam wʋjuo n nyina Ɩsʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Sɩtanɩ yɩɛ Yesu lɔ tɩba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matiyo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maakɩ 1:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Gʋ Yesu lɩɩ Yodaŋ buo naŋ kɔŋ na, Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ su wʋ tɩba sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ mʋ ɩ ju ifuli dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ Sɩtanɩ gaa yɩɛ ɩ lɔ tɩba wɩɛ ŋɩla (40). Wʋ n di bʋrʋ dɩmʋŋ gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ŋina kpiniŋ sɛ dusoŋ chaŋ ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Sɛ Sɩtanɩ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɛ nyaŋ n nyina Ɩsʋɔ Bu na, tawɩ bʋɩ gana na gaa bɩrɩŋsɛ adiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba sabɩɛ si Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ naŋ sɛ, &lt;Adiya nyiŋeŋ baa fa wʋkpa nkpa a.&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Ditiro 8:3</ref>.</char></note> &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Sɛ Sɩtanɩ mʋ Yesu ju bʋrɔŋ ga jalɩŋtɛ garɛ dʋɔ sɛ wʋ mʋ tibi dʋɔ juori kpiniŋ kalaa Yesu gabʋanaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa mʋ ŋina dʋɔ yikuo na jilima kpiniŋ fa nyaŋ. Akala takɩɛ ba mʋ ŋina kpiniŋ fa maŋ, maa dɩlɛ mʋ fa wʋkʋma wʋŋ maa jawʋ na. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, sɛ nyaa luuŋ tʋm maŋ na, ŋina kpiniŋ aja yɩɛ n teri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba sabɩɛ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii naŋ sɛ, &lt;Tʋm Kpaŋjuo nya Ɩsʋɔ na nyaa tʋŋ wʋ nyiŋeŋ.&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Ditiro 6:13</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Sɛ Sɩtanɩ ti mʋ Yesu ju Yerusalem dɩɛ naŋ sɛ wʋ mʋ ɩ ga sɩŋ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ adugbe. Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɛ nyaŋ n nyina Ɩsʋɔ Bu na, Puli lɩɩ jɩna ga tala tibi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Akala takɩɛ, ba sabɩɛ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii naŋ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">&lt;&lt;&lt;Ɩsʋɔ aja kpiri wʋ gabʋɔsɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">na baa gaa gara nyaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Baa chaŋ n tɩba ba pamɩɛ naŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">na n nafara n baa baŋ bʋɩ.&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Num 91:11</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba ti sabɩɛ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii naŋ sɛ, n baa yɩɛ Kpaŋjuo nya Ɩsʋɔ lɔ tɩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Gʋ Sɩtanɩ mʋna gbɩɛ kʋma dʋɔ yɩɛ Yesu lɔ tɩba taŋ na, wʋ yela wʋ dana saŋa bam naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu fara wʋ dɩtʋm Galaliya tibi dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matiyo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maakɩ 1:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu bɔrɛ ju Galaliya tibi dʋɔ Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ yikuo naŋ. Sɛ wʋ wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ yalagi tibi gaa dʋɔ gapɩlɛkʋma. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Sɛ Yesu kalaa Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ sɛ wʋkʋma kalɩɛ ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nasaratitina pɩɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matiyo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maakɩ 6:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Sɛ Yesu ju Nasarati diele gaa ba bɩsɛ ɩ na, gʋ fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ talɛ na, wʋ ju Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ ganaŋkʋ wʋ ayɩɛsa akala na. Sɛ wʋ kʋlʋ sɩŋ na wʋ a karaŋ Ɩsʋɔ Wɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Sɛ ba mʋ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ tanɛ gaa ba go ga sɛ Ɩsʋɔ ɔja Yisaya sabɩɛ na fa ɩ. Gʋ wʋ buoli na, wʋ na diele gaa ba sabɩɛ sɛ,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />&lt;&lt;Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ wɩɛ ma dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">akala takɩɛ wʋ lɩsɛ maŋ sɛ maŋ tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ Wɩɛ Abama ŋii fa ayɔŋtina.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Wʋ kpiri maŋ sɛ maŋ ga tawɩ danɛ tʋɔra sɛ baa di ba nyie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">na bataŋpʋna asa a na abʋrɩ na baa baa nyala ba na a di ba nyie.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Wʋ kpiri maŋ sɛ maŋ gaa jɔ dawuta sɛ saŋa gaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">Ɩsʋɔ aja wɩɩ bakpa dʋɔ na talɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Sɛ Yesu go tanɛ gaa mʋ fa Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ kɩɛrɛ sɛ wʋ ga cha. Yela baa ba wɩɛ dɩmaŋ na kpiniŋ a kɩɛ ɩ <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />sɛ Yesu fara wʋ a tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaŋ, Ɩsʋɔ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋina kɔŋ tɩba amɩɛ dɩla naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Sɛ bakpa kpiniŋ tawɩ wʋ wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ abama sɛ dɩ yɩɛ ba doba lɩɩna wɩɩ dʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ lɩɩ wʋ nʋɔ naŋ na. Sɛ ba tasɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Naa Yosefu bu wʋŋ mɩnaŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma jiŋ gʋ ɩ jɔ maŋ diduu sɛ, chʋɔrɛ, chɔ n wʋsɛ! Yɩɛ n dɩɛ naŋ jɩna bʋrʋ gaa dɩ nyii sɛ nya yɩɛ Kapeniyum na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ sɛ n nyii na dieli sɛ baa lɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ ɔja baa di wʋ dɩɛ naŋ ŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />N nyii na dieli, Ɩsʋɔ ɔja Eliya saŋa na, bakʋlapʋna fɔɩ cha ba wɩɛ Isirali tibi dʋɔ. Saŋa gana sɛ ɩwʋlɛ sɩŋ bɩŋsɛ sɩ toro na salɛ sɛ dusoŋ janɛ gaa ga nʋɔ wɩɛ doŋ kɔŋ tibi kpiniŋ dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ama Ɩsʋɔ n kpiri Eliya ju ba wʋrʋ jaŋ ŋ, amʋɔ okulapu wʋrʋ wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛ Sarifata gaa ga wɩɛ Sidoŋ tibi dʋɔ na nyiŋeŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Ɩsʋɔ ɔja Eliya saŋa na, achalaŋa fɔɩ cha ba wɩɛ Isirali tibi dʋɔ, ama naa ba kpiniŋ sɛ wʋ chʋɔ ɔ, amʋɔ Siriya wʋkpa Naaman nyiŋeŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bakpa baa ba wɩɛ Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ na nyii Yesu wɩɛ na, biŋbira chaŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Sɛ ba kʋlʋ ti ɩ lɩɩ dɩɛ gaa naŋ. Mʋ ɩ ju bʋrɔŋ gaa dɩɛ gaa wɩɛ ga dʋɔ na laraŋ na baa ga ti ɩ dʋ ogie naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ama wʋ mʋna jama baa tɩba laŋ.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu gɩŋ Feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ baalɛ wʋrʋ tɩba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maakɩ 1:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yesu ju Kapeniyum dɩɛ gaa ga wɩɛ Galaliya tibi dʋɔ na. Gʋ fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ talɛ na, sɛ wʋ ju Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ ga kalaa bakpa abʋrɩ. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Sɛ wʋ kalaa ŋii yɩɛ ba doba, akala takɩɛ yikuo wɩɛ wʋ wɩɛ ŋii naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Dɩmaŋ gana na, baalɛ wʋrʋ feliŋ sʋbʋ wɩɛ wʋ tɩba wʋ wɩɛ Yudatina tʋm danɛ gaa naŋ sɛ wʋ kuusi sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />&lt;&lt;Ndo! Nyaŋ, Yesu Nasarati wʋkpa, be sɛ nyaa ja daa jaŋ? Nya kɔŋ na nyaa warɩɛ daa bɛ? Ma jiŋ wʋkpa wʋŋ nya yɩɛ na. Nya yɩɛ wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ wʋŋ wʋ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ jaŋ na bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu fuba feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ dʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Fu n nʋɔ dʋɔ na nyaa lɩɩ baalɛ wʋŋ tɩba.&gt;&gt; Feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ jigisi baalɛ wʋŋ sɛ wʋ kuusi na doŋ sɛ wʋ lɩɩ wʋ tɩba. Sɛ feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ kara baalɛ wʋŋ lɔ tibi ba asanaŋ sɛ wʋ lɩɩ wʋ tɩba laŋ yela bʋrʋ n yɩɛ ɩ ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Sɛ dɩ yɩɛ bakpa baa kpiniŋ doba sɛ ba tawɩ fa dɔŋa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be kalaa mɩnaŋ? Wʋ chamɩna yikuo wʋ a fuba feliŋ sʋbʋ dʋɔ yela baa lɩɩ bakpa tɩba&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Dɩ lɩɩ takɩɛ Yesu wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii nyii Galaliya tibi dʋɔ gapɩlɛkʋma.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu chɔ bakpa fɔɩ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matiyo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maakɩ 1:29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Gʋ Yesu lɩɩ Yudatina tʋm danɛ gaa naŋ na, wʋ ju Simoŋ waa dʋɔ. Simoŋ wʋ awu cha wʋ a kili gibirima sɛ ba sʋlʋ Yesu sɛ wʋŋ gaa chɔ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Sɛ wʋ gaa sɩŋ wʋ jaŋ sɛ wʋ tawɩ gibirima gaa sɛ ga n lɩɩ wʋ tɩba, sɛ ga yela ɩ. Sɛ wʋ kʋlʋ fa ba adiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Bʋyanɔ gʋ wiita a ju wʋ a ga sala na, bakpa baa ga mʋ lʋmɩɛtina kpiniŋ baa baa kili lʋmɩɛ ngoriŋ-ngoriŋ mʋ kɔŋ Yesu jaŋ. Sɛ wʋ n mʋ wʋ pam jaga wʋkʋma dʋɔ na wʋ a chɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Gʋ feliŋ sʋbʋ baa a lɩɩ bakpa fɔɩ baa tɩba na, yela baa kuusi sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ n nyina Ɩsʋɔ Bu wʋŋ.&gt;&gt; Ama wʋ jɔ ba nyienaŋ sɛ wʋ n nkpa na baa tawɩ e, akala takɩɛ ba jiŋ gʋ wʋŋ n nyina Kirisito wʋŋ.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Gʋ tɩɛ naa na, Yesu ju ifuli dʋɔ, yela bakpa dɔŋ baa ja ɩ. Gʋ ba na ɩ na, baa ti ja baa fa ɩ gbɩɛ na wʋ a lɩɩ ba jaŋ ŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ama Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ŋɩ tiri gʋ maa tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa Wɩɛ Abama ŋii fa dɩɛsɛ ŋii ŋɩ kakaa na. Akala takɩɛ ŋɩ dʋɔ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ kpiri maŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ Yudiya tibi dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu yagɛ wʋ kpalɛnara asanaŋtina</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matiyo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maakɩ 1:16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Wɩɩ darɛ Yesu sɩmɩɛɩ Jɛnasɛrɛtɩ lɩɩ nʋɔ yela bakpa sɩmɩɛɩ logo ɩ na baa nyii Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Sɛ wʋ na buoriŋ ala lɩɩ nʋɔ ŋii ŋɩ yɩɛ aji chamɩra barɛ n mʋ si, sɛ ba ju baa ga yalɛ ba asawu. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Sɛ wʋ jʋʋ buori garɛ naŋ gaa ga yɩɛ Simoŋ teri na, sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ wʋ n ti ga dʋ chonii. Sɛ wʋ laŋ cha buori gaa tɩba sɛ wʋ kalaa bakpa baa Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Gʋ Yesu tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii fa ba taŋ na, sɛ wʋ tawɩ Simoŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋ n palaa buori gaa ju diele gaa wɩɛ dɩkɩŋ na, na wʋ na wʋ dɔŋa baa lɔ asawu chaŋ aji.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Sɛ Simoŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, dɩ lɔ asawu yuluma kpiniŋ, dɩ n yu bʋrʋ ʋ. Ama ganaŋkʋ nya tawɩ na dʋɔ, maa lɔ asawu gaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Gʋ ba lɔ asawu gaa na, sɛ ba chaŋ aji fɔɩ sɛ ba asawu gaa aja gaa chati. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ba mʋ ba pamɩɛ yɩɛ daasɛ yagɛ ba dɔŋa baa ba wɩɛ buori ga banbaŋ naŋ sɛ ba n gaa chɔna ba. Sɛ ba kɔnɛ, sɛ ba na ba lɩsɛ aji baa dʋ buoriŋ ala ŋii tɩba sɛ ŋɩ suu ŋii ja ŋii muru.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Gʋ Simoŋ Petero na ŋii ŋɩ yɩɛ na, wʋ luuŋ wʋ dʋna dʋɔ Yesu asanaŋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo lɩɩ ma jaŋ. Ma yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛrɛ bɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Aji baa Simoŋ na wʋ dɔŋa baa chaŋ fɔɩ na dʋɔ, dɩ yɩɛ ba doba. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Dɩmʋŋ gba sɛ dɩ yɩɛ Simoŋ wʋ dɔŋa tʋmɩra Jamesi na Yohane Sebedi bie baa doba. Sɛ Yesu tawɩ Simoŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa yɩɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ, lɩɩ jaŋ mʋ a ju, nyaa lɩsɛ bakpa fa Ɩsʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Gʋ ba palaa ba buoriŋ ŋii gaa daŋ lɩɩ nʋɔ wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, ba yela bʋrʋkʋma sɛ ba kpaŋ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu chɔ baalɛ chaalaŋa wʋrʋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matiyo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maakɩ 1:40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Gʋ Yesu wɩɛ Galaliya dɩɛsɛ ŋii garɛ naŋ na, baalɛ wʋŋ gɩchalaŋa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dɩmʋŋ gɩchalaŋa gana yɩɛ lʋm gaa gaa fu wʋkpa dʋɔ ama ga ba yɩɛ gɩchalaŋa a</char></note> fu wʋ wʋsɛ dʋɔ na kɔŋ dɩmaŋ. Gʋ wʋ na Yesu na, wʋ luuŋ wʋ asanaŋ sʋlʋ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, nyaa jawʋ na, nyaa dɩlɛ chɔ maŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Sɛ wʋ tɩɛŋɩ wʋ pam jaga wʋ dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa jawʋ, n wʋsɛ n yɩɛ dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ.&gt;&gt; Gabʋanaŋ sɛ gɩchalaŋa gaa lam.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ wʋ nyinaŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa tawɩ wʋrʋ. Ama mʋ n wʋsɛ ju ga kalaa Ɩsʋɔ sei na nyaa diesi gadiesa ganaŋkʋ Mosesi mbara akala na, na ŋii di seriya takɩɛ nya yu lʋm chʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ama Yesu wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ yalagi gapɩlɛkʋma sɛ dɩ yela sɛ bakpa fɔɩ kɔŋ na baa gaa nyii wʋ wɩɛ na wʋ a chɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ama Yesu a dɩlɛ wʋ a kara wʋ wʋsɛ wʋ a lɩɩ bakpa naŋ wʋ a ju ifuli dʋɔ na wʋ a ga jɔ dɩga.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu chɔ buobi baalɛ wʋrʋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maakɩ 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Wɩɩ darɛ Yesu a kalaa Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ, yela Farasitina na mbara bakalaasa baa ba lɩɩ Galaliya na Yudiya dɩɛsɛ bisi kpiniŋ, na Yerusalem dɩɛ naŋ na chaɩ dɩmaŋ. Na Ɩsʋɔ yikuo wɩɛ wʋ dʋɔ sɛ wʋ n chɔ lʋmɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Sɛ baala barɛ silɛ buobi wʋrʋ kalaŋ dʋɔ baa ja gbɩɛ baa mʋ ɩ jʋʋ waa gaa Yesu wɩɛ ga tɩba na baa mʋ ɩ ga si wʋ asanaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ama jama baa dʋɔ, ba n yu gbɩɛ na baa mʋ ɩ jʋʋ ʋ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ba jiŋ danɛ adugbe fʋrʋ bʋɔ diele gaa wʋ wɩɛ na, sɛ ba tibina ɩ yela wʋ duwei kalaŋ dʋɔ si Yesu asanaŋ jama baa tɩba.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Gʋ Yesu na ba lɩɛdi na wʋ tawɩ baalɛ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma dɩɛtɛ, ma mʋ n dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ Farasitina na mbara bakalaasa baa fa nfɩɛrɛ ba nyienaŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mmʋɔ n nyina wʋkpa wina sɛ wʋ a tawɩ mbusu wɩɛ dɩmʋŋ? Mmʋɔ aaŋ dɩlɛ mʋ dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ? Amʋɔ Ɩsʋɔ nyiŋeŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu jiŋ ba nfɩɛrɛ, sɛ wʋ tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ ɩ fa dɩmʋŋ nfɩɛrɛ ŋina? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Ŋɩ amʋɔ n tamana doŋ, sɛ ma tawɩ sɛ, &lt;Ma mʋ n dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ nyaŋ,&gt; yaa ma tawɩ sɛ, &lt;Kʋlʋ na nyaa pala?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ama ganaŋkʋ aja yela na ɩ jiŋ gʋ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ wɩɛna yikuo tibi dʋɔ sɛ wʋ a dɩlɛ mʋ dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Yesu tawɩ buobi wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ nyaŋ sɛ, kʋlʋ mʋ n kalaŋ na nyaa ju dɩɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Gabʋanaŋ sɛ wʋ kʋlʋ sɩŋ ba asanaŋ, sɛ wʋ mʋ wʋ kalaŋ gaa wʋ duwei ga dʋɔ na yela wʋ a kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Sɛ dɩ yɩɛ wʋkʋma doba sɛ ba kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ. Sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ ba sɛ ba tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩ na doba wɩɛ jaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yagɛ Lewi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matiyo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maakɩ 2:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ŋina wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, Yesu lɩɩ dɩɛ gaa naŋ, sɛ wʋ na lampo lɩɛrɛ wʋrʋ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Lewi wʋ chaɩ lampo danɛ naŋ. Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋ maŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Sɛ Lewi yela bʋrʋkʋma sɛ wʋ kʋlʋ kpaŋ ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Sɛ Lewi yagɛ asadi adiya di janɛ wʋ waa dʋɔ fa Yesu. Sɛ lampo lɩɛra baa fɔɩ na bakpa barɛ na ba a di. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ama Farasitina na Mosesi mbara bakalaasa baa barɛ baa ba kpi Farasitina dikpeŋ dʋɔ na, ba fʋlʋ fa Yesu kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ amɩɛ na lampo lɩɛra na dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra ɩ di ɩ nyʋɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Alaŋfiyatina n tiri lʋm chʋɔrɛ ɛ, amʋɔ lʋmɩɛtina. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ma n kɔŋ na maa gaa yagɛ bachirigisa a. Ama ma kɔŋ na maa gaa yagɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra na baa biliŋi lɩɩ ba dɩsʋbʋ naŋ bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɩɛ tasɛ lɩɩ nʋɔ pɔgʋ dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matiyo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maakɩ 2:18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Sɛ bakpa barɛ tasɛ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yohane kpalɛnara achaŋ nʋɔ pɔgʋ yela baa jɔ dɩga baa fa Ɩsʋɔ dɩmʋŋ sɛ Farasitina kpalɛnara gba a yɩɛ. Ama n kpalɛnara baa bɩrɛ, baa di yela baa nyʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Alʋfɔlɛ baalɛ wʋŋ mʋɔrɛ a chaŋ nʋɔ pɔgʋ yela wʋ wɩɛ ba jaŋ? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ama saŋa gʋrʋ aja kɔŋ baa mʋ alʋfɔlɛ baalɛ wʋŋ lɩɩ ba jaŋ, saŋa gana sɛ baa chaŋ nʋɔ pɔgʋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ ba diduu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋrʋ baa kara dukuru fɔlɛ na wʋ a mʋ tarɛ gabɩnɛ naŋ ŋ. Wʋ yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ na, gaa chati gafɔlɛ gaa sɛ gafɔlɛ gaa na gabɩnɛ gaa baa yɩɛ bʋdʋŋdʋlʋŋ ŋ. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Dɩmʋŋ sɛ wʋrʋ baa mʋ wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ fɔlɛ wʋ a dʋ kpalɛ gabɩnɛ naŋ ŋ. Wʋ yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ na, wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ ŋii aja salɩɛ kpalɛ gaa, na ŋii chɩɛgɩ tʋsʋ. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ŋɩ tiri gʋ ba n mʋ wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ fɔlɛ dʋ kpalɛ gafɔlɛ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Wʋrʋ baa nyʋɔ wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ abɩnɩɛ na wʋ a ti wʋ a ja afɔlɩɛ ɛ. Akala takɩɛ wʋ a tawɩ sɛ sʋlʋŋ gabɩnɛ gaa wɩɛ dieli kii gafɔlɛ gaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ dʋɔ wɩɛ tasɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matiyo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maakɩ 2:23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ garɛ Yesu na wʋ kpalɛnara baa dɔŋ kiliŋgbe fʋɔ garɛ naŋ. Sɛ wʋ kpalɛnara baa fara baa jaɩ kiliŋgbe ŋii ŋarɛ baa tawʋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Sɛ Farasitina baa barɛ tasɛ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be dʋɔ sɛ ɩ yɩɛ ŋii daa mbara n fa gbɩɛ sɛ dɩ n yɩɛ Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩŋ karaŋ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii naŋ ŋii Dawidi yɩɛ saŋa gaa dusoŋ a kʋ wʋ na dɔŋa naa? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Dawidi ju Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ ga tawʋ bodobodo gaa ba yɩɛ ga chɩrɩchɩrɩ fa Ɩsʋɔ yela Mosesi mbara n fa gbɩɛ sɛ ba n tawʋ ʋ, amʋɔ Ɩsʋɔ seina nyiŋeŋ. Sɛ wʋ mʋ ŋarɛ fa wʋ dɔŋa na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Sɛ Yesu ti bɔrɛ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ yɩɛ Kpaŋjuo Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ dʋɔ bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu chɔ pam ga sɩŋsatɛ wʋrʋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matiyo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maakɩ 3:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ ga baŋbaŋ na, Yesu ti bɔrɛ ju Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ ga kalaa. Na Baalɛ wʋrʋ wɩɛ dɩmaŋ wʋ pam jɩsaŋ sɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Farasitina na mbara bakalaasa baa barɛ aja sɛ baa pʋɩ ɩ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ baa pɩɛtɩ ɩ na baa kɩɛ sɛ wʋ a chɔ baalɛ wʋŋ fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ gaa yaa. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ama Yesu jiŋ ba n fɩɛrɛ sɛ wʋ tawɩ pam ga sɩŋsatɛ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kʋlʋ sɩŋ bakpa baa asanaŋ jɩna.&gt;&gt; Sɛ wʋ kʋlʋ sɩŋ.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tasɛ amɩɛ sɛ be sɛ daa mbara fa gbɩɛ sɛ dɩ n yɩɛ fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ? Dɩ n yɩɛ dɩbam yaa dɩsʋbʋ? Dɩ n lɩɛ nkpa yaa dɩ n kʋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Sɛ Yesu kɩɛ ba kpiniŋ logo sɛ wʋ tawɩ baalɛ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Tɩɛŋɩ n pam.&gt;&gt; Sɛ wʋ tɩɛŋɩ sɛ gaa yɩɛ doŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ama biŋbira chaŋ ba sɛ ba fara baa ja ganaŋkʋ baa yɩɛ Yesu na.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu lɩsɛ kpirida gifi bala baa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matiyo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maakɩ 3:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ŋii naŋ na. Yesu ju bʋrɔŋ garɛ dʋɔ na wʋ a ga jɔ dɩga yuluma gana kpiniŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Gʋ tɩɛna na, wʋ yagɛ wʋ kpalɛnara baa kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ ba tɩba gifi bala sɛ wʋ yagɛ ba sɛ kpirida. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Gifi bala baa wʋ yagɛ na ba yɩrɩɛ mɩnaŋ: Simoŋ [wʋŋ Yesu si ɩ yɩrɛ sɛ Petero] na wʋ nabu Andurusi, Jamesi, Yohane, Filipo, Batolomiyo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matiyo, Tomasi, Yakubu Alifiyosi bu, Simoŋ wʋŋ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Sɩlɔtɩ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɩlɔtɩtina ba yɩɛ Yudatina dikpeŋ baa ba kʋlʋ yuo Romatina</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yudasi Yakubu bu, na Yudasi Isikariyoti wʋŋ wʋ lɩsɛ Yesu fa na.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kalaa sɛ wʋ chɔ lʋmɩɛtina</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matiyo 4:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu na wʋ kpalɛnara baa tibi bʋrɔŋ kɔŋ gateŋpireŋ dʋɔ. Na wʋ kpalɛnara fɔɩ baa wɩɛ dɩmaŋ, sɛ bakpa fɔɩ lɩɩ Yudiya tibi dʋɔ gapɩlɛkʋma, Yerusalem dɩɛ naŋ na Tirosi na Sidoŋ ɔpʋ buo nʋɔ, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />kɔŋ na baa gaa nyii wʋ wɩɛ na wʋ a chɔ ba lʋmɩɛ. Sɛ wʋ gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ baa a nyala ba na tɩba. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Sɛ bakpa baa kpiniŋ aja sɛ baa mʋ ba pamɩɛ tapʋ ɩ, akala takɩɛ ba na gʋ yikuo a lɩɩ wʋ tɩba gaa chɔ ba kpiniŋ.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asadi na wʋsɛ yɔgɔsɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matiyo 5:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Sɛ Yesu kɩɛ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">&lt;&lt;Kusee n nyina amɩɛ baa ɩ yɩɛ ayɔŋtina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa yɩɛ amɩɛ teri.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Kusee n nyina amɩɛ baa dusoŋ akʋ amɩɛ dɩtɩɛna gana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">akala takɩɛ amɩɛ aaŋ ja ɩ paa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Kusee n nyina amɩɛ baa ɩ wii dɩtɩɛna gana. Akala takɩɛ amɩɛ aaŋ ja ɩ mʋɩ.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Kusee n nyina amɩɛ baa bakpa akɔla amɩɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">baa lɩsɛ amɩɛ baa lɩɩ ba tɩba, yela baa ti amɩɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">baa yagɛ amɩɛ bakpa sʋbʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="LUK 6:22">Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Saŋa gana naŋ na, n yela na amɩɛ asa a lɩɛ na ɩ sʋyɛ asadi naŋ. Akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ aja tɔ amɩɛ kɩm gajanɛ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe. Dɩmʋŋ sɛ ba kɔla Ɩsʋɔ bajana.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Ama amɩɛ akpaŋtatina, amɩɛ lakʋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">akala takɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ fɩɛ amɩɛ chawʋ naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Amɩɛ baa ɩ di paa dɩtɩɛna gana, amɩɛ lakʋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">akala takɩɛ amɩɛ sɛ dusoŋ aja chaŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Amɩɛ baa ɩ mʋɩwʋ dɩtɩɛna gana, amɩɛ lakʋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">akala takɩɛ ɩ bɔtaa na ɩ wii.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Amɩɛ baa bakpa kpiniŋ a tawɩ wɩɛ abama lɩɩ amɩɛ dʋɔ na, amɩɛ lakʋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">akala takɩɛ dɩmʋŋ sɛ ba duluŋ mʋ yɩɛ akarɩɛ bajana baa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">N ja amɩɛ badʋŋna</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matiyo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama maa tawɩ amɩɛ baa ɩ nyii ma jaŋ na sɛ, n ja amɩɛ badʋŋna na ɩ yɩɛ dɩbam fa baa baa kɔla amɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />N yɩɛ kusee fa baa baa tawɩ amɩɛ nʋɔsɛ, na ɩ jɔ dɩga fa baa baa nyala amɩɛ na. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Sɛ wʋrʋ kpa nyaŋ gabaa na, biliŋi alatɛ fa ɩ. Sɛ wʋrʋ mʋ nya adugbe gagba na, mʋ tie gagba kpi ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Sɛ wʋrʋ sʋlʋ nyaŋ bʋrʋ darɛ na fa ɩ, sɛ wʋrʋ mʋ n bʋrʋ na, n baa lɩɛ lɩɩ wʋ jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />N yɩɛ fa amɩɛ dɔŋa ganaŋkʋ ɩ ja sɛ ba n yɩɛ fa amɩɛ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɛ ɩ ja baa baa ja amɩɛ nyiŋeŋ na, yɩrɛ bam gamʋɔ sɛ ɩ yu? Dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra gba a yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Sɛ ɩ yɩɛ dɩbam fa baa baa yɩɛ amɩɛ dɩbam nyiŋeŋ na, yɩrɛ bam gamʋɔ sɛ ɩ yu? Dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra gba a yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Sɛ ɩ mʋ kɩŋ baa ɩ wɩɛna tamaa sɛ baa gaa tɔ amɩɛ na, yɩrɛ bam gamʋɔ sɛ ɩ yu, dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra gba a yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ama amɩɛ bɩrɛ n ja amɩɛ badʋŋna na ɩ yɩɛ dɩbam yɩɛ fa ba. Ɩ mʋ kɩŋ ba na, n baa kɩɛ gbɩɛ sɛ baa gaa tɔ amɩɛ. Ŋii sɛ Ɩsʋɔ aja tɔ amɩɛ kɩmtʋɔ gajanɛ, na ɩ yɩɛ Wʋjanɛ wʋŋ bie. Akala takɩɛ wʋ a yɩɛ dɩbam wʋ a fa baa ba asa baa su abʋrɩ na nyinaŋ doŋtina. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />N wɩɩ bakpa gɩyɔŋ takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ amɩɛ Juo gba a wɩɩ bakpa gɩyɔŋ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">M ba fu n dʋɔ dɩpʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa kpaala di wɩɛ na ɩ tawɩ sɛ wʋrʋ yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛrɛ, na Ɩsʋɔ gba a tawɩ amɩɛ dɩmʋŋ. N baa fu dɩpʋɛ na Ɩsʋɔ gba n baa fu amɩɛ dɩpʋɛ. N mʋ dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ na wʋ a mʋ amɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ amɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />N fa na Ɩsʋɔ a fa amɩɛ. Ɩsʋɔ aja wʋ a mʋ mudu kalaa na ŋii su, na wʋ a jigisi na ŋii tʋsʋ, na wʋ a mʋ dʋ amɩɛ chamaŋsɛ naŋ. Akala takɩɛ mudu gaa ɩ mʋ kalaa bʋrʋ darɛ fa wʋrʋ na, gaa sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gba aja wʋ a mʋ kalaa fa amɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ ba diduu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔtaŋpʋ a dɩlɛ pala ɔtaŋpʋ asanaŋ? Baa bala baa sala dɩchabʋɔ naŋ? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kpalɛnarɛ baa kii wʋkalaasa a, ama wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ kpalɩɛna sɛ wʋ jiŋ na dieli na, a dɩlɛ yɩɛ takɩɛ wʋkalaasa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ nyaa kɩɛ kabie gaa ga jagaɩ n dʋɔ dɩsɛ dʋɔ, ama dakpie gaa ga jagaɩ n tɩŋtɩŋ nya dɩsɛ dʋɔ na bɩrɛ, nyaa na a? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Sɩnɛ sɛ nyaa dɩlɛ tawɩ n dʋɔ sɛ, &lt;Ma dɩɛtɛ, yela maa lɩsɛ kabie gaa ga jagaɩ n dɩsɛ dʋɔ.&gt; Yela dakpie gaa ga jagaɩ n tɩŋtɩŋ n dɩsɛ dʋɔ na bɩrɛ nyaa na a. Nyaŋ aluguusitɛ, chɩŋkpɩɛ lɩsɛ dakpie gaa ga jagaɩ n tɩŋtɩŋ n dɩsɛ dʋɔ na pɔɩ na nyaa dɩlɛ na na dieli, na nyaa lɩsɛ kabie gaa ga jagaɩ n dʋɔ dɩsɛ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daŋ na ga bie</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matiyo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Daŋ bam baa si bie sʋbʋ ʋ yaa daŋ sʋbʋ baa si bie abama a. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Daŋ kʋma ga bie sɛ ba chamɩna baa jiŋ ga. Bakpa baa kɔ ponponsi bie lɩɩ sɔba daŋ dʋɔ ɔ yaa dikutu lɩɩ didiŋpo daŋ dʋɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Wʋkpa bam a fa nfɩɛrɛ abama sɛ wʋ a yɩɛ bʋrʋ bam. Dɩmʋŋ sɛ wʋkpa sʋbʋ a fa nfɩɛrɛ sʋbʋ sɛ wʋ a yɩɛ bʋrʋ sʋbʋ. Akala takɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ suu wʋkpa digela naŋ na, ŋii aaŋ lɩɩna wʋ nʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Danɛ mara bala barɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matiyo 7:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ ɩ yagɛ maŋ Kpaŋjuo, Kpaŋjuo, ama ɩɩ di ma wɩɛ dʋɔ? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Maa kalaa amɩɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a kɔŋ ma jaŋ, sɛ wʋ a nyii ma wɩɛ sɛ wʋ aa di ma wɩɛ dʋɔ na, ganaŋkʋ wʋ kɩɛna na. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Wʋ kɩɛna bɛ takɩɛ wʋkpa wʋŋ wʋ a ma danɛ sɛ wʋ wuru ju tie sɛ wʋ si tie dɩpɔrɛ jaga bʋɛ dʋɔ. Duoni janɛ nɩɛ sɛ buo suu sɛ ɔjalɛ gaa jɔ danɛ gaa, ama ga n dɩlɛ salɩɛ ga a, akala takɩɛ wʋ ma ga na dieli. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ama wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ nyii ma wɩɛ sɛ wʋ n di ŋɩ dʋɔ ɔ, kɩɛna bɛ takɩɛ baalɛ wʋrʋ wʋŋ wʋ n si tie dɩpɔrɛ pɔɩ sɛ wʋ ma wʋ danɛ jaga tɩɛra dʋɔ na. Duoni janɛ nɩɛ sɛ buo su sɛ ɔjalɛ gaa jɔ danɛ gaa sɛ ga salɩɛ kpiniŋ-kpiniŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu chɔ Roma yuora bɩnɛ wʋrʋ tʋmɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matiyo 8:5-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Gʋ Yesu tawɩ ŋina kpiniŋ fa bakapa baa taŋ na, wʋ bɔrɛ ju Kapeniyum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ Roma yuora gafie bɩnɛ wʋrʋ wʋ tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ wʋ a ja wʋ wɩɛ fɔɩ na a kili wʋ a ja wʋ a sɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Gʋ yuora gafie bɩnɛ wʋŋ nyii Yesu dʋɔ na, wʋ kpiri Yudatina bɩnɩɛ barɛ wʋ jaŋ ga sʋlʋ ɩ sɛ wʋ n kɔŋ gaa chɔ wʋ tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Gʋ ba kɔŋ Yesu jaŋ na, sɛ ba mʋ dɩsɛ chɩbɛ sʋlʋ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ wina daga na nyaa chɔna ɩ, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />akala takɩɛ wʋ a ja daa Yudatina wɩɛ, sɛ wʋ ma daa tʋm danɛ fa daa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ Yesu na ba mʋ gbɩɛ baa ju. Gʋ ba tirina waa gaa na, sɛ yuora gafie bɩnɛ wʋŋ kpiri wʋ dɩɛtina sɛ ba n ju ga tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, n baa nyala nya wʋsɛ. Akala takɩɛ ma n daga nyaa kɔŋ ma waa dʋɔ ɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ma na ma wʋsɛ sɛ maŋ n daga na maa kɔŋ n jaŋ ŋ. Ama tawɩ wɩɛ, ma tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ aja yu alaŋfiya. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Akala takɩɛ ma tɩŋtɩŋ ma wɩɛ bɩnɩɛ tie, sɛ maŋ gba ma wɩɛna yuora ma tie. Ma tawɩ ba tɩba wʋrʋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ju na wʋ a ju sɛ ma tawɩ wʋ baŋbaŋ sɛ &lt;kɔŋ na wʋ a kɔnɛ. Sɛ ma tawɩ ma tʋmɩrɛ sɛ yɩɛ ŋina&gt; na wʋ a yɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Gʋ Yesu nyii wɩɛ ŋina na, dɩ yɩɛ ɩ doba. Sɛ wʋ biliŋi kɩɛ jama baa ba kpamɩna ɩ na tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ n nyii na dieli sɛ, ma n naa ta wʋrʋ Isiralitina naŋ wʋ wɩɛna lɩɛdi gana duluŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Sɛ kpirida baa bɔrɛ ju dɩɛ ga na gʋ tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ yu alaŋfiya.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu fensi okulapu wʋrʋ bu baalɛ jaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Gʋ Yesu chɔ Roma yuora bɩnɛ tʋmɩrɛ wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, wʋ ju dɩɛ gaa baa yagɛ sɛ Nayin. Sɛ wʋ kpalɛnara na jama baa kpaŋ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Gʋ Yesu tirina dɩɛ gaa na, kɩɛ, wʋ na gʋ ba siana atatɛ wʋrʋ baa ju baa wuu. Atatɛ wʋŋ yɩɛ okulapu wʋŋ bu baalɛ jaŋ wʋ dʋŋdʋlʋŋ bɛ yela jama baa ba lɩɩ dɩɛ gaa naŋ na kpamɩna okulapu wʋŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Gʋ Kpaŋjuo na okulapu wʋŋ na, wʋ wɩɛ yɩɛ ɩ gɩyɔŋ sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa wii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Sɛ Yesu mʋ wʋ pam tapʋ atatɛ dɩdaka gaa sɛ sɩlɛda baa dʋɔ sɩŋ, sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yeleŋbu, ma sɛ, kʋlʋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Sɛ atatɛ wʋŋ kʋlʋ cha sɛ wʋ fara wʋ a tawɩ. Sɛ Yesu mʋ ɩ fa wʋnaa.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ bakpa baa kpiniŋ sɛ ba mʋ kalɩɛwʋ fa Ɩsʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩsʋɔ ɔja wʋjanɛ kɔŋ daa jaŋ. Ɩsʋɔ kɔŋ gaa bʋɔ wʋ bakpa dʋɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Sɛ Yesu wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii yalagi Yudiya tibi dʋɔ na dɩɛsɛ ŋii ŋɩ logo dɩmaŋ na kpiniŋ.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ kpiri kpirida Yesu jaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matiyo 11:2-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Yohane kpalɛnara baa tawɩ ŋii Yesu yɩɛ na kpiniŋ fa ɩ. Sɛ wʋ yagɛ ba tɩba bala, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />sɛ wʋ kpiri ba Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ jaŋ sɛ ba n ga tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ n nyina wʋŋ wʋ a kɔnɛ na yaa dɩ n kɩɛ wʋ fɔlɛ gbɩɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Gʋ bala baa kɔŋ Yesu jaŋ na, ba tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ n kpiri daa sɛ dɩ n kɔŋ n jaŋ na dɩ gaa tasɛ nyaŋ sɛ nyaŋ n nyina wʋŋ wʋ a kɔnɛ na yaa dɩ n kɩɛ wʋ fɔlɛ gbɩɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Dɩmʋŋ saŋa gana na, Yesu chɔ lʋmɩɛ na baa a bɩɩ ba na fɔɩ, wʋ gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ bakpa tɩba, sɛ wʋ fulu bataŋpʋna fɔɩ asa. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ Yohane kpirida baa nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N bɔrɛ ju ga tawɩ Yohane ŋii ɩ naa na ŋii ɩ nyii na sɛ bataŋpʋna asa fulu, buobi aba palɛ, achalaŋa yu lʋm chʋɔ, akpawu a nyii wɩɛ, atatina feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ, sɛ ayɔŋtina gba nyii Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ abama ŋii. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Kusee n nyina wʋkʋma wʋŋ ma dʋɔ wʋ aa yela wʋ lɩɛdi naŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Gʋ Yohane kpirida baa bɔrɛ laŋ wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, Yesu fara wʋ a tawɩ Yohane wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ wʋ a fa jama baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Gʋ ɩ ju Yohane jaŋ ifuli dʋɔ na, be sɛ ɩ ju ga kɩɛ? Ɩ ju ga kɩɛ ŋmɩrɛ ŋii feliŋ a jʋɔ naa? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Sɛ naa dɩmʋŋ na, be sɛ ɩ ju ga kɩɛ? Yaa baalɛ wʋŋ wʋ fuona gagbasɛ abama naa? Aye, baa ba fuona gagbasɛ ŋii ŋɩ yawʋ wɩɛ doŋ sɛ ba cha ɩ chawʋ bam na wɩɛ juori-gbɩɛ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Be sɛ ɩ ju ga kɩɛ? Ɩsʋɔ ɔja? Gasiŋteŋ, maa tawɩ amɩɛ, n nyii na dieli sɛ Yohane wʋŋ ɩ naa na, kii Ɩsʋɔ ɔja. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Yohane wina wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ sɛ ba sabɩɛ si Ɩsʋɔ Wɩɛ naŋ, sɛ Ɩsʋɔ tawɩ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">&lt;&lt;Kɩɛ, maa kpiri ma gabʋɔ pala nya asanaŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">na wʋ a desina gbɩɛ si fa nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yohane yɩɛ wʋjanɛ kii wʋkʋma wʋŋ ba lʋrʋ ɩ. Ama wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ wʋ pii Ɩsʋɔ juori naŋ na, kii ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bakpa kpiniŋ na lampo lɩɛra baa ba nyii Yesu wɩɛ na, ba lɩɛ kpa sɛ Ɩsʋɔ wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛ duwei ŋɩ gbɩɛ dʋɔ na yela sɛ Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ wʋŋ sɔ ba Ɩsʋɔ sɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ama Farasitina na mbara bakalaasa baa pɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ jawʋ ŋii wʋ wɩɛna fa ba na. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, ba n yela Yohane a sɔ ba Ɩsʋɔ sɔ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be sɛ maa mʋ jaŋ gɩnanaŋ gana bakpa mʋ kɩɛsɛ na? Ba kɩɛna takɩɛ be? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ba kɩɛna bɛ takɩɛ bachaasɛ baa ba chaɩ gɩyɩɛ naŋ baa yagɛ dɔŋa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">&lt;&lt;Dɩ fʋlʋ galɩɛbɩ fa amɩɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">ama ɩŋ sʋɛ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Dɩ kpie lie numba fa amɩɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">ama ɩŋ wii i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Gʋ Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ wʋŋ kɔnɛ na, wʋ n di adiya a, sɛ wʋ n nyʋɔ sʋlʋŋ ŋ, sɛ ɩ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Feliŋ sʋbʋ wɩɛ wʋ tɩba. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ kɔnɛ na, wʋ a di sɛ wʋ a nyʋɔ, sɛ ɩ tawɩ sɛ, n kɩɛ, wʋ yɩɛ diiri na sʋlʋŋ nyʋɔrɛ. Wʋ yɩɛ lampo lɩɛra na dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra ba dɩɛtɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Bakpa baa ba wɩɛna Ɩsʋɔ kpiŋjim na lɩɛ dʋ sɛ ŋɩ wɩɛ dieli.<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alʋ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛrɛ wʋrʋ mʋ nuŋ alifeŋsa susaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Farasitina baa tɩba wʋrʋ yagɛ Yesu sɛ wʋ n kɔŋ na baa di, sɛ wʋ ju Farasi wʋkpa wʋŋ waa dʋɔ ga cha na wʋ a di. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Alʋ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛrɛ wʋrʋ wɩɛ dɩɛ gana naŋ dɩmaŋ. Gʋ wʋ nyii sɛ Yesu wɩɛ Farasi wʋkpa wʋŋ waa dʋɔ wʋ a di na, wʋ mʋ sapɩɛ bie gaa nuŋ alifeŋsa wɩɛ ga tɩba kɔŋ dɩmaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Sɛ alʋ wʋŋ lɩɩ Yesu wʋrʋgbɩɛ gaa sɩŋ wʋ nafara tie wʋ a wii asa lɩŋ wʋ a wʋrʋgɩ wʋ nafara dʋɔ. Sɛ wʋ mʋ wʋ nyi nyʋɔsɛ kpaɩ, puga ɩ sɛ wʋ chɩɛgɩ nuŋ alifeŋsa ŋii wʋrʋgɩ dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Gʋ Farasi wʋkpa wʋŋ wʋ yagɛ Yesu na dɩmʋŋ na, wʋ tawɩ wʋ nyinaŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ baalɛ wina yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ ɔja na, nafʋɔ wʋ a jiŋ alʋ wʋ dʋŋdʋlʋŋ wʋŋ wʋ tapʋ ɩ na sɛ wʋ yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Simoŋ, ma wɩɛna wɩɛ ŋarɛ maa tawɩ nyaŋ.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Simoŋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa tawɩ maŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ ba diduu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baala bala barɛ n chamɩna aterembie kɩmɩrɛ wʋrʋ kɩm. Wʋrʋ chamɩna ɩ kɩm aterembie dinari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinari yɩɛ dɩtʋm yɩɛrɛ wiita bɩɩ kɩmtʋɔ</char></note> gafɩsɩ sɩ nuŋ, sɛ wʋrʋ dʋɔ ŋɩla na salaa. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ba tɩba wʋrʋ n dɩlɛ yu aterembie ŋii ju ga tɔ ɩ kɩm m. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ mʋ ba kɩmɩɛ ŋii chɩɛ baa bala. Ba tɩba wʋ Mmʋɔ, aaŋ ja wʋ a ja aterembie kɩmɩrɛ wʋŋ wɩɛ fɔɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Sɛ Simoŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tamaa sɛ wʋŋ wʋ kɩm bɔlɩɛɩ na.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nya lɩsɛ nʋɔ na dieli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Sɛ Yesu biliŋi kɩɛ alʋ wʋŋ sɛ wʋ tawɩ Simoŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nya na alʋ wina? Gʋ ma kɔŋ nya waa dʋɔ na, nyaŋ fa maŋ lɩŋ na maa yalɛ ma nafara tie e. Ama alʋ wina bɩrɛ, wʋ mʋ wʋ asa lɩŋ yalɛ ma nafara tie sɛ wʋ mʋ wʋ nyi nyʋɔsɛ kpaɩ. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Nya n puga maŋ ŋ, ama alʋ wina bɩrɛ, lɩɩ saŋa gaa ma kɔŋ jɩna na, wʋ aa yela ma nafara tie puga a. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Nya n mʋ olifi nuŋ wʋrʋgɩ ma nyinaŋ ŋ, ama alʋ wina mʋ nuŋ alifeŋsa wʋrʋgɩ ma nafara dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ŋina dʋɔ, maa tawɩ nyaŋ sɛ ma mʋ wʋ dɩsʋbʋ fɔɩ ŋii chɩɛ ɩ, akala takɩɛ wʋ a ja maŋ fɔɩ. Ama wʋŋ wʋ mʋ wʋ dɩsʋbʋ pii chɩɛ ɩ na, wʋŋ gba wʋ jawʋ yɩɛ pii bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ alʋ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma mʋ n dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Sɛ baa ba kpi wʋ dʋɔ didiitiŋ dɩmaŋ na tawɩ dɔŋa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mmʋɔ n nyina wina bɛ sɛ wʋ a mʋ dɩsʋbʋ wʋ a chɩɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ alʋ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N lɩɛdi lɩɛ nya nkpa. Pala wʋsɛfɩɛ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ala barɛ baa ba kpaŋ Yesu na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ŋina wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, Yesu pala dɩɛsɛ ajanɩɛ na dɩɛsɛ bisi naŋ, wʋ a tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa dʋɔ Wɩɛ Abama ŋii. Na wʋ kpalɛnara gifi bala baa cha kpi wʋ dʋɔ, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />dɩmʋŋ sɛ ala barɛ baa wʋ cha gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ ba tɩba, na baa wʋ chɔ ba lʋmɩɛ. Ala bana barɛ n nyina Mariya [wʋŋ baa yagɛ sɛ Magadalini] sɛ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩkaarɛ n cha lɩɩ wʋ tɩba na. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yowana, Kusa alʋ wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ kɩɛra bɩnɛ na, Susana na fɔɩ baa ba kakaa na. Dɩmʋŋ ala bana n chamɩna ba tɩŋtɩŋ ba abʋrɩ baa tʋm Yesu na wʋ kpalɛnara.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farada barɛ dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matiyo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maakɩ 4:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Gʋ bakpa fɔɩ lɩɩ akpie dʋɔ akpie dʋɔ kɔŋ gaa sila Yesu jaŋ na, sɛ wʋ jɔ ba diduu sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Farɩdɛ wʋrʋ n ju na wʋ a ga ŋmati wʋ adiya bie. Gʋ wʋ a ŋmati na, bie ŋii ŋarɛ sala gbɩɛ laraŋ sɛ bakpa pala ŋɩ dʋɔ sɛ jimbisi kɔŋ gaa tɔɔsɩ ŋɩ kpiniŋ di. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Sɛ ŋarɛ sala bʋɛ ŋii tɩɛra n bɔla dʋɔ ɔ. Ŋɩ tu sɛ ŋɩ sɩŋ. Akala takɩɛ ŋɩ n yu tibi ga fɩɛsa a. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Sɛ ŋarɛ dʋɔ sala sɔba tibi dʋɔ sɛ sɔba na adiya bie ŋii tu bʋga, ama sɔba ŋii bɩɩ ŋɩrɛ ŋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Dɩmʋŋ sɛ ŋarɛ dʋɔ sala tibi bam dʋɔ. Ŋɩ tu bɩɩ sɛ ŋɩ si bie gafie kii ŋii wʋ ŋmati na.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛna dɩla na, wʋ n nyii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Sɛ Yesu kpalɛnara baa tasɛ ɩ diduu gaa tie. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ bɩrɛ, wʋ mʋ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa asiri wɩɛ ŋii kalaa amɩɛ, ama baa ba kakaa na bɩrɛ, aduuna naŋ sɛ ma mʋ tawɩ fa ba.&gt;&gt; Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">&lt;&lt;Baa kɩɛ bɩrɛ ama baa na a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">baa nyii ama baa nyii tie e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalaa faradɛ wʋŋ diduu gaa tie</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matiyo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maakɩ 4:13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Diduu gaa tie n nyina sɛ, adiya bie ŋii n nyina Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Adiya bie ŋii ŋɩ sala gbɩɛ naŋ na n nyina baa ba nyii Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ na, sɛ Sɩtanɩ a gaa lɩsɛ lɩɩ ba agela naŋ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ba n dɩlɛ lɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii di na ba yu nkpa a. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Sɛ ŋii ŋɩ sala bʋɛ tibi dʋɔ na n nyina baa ba nyii Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ, sɛ baa mʋ asadi mʋ lɩɛ ŋɛ bʋdʋŋdʋlʋŋ. Ama gʋ wɩɛ ŋii n pɩsɛ ba agela naŋ dʋɔ baa sala ba lɩɛ di naŋ. Lɔ tɩba kɔŋ ba dʋɔ na, sɛ baa kena ba lɩɛdi naŋ yela. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Bie ŋii ŋɩ sala sɔba tibi dʋɔ na n nyina baa ba nyii Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ, ama ba yela sɛ chawʋ naŋ wɩɛ bisi, dulunya abʋrɩ jawʋ, na asadi dʋɔ baa dɩlɛ baa bɩɩ ba lɩɛ di naŋ ŋ. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Sɛ ŋii ŋɩ sala tibi bam dʋɔ na n nyina baa ba mʋ digela bam lɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii sɛ baa di ŋɩ dʋɔ. Baa sɩŋ na doŋ sɛ baa si bie.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fitila dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maakɩ 4:21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋrʋ baa tʋ fitila na wʋ a mʋ dinyiŋkpa fu ga dʋɔ yaa wʋ a mʋ dʋ mpa tie e. Ama wʋ a mʋ jaga fitila dɩjagatɩŋ bɛ na gaa ŋmaŋi fa baa baa jʋʋ waa gaa dʋɔ na. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Akala takɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ wɩsaɩ na, ŋii lɩɩ na baa na. Dɩmʋŋ sɛ bʋrʋkʋma gaa ba fu ga dʋɔ na, gaa fulu dʋɔ na baa na. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, n kɩɛ na dieli lɩɩna wɩɛ ŋii ɩ nyii na dʋɔ. Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛna bʋrʋ garɛ na, Ɩsʋɔ aja mʋ ŋarɛ kpi wʋ dʋɔ. Ama wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ tana na, pii ŋii wʋ wɩɛna ŋɛ na, Ɩsʋɔ aja lɩɛ lɩɩ wʋ jaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wʋnaa na wʋnabie</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matiyo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maakɩ 3:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Sɛ Yesu wʋnaa na wʋnabie kɔŋ baa ja ɩ. Ama jama baa dʋɔ, ba n yu gbɩɛ ju wʋ jaŋ ŋ. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Sɛ wʋrʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnaa na nnabie sɩmɩɛɩ waa gaa asanaŋ baa ja baa na nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Manaa na manabie n nyina baa baa nyii Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ sɛ baa di ŋɩ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu fʋba apaa sɛ ŋɩ yeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Wɩɩ darɛ Yesu tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;N yela dɩ tɩɛsɛ lɩɩ gaa ju gatɩɛsa, sɛ ba jʋʋ buori naŋ sɛ ba laŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Gʋ baa ju na, Yesu duo asoroŋ. Sɛ feliŋ janɛ jɔ lɩɩ gaa dʋɔ sɛ dɩ jɔ apaa dʋ buori gaa naŋ hali ga ja gaa muru sɛ ba dɩsɛ chɩbɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Sɛ wʋ kpalɛnara baa feŋsi ɩ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, Kpaŋjuo, dɩ ja dɩ muru.&gt;&gt; Sɛ wʋ kʋlʋ fʋba feliŋ na apaa ŋii dʋɔ sɛ ŋɩ n cha kuruŋ sɛ ŋɩ cha kuruŋ. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Sɛ wʋ tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ lɩɛdi wɩɛ le?&gt;&gt; Sɛ dɩ yɩɛ ba doba sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ ba, sɛ ba tasɛ dɔŋa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkpa wʋ Mmʋɔ mɩnaŋ sɛ wʋ a fʋba sɛ apaa na lɩŋ a nyii wʋ jaŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ baalɛ wʋrʋ tɩba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matiyo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maakɩ 5:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu na wʋ kpalɛnara baa tɩɛsɛ Galaliya lɩɩ ju gatɩɛsa gaa ga wɩɛ Gerasa tibi dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Gʋ Yesu lɩɩ buori gaa naŋ na, dɩmaŋ sɛ baalɛ wʋrʋ wʋŋ wʋ lɩɩ dɩɛ gaa naŋ, sɛ feliŋ sʋbʋ wɩɛ wʋ tɩba na kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ. Baalɛ wina pala diboloŋ taŋgɩlɛ, wʋ aa cha waa dʋɔ ɔ, ama bʋɔsɛ naŋ sɛ wʋ chaɩ. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Gʋ wʋ na Yesu na, wʋ kuusi sɛ wʋ se gaa luuŋ wʋ dʋna dʋɔ wʋ asanaŋ, sɛ wʋ kuusi tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesu, Ɩsʋɔ Wʋjanɛ Bu. Be sɛ maŋ na nyaŋ wɩɛna dɩ yɩɛ? Maa sʋlʋ nyaŋ, n baa nyala maŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Wʋ tawɩ dɩmʋŋ, akala takɩɛ Yesu dʋ feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ baalɛ wʋŋ tɩba.&gt;&gt; Ŋɩ wɩɛ takɩɛ baa mʋ dɩgbaraŋgbaraŋ pɔgʋ wʋ pamɩɛ na nafara yela baa gara ɩ bɩrɛ. Ama saŋa kʋma gaa feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ aja jigisi wʋ wʋsɛ na, wʋ a karɩɛ agbaraŋgbaraŋ ŋii, sɛ ŋii mʋ ɩ ju ifuli dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ɩ sɛ &lt;&lt;Sɩnɛ sɛ baa yagɛ nyaŋ?&gt;&gt; Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Bɔlɩŋ&gt;&gt; Akala takɩɛ feliŋ sʋbʋ bɔlɩɛɩ ma tɩba. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Sɛ feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ sʋlʋ ɩ sɛ wʋ n baa dʋ ba na baa ga jʋʋ bʋɔ gaa ga taŋ gɩtɛ na naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Na ɔvaaba barɛ wɩɛ bʋrɔŋ garɛ jaŋ baa di. Sɛ feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ sʋlʋ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Gɩŋ daa na dɩ ga jʋʋ ɔvaaba dikpeŋ baa tɩba.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Yesu fa ba gbɩɛ sɛ ba lɩɩ baalɛ wʋŋ tɩba ga jʋʋ ɔvaaba baa tɩba. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Gʋ feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ lɩɩ baalɛ wʋŋ tɩba ga jʋʋ ɔvaaba baa tɩba na, sɛ ba tibi bʋrɔŋ se ga jʋʋ lɩɩ naŋ sɛ ba sɩŋ.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Gʋ ɔvaaba baa kɩɛra na ŋii ŋɩ tibi na, ba se ju dɩɛ gaa naŋ na fʋɔsɛ naŋ ga tawɩ wɩɛ ŋii fa bakpa. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, bakapa ju ga kɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ tibi na. Gʋ ba kɔŋ Yesu jaŋ na, ba na baalɛ wʋŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ fɔɩ cha ba wɩɛ wʋ tɩba na kparɛ wʋ fuona gagba wʋ chaɩ Yesu jaŋ, sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Baa ba na ŋii ŋɩ tibi na, ba kalaa fa baa ba kɔŋ dɩmaŋ na ganaŋkʋ Yesu chɔ baalɛ wʋŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ wɩɛ wʋ tɩba na. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Sɛ bakpa baa ba chaɩ Gerasa tibi dʋɔ kpiniŋ sʋlʋ Yesu sɛ wʋ n lɩɩ ba tibi dʋɔ. Akala takɩɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ fɔɩ chaŋ ba. Sɛ Yesu jʋʋ buori naŋ laŋ.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Sɛ baalɛ wʋŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ wʋ tɩba na sʋlʋ Yesu sɛ wʋ a kpaŋ ɩ. Sɛ Yesu pɩɛ sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />&lt;&lt;Bɔrɛ ju n dɩɛ naŋ na nyaa ga tawɩ ŋii Ɩsʋɔ yɩɛ fa nyaŋ na.&gt;&gt; Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ baalɛ wʋŋ bɔrɛ ju ga tawɩ ŋii Yesu yɩɛ fa ɩ na dɩɛ gaa kpiniŋ naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu feŋsi galibie wʋŋ wʋ sɩŋ na, sɛ wʋ chɔ alʋ wʋŋ asima a jɔyɩ na</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matiyo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maakɩ 5:21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Gʋ Yesu na wʋ kpalɛnara bɔrɛ tɩɛsɛ kɔŋ gatɩɛsa na, jama baa yɩɛ ɩ nsa-nsa, akala takɩɛ ba kɩɛna wʋ gbɩɛ bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ bɩnɛ wʋrʋ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Yariyosi kɔŋ gaa luuŋ Yesu nafara tie, sɛ wʋ sʋlʋ ɩ sɛ wʋŋ kɔŋ wʋ waa dʋɔ, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />akala takɩɛ mabu galibie wʋ dʋŋdʋlʋŋ wʋŋ wʋ a yɩɛ bɩŋsɛ gifi ala na aja wʋ a sɩŋ. Gʋ Yesu a ju na, jama baa a gɩŋtɩ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Alʋ wʋrʋ asima ajɔyɩ bɩŋsɛ gifi ala sɛ wʋrʋ n dɩlɛ chɔ ɩ na cha wʋ wɩɛ dɩmaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Wʋ lɩɩ Yesu wʋrʋgbɩɛ sɛ wʋ tapʋ wʋ adugbe gagba nʋɔ, gabʋanaŋ sɛ asima ŋii ŋii jɔ ɩ na kena yela.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mmʋɔ n tapʋ maŋ?&gt;&gt; Sɛ ba kpiniŋ ba pɩɛ sɛ naa baa a. Sɛ Petero tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, jama logo nyaŋ baa gɩŋtɩ nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ama Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋrʋ tapʋ maŋ, akala takɩɛ wʋ jiŋ wʋ wʋsɛ naŋ gʋ yikuo ŋarɛ lɩɩ wʋ tɩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Alʋ wʋŋ na gʋ wʋ aa dɩlɛ wɩsɛ wʋ wʋsɛ ɛ, sɛ wʋ mʋ wʋsɛ selesi gaa luuŋ Yesu nafara tie. Sɛ wʋ tawɩ bakpa baa kpiniŋ asanaŋ bʋrʋ gaa dʋɔ sɛ wʋ tapʋ ɩ na, na ganaŋkʋ gabʋanaŋ wʋ yu alaŋfiya na. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Alʋ, n lɩɛdi chɔ nyaŋ. Pala wʋsɛfɩɛ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Gʋ Yesu saŋ wʋ a tawɩ na, wʋrʋ lɩɩ Yarosi wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ bɩnɛ na waa dʋɔ kɔŋ gaa tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nbu galibie sɩŋ. N baa ti nyala wʋkalaasa wʋŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Gʋ Yesu nyii wɩɛ ŋii na, sɛ wʋ tawɩ Yariyosi sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa yela nyɩŋtɩɛ a chaŋ nyaŋ, nyaŋ bɩrɛ lɩɛ di, wʋ a yu lʋm chʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Gʋ wʋ ga tala Yariyosi waa dʋɔ na, wʋ n yela wʋrʋ a jʋʋ kpi wʋ dʋɔ ɔ amʋɔ Petero, Yohane na Jamesi na galibie wʋŋ lʋrʋda. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bakpa baa kpiniŋ cha baa wii yela baa yɩyɩɛ. Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;N yela wiiniŋ, wʋ n sɩŋ ŋ, ama wʋ duo bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Sɛ bakpa baa kpiniŋ mʋɩ ɩ, akala takɩɛ ba jiŋ gʋ galibie wʋŋ sɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Sɛ Yesu chaŋ atatɛ wʋŋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mabu, kʋlʋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Sɛ wʋ sʋbʋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ wʋ tɩba, gabʋanaŋ sɛ wʋ kʋlʋ. Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ n ja adiya fa ɩ na wʋ a di. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Sɛ dɩ yɩɛ wʋ lʋrʋda baa doba, ama wʋ dʋ ba sɛ ba n baa tawɩ wʋrʋ bʋrʋ gaa ga tibi na.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kpiri wʋ kpalɛnara gifi bala baa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matiyo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maakɩ 6:7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu yagɛ wʋ kpalɛnara gifi bala baa kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ, sɛ wʋ fa ba yikuo na doŋ sɛ ba n gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ bakpa tɩba na baa chɔ lʋmɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Sɛ wʋ kpiri ba sɛ ba n ju ga tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa dʋɔ wɩɛ na baa chɔ lʋmɩɛtina. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ju gbɩɛ gaa na, n baa mʋ bʋrʋ chaŋ. N baa mʋ dasɛ atugasa yaa aterembie takpe yaa adiya yaa aterembie yaa gagba alatɛ chaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Waa kʋma gaa ɩ jʋʋ ga dʋɔ sɛ ba lɩɛ amɩɛ na, n cha dɩmaŋ ga tala saŋa gaa ɩ lɩɩ dɩɛ gana naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Gapɩlɛkʋma gaa bakpa n lɩɛ amɩɛ na, ɩ lɩɩ dɩɛ gana naŋ na, n kpisi amɩɛ nafara tie dibuu wʋrʋgɩ dɩmaŋ, na ŋii di seriya chicha ba takɩɛ ba dɩsʋbʋ dʋɔ ba dʋɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, Yesu kpalɛnara baa ju dɩɛsɛ bisi ŋii naŋ ga tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ Wɩɛ Abama ŋii yela baa chɔ bakpa gapɩlɛkʋma.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dɩ yɩɛ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ kpakpuo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matiyo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maakɩ 6:14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Gʋ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ nyii ŋii Yesu yɩɛ kpiniŋ na, dɩ yɩɛ ɩ kpakpuo. Akala takɩɛ barɛ a tawɩ sɛ Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ wʋŋ n feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Sɛ barɛ dʋɔ sɛ Eliya n feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ, sɛ barɛ dʋɔ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ bajana gɩbɩnɩŋtina baa tɩba wʋrʋ n feŋ kɔŋ nkpa naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ama Juo Hɛrɔdɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma yela sɛ ba kara Yohane nyi. Sɛ Mmʋɔ n nyina wʋŋ maa nyii wʋ wɩɛ n na?&gt;&gt; Na wʋ a ja sɛ wʋ a na Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu fa bakpa kɔrʋɔsɛ sɩ nʋŋ (5,000) adiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matiyo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maakɩ 6:30-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Gʋ kpirida gifi bala baa bɔrɛ kɔŋ Yesu jaŋ na, ba tawɩ ŋii ba yɩɛ na kpiniŋ fa ɩ. Sɛ wʋ na ba nyiŋeŋ ju dɩɛ gaa baa yagɛ sɛ Betisayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ama jama baa nyii ba dʋɔ sɛ ba kpaŋ ɩ. Wʋ yɩɛ ba nsa-nsa sɛ wʋ tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa wɩɛ fa ba. Sɛ wʋ chɔ baa baa kili na.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Gʋ dɩ tala bʋyanɔ na, gifi bala baa kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ gaa tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɩsɛ bakpa baa gbɩɛ na baa ju dɩɛ na dɩɛsɛ bisi ŋii ŋɩ tirina daa na naŋ, na baa ga ja adiya di na baa ja aduotiŋ. Akala takɩɛ jɩna yɩɛ ifuli dʋɔ bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ tɩŋtɩŋ n fa ba adiya na baa di.&gt;&gt; Sɛ ba tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Bodobodo anʋŋ na aji bala sɛ dɩ wɩɛna, amʋɔ dɩ ju ga lɩɛ adiya kɔna jama bana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Baala baa ba wɩɛ dɩmaŋ na, aja yɩɛ takɩɛ kɔrʋɔsɛ sɩ nʋŋ (5,000). Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;N yela na baa cha akpeŋ takɩɛ ŋɩla na sala-sala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Sɛ wʋ kpalɛnara baa yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ. Sɛ ba yela sɛ bakpa baa kpiniŋ cha. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Sɛ Yesu mʋ bodobodo anʋŋ na aji bala baa, sɛ wʋ kɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe sɛ wʋ yɩlɩ Ɩsʋɔ. Sɛ wʋ jaɩ mʋ fa wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ ba n mʋ fa bakpa baa. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Sɛ wʋkʋma wina di sɛ wʋ pawʋ. Sɛ wʋ kpalɛnara baa tɔɔsɩ ŋii ba di kakaa na gachaŋasɛ gifi ala.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero kalaa wʋkpa wʋŋ Yesu yɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matiyo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maakɩ 8:27-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Wɩɩ darɛ Yesu a jɔ dɩga wʋ nyiŋeŋ yela wʋ kpalɛnara baa wɩɛ wʋ jaŋ. Sɛ wʋ tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mmʋɔ sɛ bakpa a tawɩ sɛ ma yɩɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Sɛ ba lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Barɛ sɛ Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ, barɛ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ ɔja Eliya, sɛ barɛ dʋɔ sɛ wʋ yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ bajana baa tɩba wʋrʋ bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ dʋɔ, Mmʋɔ sɛ ɩ sɛ ma yɩɛ?&gt;&gt; Sɛ Petero lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ n nyina Kirisito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudatina a yagɛ ɩ sɛ Mesaya sɛ Girikitina a yagɛ sɛ Kirisito</char></note> wʋŋ wʋ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ jaŋ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tawɩ wʋ awʋrʋfʋɔ na wʋ sɩŋ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matiyo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Maakɩ 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ ba nyienaŋ sɛ ba n baa tawɩ wɩɛ ŋina fa wʋrʋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ŋɩ tiri gʋ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ a na awʋrʋfʋɔ fɔɩ, na dɩɛ bɩnɩɛ, Ɩsʋɔ sei bɩnɩɛ na mbara bakalaasa a pɩɛ ɩ na baa kʋ ɩ, ama wɩɛ atoro wɩɩ na, wʋ a feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba kpiniŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a ja sɛ wʋ a kpaŋ maŋ na, ŋɩ tiri gʋ wʋ a yela wʋ tɩŋtɩŋ wʋ jawʋ na wʋ a mʋ wʋ daŋ gasagasa na wʋ a kpaŋ maŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Akala takɩɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a ja wʋ a yu nkpa fa wʋ wʋsɛ na, ŋii jɔ ɩ. Ama wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ nkpa jɔ ɩ ma dʋɔ na, wʋ a yu nkpa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Wʋkpa yu dulunya abʋrɩ kpiniŋ sɛ wʋ nkpa lɩɩ wʋ pam naŋ na, be sɛ wʋ a yu? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Wʋkʋma wʋŋ asaju chaŋ ɩ lɩɩ maŋ na ma wɩɛ dʋɔ na, dɩmʋŋ sɛ asaju aja chaŋ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ fa wʋkpa wina saŋa gaa maa bɔrɛ kɔŋ ma jilima naŋ na Majuo na Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ jilima naŋ na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ sɛ n nyii na dieli sɛ amɩɛ baa ɩ wɩɛ jɩna na barɛ baa na sɩŋ ŋ ga tala gʋ baa na Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wʋsɛ gori</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matiyo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maakɩ 9:2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Gʋ Yesu tawɩ dɩmʋŋ wɩɛ ŋina taŋ wɩɛ jiŋinara wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, wʋ mʋ Petero, Yohane na Jamesi sɛ wʋ na ba ju bʋrɔŋ garɛ dʋɔ na baa ga jɔ dɩga. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Gʋ wʋ a jɔ dɩga na, sɛ wʋ asanaŋ gori, sɛ wʋ gagba ŋalagi takɩɛ duoni ŋmaŋi na. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ ba na baala bala barɛ kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ. Baa n nyina Ɩsʋɔ ɔja Mosesi na Eliya. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Ba lɩsɛ ba wʋsɛ ifuli kalaa Yesu jilima naŋ yela ba na ɩ baa tawɩ. Ba tawɩ wʋ sɩŋ gaa gaa kɔŋ tɩba Yerusalem na dʋɔ wɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Saŋa gana, Petero na wʋ dɔŋa ba cha baa duo asoroŋ. Ama gʋ ba feŋ na, ba na Yesu jilima na baala bala baa ba sɩmɩɛɩ wʋ jaŋ na. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Gʋ baala baa lɩɩ Yesu jaŋ na, Petero tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, ŋɩ wɩɛ dieli gʋ dɩ wɩɛ jɩna. Yela na dɩ baŋ akoneŋ atoro. N teri garɛ, Mosesi teri garɛ na Eliya gba teri garɛ.&gt;&gt; [Wʋ cha wʋ ba jiŋ ŋii wʋ a tawɩ ɩ.]<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Gʋ wʋ saŋ wʋ a tawɩ na, Ɩsʋɔ tanɩɛ gaa fu ba dʋɔ. Gʋ dɩ fu ba dʋɔ na, sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Sɛ lofu garɛ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ tanɛ gaa naŋ kɔŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wina n nyina Mabu wʋŋ ma lɩsɛ na. N nyii wʋ jaŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Gʋ lofu gaa tawɩ taŋ na, kpalɛnara baa na gʋ dɩ kakaa Yesu nyiŋeŋ. Sɛ ba yela sɛ wɩɛ ŋii dʋɔ ba nyienaŋ, ba n tawɩ wɩɛ ŋii ba naa na fa wʋrʋ ʋ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu geŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ wʋchaa wʋrʋ tɩba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matiyo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maakɩ 9:14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Gʋ tɩɛ naa sɛ ba lɩɩ bʋrɔŋ dʋɔ kɔŋ na, jama baa gaa jaŋina Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Kɩɛ baalɛ wʋrʋ lɩɩ jama baa tɩba kuusi tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, maa sʋlʋ nyaŋ bɛ kɩɛ ma bu fa maŋ, akala takɩɛ wʋ nyiŋeŋ n nyina mabu. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Feliŋ sʋbʋ kɔŋ wʋ dʋɔ na, gabʋanaŋ sɛ wʋ a kuusi, sɛ ŋii karɩɛ ɩ lɔ tibi, afɔŋɩ ɩ yela afʋfʋ a lɩɩ wʋ nʋɔ naŋ. Ŋii yela ɩ bileŋ n, ama ŋii nyala ɩ pɔɩ na ŋii yela ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ma sʋlʋ nya kpalɛnara baa sɛ ba n geŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ lɩɩ wʋ tɩba, ama ba n dɩlɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;O, amɩɛ gɩnanaŋ baa ɩɩ lɩɛ ɩ di sɛ amɩɛ gbɩɛsɛ n chirigi i. Mʋ ga tala wɩɛ aŋmaŋ sɛ maŋ na amɩɛ dɩ n cha? Mʋ ga tala wɩɛ aŋmaŋ sɛ ma n yu digela fa amɩɛ? Mʋ nbu wʋŋ kɔna maŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Gʋ wʋchaa wʋŋ a kɔnɛ na, feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ kara ɩ lɔ tibi yela afɔŋɩ ɩ. Ama Yesu fʋba feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ dʋɔ sɛ wʋ chɔ wʋchaa wʋŋ sɛ wʋ mʋ ɩ fa wʋjuo. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ganaŋkʋ Yesu lɩsɛ Ɩsʋɔ gɩjanɛ kalaa na yɩɛ bakpa baa kpiniŋ doba. Gʋ ŋɩ saŋ ŋɩ wɩɛ ba doba lɩɩna ŋii Yesu yɩɛ na, wʋ tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />sɛ, &lt;&lt;N nyii wɩɛ ŋii maa kɔŋ ma tawɩ amɩɛ n na na dieli. Baa lɩsɛ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ dʋ bakpa pamɩɛ naŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ama wʋ kpalɛnara baa n nyii wɩɛ ŋii tie ɩ, akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ mʋ wɩɛ ŋii tie wɩsɛ ba. Ama wɩɛ ba nyɩŋtɩɛ na baa tasɛ ɩ wɩɛ ŋii tie.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmʋɔ n nyina wʋjaŋ-janɛ Ɩsʋɔ Juori naŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matiyo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maakɩ 9:33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Sɛ Yesu kpalɛnara baa a di dɔŋa noro sɛ Mmʋɔ n nyina wʋjaŋ-janɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ama gʋ Yesu jiŋ ba nfɩɛrɛ ŋii baa fa na, sɛ wʋ mʋ wʋchaa pii gaa sɩŋ wʋ jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ lɩɛ wʋchaa pii wina ma yɩrɛ naŋ na, wʋ lɩɛ maŋ. Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ lɩɛ maŋ na, wʋ lɩɛ wʋŋ wʋ kpiri maŋ na gba. Wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ wʋ pii amɩɛ tɩba na, wʋŋ n nyina wʋjaŋ-janɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ aa yuo daa na, wɩɛ da jaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maakɩ 9:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Sɛ Yohane tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, dɩ na baalɛ wʋrʋ wʋ mʋ n yɩrɛ wʋ a geŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋ a lɩɩ bakpa tɩba sɛ dɩ tawɩ ɩ sɛ wʋ n yela, akala takɩɛ wʋ n kpi daa dʋɔ ɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ama Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa tawɩ ɩ sɛ wʋ n yela. Akala takɩɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ aa yuo daa na, wɩɛ daa jaŋ bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samariyatina n lɩɛ Yesu di i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Gʋ saŋa gaa Yesu aja wʋ a ju adugbe tirina na, wʋ yɩɛ wʋ nfɩɛrɛ sɛ wʋ a ju Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Sɛ wʋ kpiri gabʋɔsɛ sɛ ba n pala wʋ asanaŋ ju Samariya dɩɛ bie garɛ naŋ ga kʋla da ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ama bakpa baa ba wɩɛ dɩmaŋ na, n lɩɛ ɩ di i, akala takɩɛ wʋ a ju Yerusalem bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Gʋ wʋ kpalɛnara Jamesi na Yohane na dɩmʋŋ na, ba tasɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, nyaa ja na dɩ yagɛ bʋala lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe gaa gaa ŋɩɛ ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ama Yesu biliŋi kɩɛ ba sɛ wʋ tawɩ baŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Sɛ wʋ na wʋ kpalɛnara baa bɔrɛ ju dɩɛ bie ga baŋbaŋ garɛ naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baa baa ja baa kpaŋ Yesu na</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matiyo 8:19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Gʋ Yesu na wʋ kpalɛnara baa dɔŋ gbɩɛ naŋ baa ju na, baalɛ wʋrʋ tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Gapɩlɛkʋma gaa nyaa ju na maa kpaŋ nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Awʋja aba wɩɛna bʋɔsɛ baa duo sɛ jimbisi wɩɛna gasɩsasɛ. Ama Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ bɩrɛ, wʋ tana diduwei i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ baalɛ wʋ baŋbaŋ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋ maŋ.&gt;&gt; Ama baalɛ wʋŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, yela maa chɩŋkpɩɛ ju ga wuu majuo pɔɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yela na sira a wuu dɔŋa, ama nyaŋ bɩrɛ, ju ga jɔ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa dʋɔ dawuta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Sɛ wʋ baŋbaŋ dʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, maa kpaŋ nyaŋ, ama yela maa chɩŋkpɩɛ ju ga kali ma lʋŋtina pɔɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ chaŋ puligi nyɩŋgɩrɛ ga farɛsa sɛ wʋ biliŋi kɩɛ wʋ wʋrɩgbɩɛ na, n daga Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa naŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kpiri kpalɛnara ŋitoro sala na bala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ŋina wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, Yesu lɩsɛ bakpa ŋitoro sala na bala barɛ, sɛ wʋ kpiri ba bala-bala pala wʋ asanaŋ ju dɩɛsɛ kʋma na gapɩlɛkʋma gaa wʋ a ja sɛ wʋ a ju na. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mala karɩŋ bɔlɩɛɩ ama karada n bɔla a. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ n sʋlʋ Kpaŋjuo fʋɔtɛ wʋŋ na wʋ a kpiri tʋmɩra barɛ gaa kpi karada baa dʋɔ fʋɔ gaa naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />N pala! Maa kpiri amɩɛ takɩɛ feŋ bie gbogboo aba naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />N baa mʋ aterembie takpe yaa didiku yaa asibita, na n baa yɩlɩ wʋrʋ gbɩɛ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Ɩ jʋʋ waa kʋma dʋɔ na, n chɩŋkpɩɛ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋsɛfɩɛ n kɔŋ waa gana dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Wʋrʋ wɩɛ dɩmaŋ sɛ wʋ a ja wʋsɛfɩɛ na, amɩɛ wʋsɛfɩɛ n kɔŋ wʋ dʋɔ. Ama sɛ wʋ aa ja wʋsɛfɩɛ na, amɩɛ wʋsɛfɩɛ n bɔrɛ kɔŋ amɩɛ jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />N cha waa gana dʋɔ, n di na ɩ nyʋɔ bʋrʋkʋma gaa ba fa amɩɛ na. Akala takɩɛ tʋmɩrɛ kʋma daga wʋ dɩtʋm dʋɔ kɩmtʋɔ. N baa pala sʋɩ waasɛ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Dɩɛ kʋma gaa ɩ jʋʋ sɛ ba lɩɛ amɩɛ na, n di adiya kʋma ŋii ba fa amɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />N chɔ lʋmɩɛtina baa ba wɩɛ dɩmaŋ, na ɩ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa tirina amɩɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ama ɩ jʋʋ dɩɛ kʋma sɛ ba n lɩɛ amɩɛ na, n ju dɩɛ naŋ gbɩɛsɛ bisi dʋɔ na ɩ tawɩ sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />&lt;&lt;Dɩ kpisi amɩɛ dɩɛ naŋ dibuu ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ daa nafara tie na wʋrʋgɩ amɩɛ dʋɔ na ŋii chicha amɩɛ. Ama dɩ ja ɩ jiŋ gʋ Ɩsʋɔ juori gaa tirina.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />N nyii na dieli sɛ Ɩsʋɔ dɩpʋɛ fuu wɩɩ gaa na, wʋ a fɔŋɩ dɩɛ gana bakpa dɩla kii Sodomtina.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dɩɛsɛ ŋii ŋɩ n lɩɛ Yesu di i</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matiyo 11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Korasintina amɩɛ lakʋ, Betisayidatina amɩɛ lakʋ, adaŋgana ŋii ma yɩɛ amɩɛ tɩba na sɛ ma yɩɛ Tirosi na Sidoŋ dɩmʋŋ na, nafʋɔ baa fu kotoku gagba na baa susaa npʋɔ na ŋii kalaa takɩɛ ba biliŋi lɩɩ ba dɩsʋbʋ naŋ taŋgɩlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ama Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ di wɩɩ gaa na, wʋ a fɔŋɩ Korasintina na Betisayidatina dɩlɛ na dieli kii Tirositina na Sidoŋtina. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Amɩɛ Kapeniyumtina, ɩ jiŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ aja jiŋna amɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe bɛ? Aye, Ɩsʋɔ aja mʋ amɩɛ ju atatina diele bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ nyii amɩɛ wɩɛ na nyii ma wɩɛ, sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ pɩɛ amɩɛ na pɩɛ maŋ. Ama wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ pɩɛ maŋ na, wʋ pɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ wʋŋ wʋ kpiri maŋ na gba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpalɛnara ŋɩtʋrʋ sala baa bɔrɛ kɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Gʋ Kpalɛnara ŋitoro sala na bala baa bɔrɛ kɔŋ na, ba mʋ asadi tawɩ sɛ, Kpaŋjuo, n yɩrɛ naŋ, feliŋ asʋbʋɛ kɔna ba wʋsɛ tie fa daa.<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma na Sɩtanɩ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe takɩɛ duoni ŋmaŋi na gaa sala tibi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />N nyii! Ma fa amɩɛ yikuo sɛ n chicha dʋmɩɛ na gachɩrasɛ dʋɔ, na ɩ dɩ ɔdʋŋ wʋŋ yikuo kpiniŋ dʋɔ. Bʋrʋ baa dɩlɛ yɩɛ amɩɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ama n baa yela na amɩɛ asa a lɩɛ takɩɛ feliŋ asʋbʋɛ kɔna ba wʋsɛ tie fa amɩɛ. Ama n yela na amɩɛ asadi gʋ Ɩsʋɔ sabɩɛ amɩɛ yɩrɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Dɩmʋŋ saŋa gana naŋ na, Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ yela sɛ Yesu asadi sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Majuo, Ɩsʋɔ adugbe na tie tɛ maa kalɩɛ nyaŋ gʋ nya mʋ ŋina wɩsɛ kpiŋjimtina na baa ba nfɩɛrɛ naŋ fulu na sɛ nya lɩsɛ kalaa bachaasɛ bisi. Majuo, ŋii nya yɩɛ na su nya asa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Sɛ Yesu ti bɔrɛ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Majuo mʋ abʋrɩ kpiniŋ dʋ ma pam naŋ. Wʋrʋ ba jiŋ Bu wʋŋ ŋ, amʋɔ Juo wʋŋ nyiŋeŋ. Dɩmʋŋ sɛ wʋrʋ ba jiŋ Juo wʋŋ ŋ, amʋɔ Bu wʋŋ nyiŋeŋ na baa Bu wʋŋ a jawʋ na sɛ wʋ a lɩsɛ Juo wʋŋ kalaa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Sɛ wʋ biliŋi kɩɛ wʋ kpalɛnara baa tawɩ ba nyiŋeŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kusee n nyina amɩɛ baa amɩɛ asa a na ŋii ɩ na n na. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ bajana na juoneŋ aja sɛ baa na ŋii ɩ na n na, na baa nyii ŋii ɩ nyii n na, ama ba n na a sɛ ba n nyii i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diduu lɩɩna Samariya wʋkpa bam wʋrʋ dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Wɩɩ darɛ Mosesi mbara wʋkalaasa wʋbɩɩsa wʋrʋ kʋlʋ sɩŋ gaa yɩɛ Yesu lɔ tɩba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, be sɛ ma n yɩɛ na maa yu nkpa ŋii ŋɩ taŋ gɩtɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be sɛ ba sabɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ mbara ŋii naŋ?&gt;&gt; Wʋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ, &lt;&lt;Sɩnɛ sɛ nya nyii tie?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Sɛ Mosesi mbara wʋkalaasa wʋŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;&lt;Ja Kpaŋjuo nya Ɩsʋɔ lɩɩ n digela naŋ, n sʋbʋ kpiniŋ, nya nfɩɛrɛ kpiniŋ naŋ na n doŋ kpiniŋ na nyaa ja n dʋɔ takɩɛ n wʋsɛ.&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lɛf 19:18</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nya lɩsɛ nʋɔ na dieli. Yɩɛ ŋina na nya yu nkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ama wʋ a ja sɛ wʋ a lɩɛdʋ sɛ wʋ chirigi, dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ tasɛ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mmʋɔ n nyina ma dʋɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ diduu mʋ lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ wʋrʋ cha lɩɩ Yerusalem wʋ a ju Yeriko. Wʋ a ju na, sɛ ŋmɩɛla baa ba chamɩna doŋ baa lɩɛ bakpa abʋrɩ ga fu wʋ dʋɔ sɛ ba lɩɛ wʋ bʋrʋkʋma sɛ ba fulu wʋ abʋrɩ afuusa, ba tugu ɩ hali wʋ aja wʋ a sɩŋ, sɛ ba laŋ yela ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Dɩ kɔŋ takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ sei wʋrʋ dɔŋ gbɩɛ gana dʋɔ. Gʋ wʋ na baalɛ wʋŋ na sɛ wʋ giligi ɩ laŋ. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Dɩmʋŋ gba sɛ Lewi wʋkpa wʋrʋ gaa lɩɩ wʋ dʋɔ. Gʋ wʋ na ɩ na, wʋŋ gba wʋ giligi ɩ laŋ. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ama Samariya wʋkpa wʋrʋ wʋŋ wʋ a ju gbɩɛ na gaa lɩɩ wʋ dʋɔ. Gʋ wʋ na ɩ na, wʋ wɩɩ wʋ gɩyɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Wʋ ju wʋ jaŋ sɛ wʋ dʋ nuŋ na wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ wʋ awʋnda ŋii naŋ sɛ wʋ mʋ dɩpaŋtaŋ pɔgʋ ɩ. Sɛ wʋ mʋ ɩ cha wʋ kpaŋa dʋɔ mʋ ɩ ju mʋɔra diduwei sɛ ba n kɩɛ wʋ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Gʋ tɩɛna na, wʋ lɩsɛ aterembie dinari ala mʋ fa diduwei kɩɛrɛ wʋŋ sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɩɛ wʋ dʋɔ, ma bɔrɛ kɔŋ na, maa tɔ aterembie kʋma ŋii nya warɩɛ wʋ dʋɔ na kpi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ Mosesi mbara wʋkalaasa wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ bakpa batoro bana tɩba wʋ Mmʋɔ sɛ nyaa fa nfɩɛrɛ sɛ wʋŋ n nyina baalɛ wʋŋ ŋmɩɛla baa ba chamɩna doŋ baa lɩɛ bakpa abʋrɩ tugu ɩ na wʋ dʋɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Sɛ Mosesi mbara wʋkalaasa wʋbɩɩsa wʋŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋŋ wʋ wɩɩ wʋ gɩyɔŋ na.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Pala ga yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ju Maata na Mariya jaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Gʋ Yesu na wʋ kpalɛnara baa dɔŋ gbɩɛ naŋ baa ju Yerusalem na, ba tala dɩɛ bie garɛ naŋ. Sɛ alʋ wʋŋ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Maata na yɩɛ ba nsa-nsa wʋ waa dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Wʋ wɩɛna kʋɔ wʋrʋ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Mariya, wʋŋ wʋ cha Kpaŋjuo nafara tie wʋ a nyii wʋ wɩɛ na. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ama Maata bɩrɛ, wʋ dɩsɛ chɩbɛ wʋ a tɩŋɛ adiya. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ kɔŋ Yesu jaŋ gaa tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo ŋɩ n tiri nyaŋ gʋ ma kʋɔ yela ma nyiŋeŋ maa yɩɛ dɩtʋm gana kpiniŋ naa? Tawɩ ɩ na wʋ a gaa chɔna maŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Sɛ Kpaŋjuo lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ &lt;&lt;Maata, Maata, n chamɩna wɩɛ fɔɩ nyaa nyala n wʋsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ama bʋrʋ ga dʋŋdʋlʋŋ n tiri gaa sɛ Mariya lɩsɛ na. Wʋrʋ baa dɩlɛ lɩɛ ga lɩɩ wʋ jaŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kalaa ganaŋkʋ baa jɔ dɩga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matiyo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Wɩɩ darɛ Yesu wɩɛ gatʋŋgʋrʋ wʋ a jɔ dɩga. Gʋ wʋ jɔ dɩga taŋ na, wʋ kpalɛnara baa tɩba wʋrʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, kalaa daa ganaŋkʋ baa jɔ dɩga takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ Yohane kalaa wʋ kpalɛnara na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ ɩ jɔ dɩga na, n tawɩ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">&lt;&lt;Daa Juo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii ŋarɛ wɩɛna Daa Juo wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛ adugbe</char></note> Ɩsʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">n yɩrɛ yɩɛ dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">yela n Juori a kɔŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii ŋarɛ yela n jawʋ a yɩɛ tibi dʋɔ ganaŋkʋ ŋɩ kɩɛna adugbe na</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Fa daa wɩɩ kʋma adiya.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Mʋ daa dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ daa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ daa gba dɩ mʋ dɩ chɩɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ daa dɩsʋbʋ na.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Gara daa na dɩ n baa jʋʋ lɔ tɩba naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩ n mʋ sɛ amɩɛ tɩba wʋrʋ wɩɛna dɩɛtɛ. Sɛ wʋ ju wʋ jaŋ tɩɛ tɩtɩba ga tawɩ ɩ sɛ ma dɩɛtɛ, kɩŋ maŋ bodobodo atoro, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />akala takɩɛ ma dɩɛtɛ wʋrʋ lɩɩ gbɩɛ dʋɔ kɔŋ ma jaŋ, ama ma tana bʋrʋ maa fa ɩ wʋ a di i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Sɛ wʋ dɩɛtɛ wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛ danaŋ na, lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N baa nyala maŋ. Ma tɔ bʋɔlɛ sɛ maŋ na ma bie dɩ duo. Maa dɩlɛ kʋlʋ fa nyaŋ bʋrʋ ʋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, dɩ kakaa dɩɛtɩrɛ nyiŋeŋ dʋɔ na, wʋ a kʋlʋ fa ɩ bʋrʋ ʋ. Ama lɩɩna gʋ wʋ saŋ ju dʋɔ wʋ a sʋlʋ dʋɔ na, wʋ a kʋlʋ fa ɩ adiya ganaŋkʋ wʋ a jawʋ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, n tasɛ Ɩsʋɔ na wʋ a fa amɩɛ. N ja na ɩ na. N jɔ ɩ bʋɔlɛ na wʋ a tʋlʋ amɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Akala takɩɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a tasɛ Ɩsʋɔ na, wʋ a fa ɩ. Wʋŋ wʋ a jawʋ na, wʋ a na. Dɩmʋŋ sɛ wʋŋ wʋ a jɔ ɩ bʋɔlɛ na, wʋ a tʋlʋ ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ tɩba wʋ Mmʋɔ bu n tasɛ ɩ diji na, sɛ wʋ a fa ɩ dʋm? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Yaa wʋ tasɛ ɩ yalɛ na, wʋ a fa ɩ gachɩra? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Amɩɛ baa ɩ yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra na gba jiŋ ganaŋkʋ ɩ mʋ abʋrɩ abama ɩ fa amɩɛ bie, be n yɩɛ sɛ amɩɛ Juo wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe na, baa mʋ Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ ŋii fa baa baa tasɛ ɩ naa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Belesebu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matiyo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maakɩ 3:20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Wɩɩ darɛ, Yesu gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ wʋ a yela sɛ wʋkpa a yɩɛ namu na lɩɩ baalɛ wʋrʋ tɩba. Gʋ feliŋ sʋbʋ wʋŋ lɩɩ baalɛ wʋŋ tɩba na, sɛ namu wʋŋ tawɩ sɛ dɩ yɩɛ jama baa doba. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ama ba tɩba barɛ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Belesebu wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ feliŋ sʋbʋ bɩnɛ na yikuo sɛ wʋ chamɩna wʋ a gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Sɛ barɛ dʋɔ cha baa ja baa yɩɛ ɩ lɔ tɩba, dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ba tawɩ ɩ sɛ wʋ n yela na adaŋgana a lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe kɔŋ na ŋii kalaa takɩɛ wʋ yikuo lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ jaŋ bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ama gʋ Yesu jiŋ ba nfɩɛrɛ na sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Juori kʋma gaa ga kpara ga wʋsɛ tɩba gaa yuo dɔŋa na, gaa salɩɛ. Dɩmʋŋ sɛ waa kʋma gaa ga kpara ga wʋsɛ tɩba gaa yuo dɔŋa na, gaa salɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Dɩmʋŋ sɛ Sɩtanɩ gba kpara wʋ wʋsɛ wʋ a yuo dɔŋa na, wʋ juori baa dɩlɛ sɩŋ ŋ. Dɩmʋŋ bɩrɛ wʋ gɩtɛ talɛ mɩnaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Sɛ Belesebu yikuo sɛ ma chamɩna maa gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ maa lɩɩ bakpa tɩba na, Mmʋɔ yikuo sɛ amɩɛ kpamɩra dʋɔ chamɩna baa gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ baa lɩɩ bakpa tɩba? Sɛ dɩ yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ bɩrɛ na, amɩɛ kpamɩra bana aaŋ ja baa yɩɛ amɩɛ wɩɛ dira na baa fu amɩɛ dɩpʋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ama sɛ Ɩsʋɔ doŋ sɛ ma chamɩna maa gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ maa lɩɩ bakpa tɩba na, dɩmʋŋ bɩrɛ Ɩsʋɔ Juori kɔŋ amɩɛ jaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Doŋ-tɛ chamɩna wʋ yuo abʋrɩ wʋ garana wʋ waa na, dɩmʋŋ bɩrɛ wʋ gapatɩɛ wɩɛna garɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ama sɛ wʋrʋ kii doŋ-tɛ wina sɛ wʋ yuo di wʋ dʋɔ na, wʋ a mʋ wʋ yuo abʋrɩ ŋii wʋ mʋ wʋ wʋsɛ jaga dʋɔ na, na wʋ a kui wʋ abʋrɩ kpiniŋ kpara fa bakpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ n kpi ma dʋɔ na, a yuo maŋ bɛ. Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ aa kʋla wʋ a chɔna maŋ ŋ, a yasɩŋ tɩba bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Feliŋ sʋbʋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matiyo 12:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ wʋkpa tɩba na, wʋ dɔŋ ifuli dʋɔ bɛ wʋ a ja dɩchatɩŋ. Sɛ wʋ n yu na, wʋ a tawɩ bɛ sɛ, &lt;Maa ti bɔrɛ ju ma waa gabɩnɛ dʋɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Wʋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ gaa na gʋ ba desina waa gaa dʋɔ na dieli na, <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />wʋ a bɔrɛ ga mʋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩkaarɛ baa ba wɩɛ nyinaŋ doŋ kii ɩ, na baa gaa cha wʋkpa wʋŋ tɩba. Na wʋkpa wina chawʋ naŋ a warɩɛ kii wʋ chawʋ gɩbɩnɩŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kusee gaa ga yɩɛ gasiŋteŋ na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Gʋ Yesu saŋ wʋ a tawɩ dɩmʋŋ wɩɛ ŋina na, alʋ wʋrʋ wɩɛ jama baa tɩba sɛ wʋ kuusi tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kusee n nyina alʋ wʋŋ wʋ lʋrʋ nyaŋ, na dide gaa nya ŋmasɛ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kusee n nyina baa baa nyii Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ sɛ baa di ŋɩ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakpa tasɛ Yesu adaŋgana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matiyo 12:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Gʋ bakpa baa yɩɛ bɔlɩŋ na, Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Gɩnanaŋ gana wɩɛna nyinaŋ doŋ. Baa ja adaŋgana baa na, ama baa na ŋarɛ ɛ, amʋɔ ŋii ŋɩ tibi Yona dʋɔ na. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ ŋii ŋɩ kɔŋ Yona dʋɔ na cha ŋɩ yɩɛ adaŋgana fa Niniwetina na, dɩmʋŋ sɛ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ wɩɛ gba aja yɩɛ adaŋgana fa gɩnanaŋ gana. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ di wɩɩ na, Siba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siba yɩɛ dɩɛ gaa ga wɩɛ Isirali dɩsalɩtɩŋ bɛ </char></note> ala Juo aja kʋlʋ sɩŋ na wʋ a fu gɩnanaŋ gana dɩpʋɛ. Akala takɩɛ wʋ lɩɩ taŋasɛ gaa nyii Solomoŋ kpiŋjim wɩɛ. Kɩɛ, wʋŋ wʋ kii Solomoŋ na wɩɛ jɩna. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ di wɩɩ na, Niniwetina aja kʋlʋ sɩŋ fu gɩnanaŋ gana dɩpʋɛ. Akala takɩɛ ba nyii Yona wɩɛ na, ba biliŋi lɩɩ ba dɩsʋbʋ naŋ. Kɩɛ, wʋŋ wʋ kii Yona na wɩɛ jɩna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wʋsɛ ŋmaŋi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matiyo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋrʋ baa tʋ fitila na wʋ a mʋ wɩsɛ yaa wʋ a mʋ dinyiŋkpa fu ga dʋɔ ɔ, ama baa mʋ jaga fitila dɩjagatɩŋ bɛ, na bakpa baa baa kɔŋ dɩmaŋ na gaa na ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Nya asa kɩɛna bɛ takɩɛ fitila na fa n wʋsɛ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ nya asa wɩɛ dieli na, n wʋsɛ kpiniŋ gba wɩɛna ŋmaŋi. Ama sɛ nya asa taŋ dieli na, n wʋsɛ gba wɩɛna giteŋteŋbiri. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ kɩɛ na dieli na ŋmaŋi gaa ga wɩɛ n tɩba na, n baa bɩrɩŋsɛ giteŋteŋbiri. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />N wʋsɛ kpiniŋ wɩɛna ŋmaŋi sɛ giteŋteŋbiri taŋ salɛ garɛ na, n wʋsɛ kpiniŋ aja ŋmaŋi ganaŋkʋ fitila a ŋmaŋi gaa fa nyaŋ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu pʋɩ Farasitina na mbara bakalaasa baa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matiyo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maakɩ 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Gʋ Yesu tawɩ taŋ na, sɛ Farasi wʋkpa wʋrʋ yagɛ ɩ wʋ waa dʋɔ sɛ wʋ n kɔŋ na baa di. Sɛ wʋ ju ga cha didiitiŋ dɩmaŋ na wʋ a di. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Ama Farasi wʋkpa wʋŋ na gʋ Yesu n saŋ wʋ pamɩɛ na ŋii yɩɛ dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ pɔɩ na wʋ a di ganaŋkʋ ba duluŋ ayɩɛsa akala na, dɩ yɩɛ ɩ doba.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Sɛ Kpaŋjuo tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɩɛ, amɩɛ Farasitina bɩrɛ, ɩ yalɛ amɩɛ gafɩsɩ na achuŋputuŋ wʋrʋgbɩɛ, ama nyinaŋ doŋ na dɩsɛchɩbɛ n su amɩɛ tɩba. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Amɩɛ bamalaŋpʋna! Ɩ ba jiŋ sɛ wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ asanaŋ na wʋŋ n yɩɛ wʋrʋgbɩɛ gba? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ama n mʋ ŋii ɩ wɩɛna na fa ayɔŋtina, na ɩ yɩɛ dɩchɩrɩchɩrɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Farasitina amɩɛ lakʋ, akala takɩɛ ɩ tɔ amɩɛ jagɩɛ, akpinie na fʋɔsɛ naŋ abʋrɩ kpiniŋ dʋɔ gifi naŋ garɛ ɩ fa Ɩsʋɔ. Ama ɩ pɩɛ di wɩɛ ŋɩ gbɩɛ dʋɔ sɛ ɩɩ ja Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ɛ. Ŋina n daga na ɩ yɩɛ na n baa yela gifi naŋ garɛ tɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Farasitina amɩɛ lakʋ! Akala takɩɛ ɩ ja achaatɩŋ a janɩɛ Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ na bakpa a luuŋ yɩlɩ ba gɩyɩɛnɩŋ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ lakʋ, akala takɩɛ ɩ kɩɛna bɛ takɩɛ gachaŋsɛ ŋii ŋɩ wɩsaɩ na bakpa dɔŋ ŋɩ dʋɔ yela ba ba jiŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Sɛ Mosesi mbara bakalaasa baa tɩba wʋrʋ wʋŋ wʋ bɩɩ mbara naŋ na, tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, nya tawɩ ŋina na, nya ti daa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ Mosesi mbara bakalaasa ɩ bɩɩ mbara naŋ na, amɩɛ lakʋ. Akala takɩɛ ɩ mʋ gasʋlasɛ ayuntina ɩ sɩlɛ bakpa, ama amɩɛ bɩrɛ ɩŋ mʋ amɩɛ pam nyiŋbie gba chɔna ba a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ lakʋ, akala takɩɛ ɩɩ ma gachaŋsɛ ɩɩ desina ŋɩ dʋɔ na dieli ɩɩ fa Ɩsʋɔ bajana baa amɩɛ duluŋ n kʋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Ŋii ɩ yɩɛ na dʋɔ akala sɛ ɩ yɩɛ seriyatina sɛ ɩ kpa gʋ amɩɛ duluŋ kʋ Ɩsʋɔ bajana sɛ amɩɛ dʋɔ ɩ ma ba gachaŋsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ŋina dʋɔ, Ɩsʋɔ lɩɩ wʋ kpiŋjim naŋ tawɩ sɛ maa kpiri ma bajana na ma kpirida Isiralitina jaŋ, na baa kʋ ba tɩba barɛ na baa nyala barɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, Ɩsʋɔ aja fɔŋɩ amɩɛ gɩnanaŋ gana dɩla lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ bajana baa amɩɛ duluŋ kʋ lɩɩ dulunya dɩfaratɩŋ na, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />lɩɩ Abeli kʋ dʋɔ ga tala Sakariya wʋŋ ba kʋ ɩ gadiesa dɩgbɩŋgbɩŋ na Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ tɩtɩba na. Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, Ɩsʋɔ aja fɔŋɩ gɩnanaŋ gana dɩla lɩɩ ŋina dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ Mosesi mbara bakalaasa baa ɩ bɩɩ mbara naŋ na, amɩɛ lakʋ, akala takɩɛ ɩ tɔ Ɩsʋɔ jim gbɩɛ bɔlɛ. Ama amɩɛ tɩŋtɩŋ ɩŋ jʋʋ o, sɛ ɩ gara baa baa ja sɛ baa jʋʋ na gbɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Gʋ Yesu lɩɩ dɩmaŋ na, Farasitina na Mosesi mbara bakalaasa baa fara baa mʋ wʋ dʋɔ biŋbira sɛ ba tasɛ ɩ wɩɛ fɔɩ, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />yela ba dana baa kɩɛ sɛ wʋ a tawɩ wɩɛ ŋarɛ na baa sɩŋ dʋɔ mʋ pʋɩ ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">N kɩɛ na dieli lɩɩ aluguusi dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matiyo 10:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Saŋa gana naŋ na, jama baa gaa jaŋi Yesu jaŋ, ba bɔla hali baa chicha dɔŋa dʋɔ. Sɛ Yesu fara wʋ a tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;N kɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ dʋɔ na dieli lɩɩ Farasitina yiisi ŋii ŋɩ yɩɛ aluguusi na dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Bʋrʋkʋma gaa ba fu ga dʋɔ na, gaa fulu dʋɔ na baa na. Dɩmʋŋ sɛ wɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ wɩsaɩ na, aja lɩɩ na baa na. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Wɩɛ kʋma ŋii ɩ tawɩ gɩbɩrɩ naŋ na, ŋii lɩɩ ifuli. Wɩɛ ŋii baa muni dʋ amɩɛ dɩlɛ naŋ danɛ lori naŋ na, baa jɔ ŋɩ dʋɔ dawuta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wʋŋ ba n se ɩ na</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matiyo 10:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma dɩɛtina, maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, n baa se baa baa kʋ wʋsɛ nanɛ gaa, wʋrʋgbɩɛ na baa ti dɩlɛ yɩɛ bʋrʋ ʋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Ama maa kalaa amɩɛ wʋŋ n se ɩ na. N se wʋŋ wʋ kʋ wʋsɛ nanɛ taŋ na, wʋ wɩɛna yikuo wʋ a dɩlɛ lɔ amɩɛ dʋ awʋrʋfʋɔ bʋala naŋ. Maa tawɩ amɩɛ wʋŋ sɛ n se. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Naa kpaŋnyɔ ala sɛ baa mʋ lɩɛ tʋra jimbisi banʋŋ? Ama Ɩsʋɔ n solo ba wʋrʋ dʋɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ama amɩɛ bɩrɛ, wʋ jiŋ amɩɛ nyi nyʋɔsɛ kpiniŋ nʋɔ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ n baa se nyɩŋtɩɛ, akala takɩɛ ɩ yɩɛ ba kpari kii tʋra jimbisi fɔɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a tawɩ bakpa asanaŋ sɛ wʋ yɩɛ ma wʋrʋgbɩɛtɛ na, Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ gba wʋ a lɩsɛ tawɩ sɛ wʋ yɩɛ ma wʋrʋgbɩɛtɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ asanaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ama wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ pɩɛ maŋ bakpa asanaŋ na, maŋ gba, maa pɩɛ ɩ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ asanaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a tawɩ wɩɛ baŋ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ na, Ɩsʋɔ aja mʋ chɩɛ ɩ. Ama wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a tawɩ mbusu wɩɛ baŋ Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ na bɩrɛ, wʋ aa mʋ chɩɛ ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba chaŋ amɩɛ kɔŋ Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ gaa sɩŋ juoneŋ na dɩɛ bɩnɩɛ baa ba wɩɛna yikuo sɛ ba n di amɩɛ wɩɛ na, n baa nyala amɩɛ wʋsɛ ŋii ɩ tawɩ lɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ na yaa ŋii ɩ tawɩ na dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Akala takɩɛ saŋa gana naŋ, Ɩsʋɔ Feliŋ aja kalaa amɩɛ ŋii n tawɩ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diduu lɩɩna Akpaŋtatɛ wʋmalaŋpʋ wʋrʋ dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Wʋrʋ lɩɩ jama baa naŋ tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, tawɩ ma ŋmɩɛtɩ na dɩ kpara daa juo gapatɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma dɩɛtɛ, n Mmʋɔ n lɩsɛ maŋ wɩɛ diri yaa gapatɩɛ kparɩdɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N kɩɛ na dieli na ɩ duo amɩɛ wʋsɛ dʋɔ na dieli lɩɩna dɩsɛchɩbɛ sʋbʋ dʋɔ, akala takɩɛ na akpaŋta fɔɩ ŋii wʋkpa wɩɛna na, aaŋ ja fa ɩ nkpa a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ ba diduu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ aterembie-tɛ wʋrʋ n cha wʋ wɩɛna. Wʋ wɩɛna tibi bam gaa gaa yɩɛ adiya na dieli. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ wʋ nyinaŋ sɛ be sɛ maa yɩɛ? Akala takɩɛ gbɩɛ taŋ ma dichonkon naŋ na maa ti mʋ ma adiya dʋ ʋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N na sɛ maa yɩɛ. Maa warɩɛ ma dichonkon na maa baŋ gajanɛ. Dɩmaŋ sɛ maa si ma adiya na ma akpaŋta kpiniŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ wʋ wʋsɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma si akpaŋta fɔɩ ŋii tala maŋ bɩŋsɛ-bɩŋsɛ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ma sʋbʋ fɩɛsɛ, di, nyʋɔ na nyaa lɩɛ nya asa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ama Ɩsʋɔ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ wʋmalaŋpʋ! Yuluma gana maa lɩɛ nya nkpa lɩɩ n pamɩɛ naŋ. Abʋrɩ ŋii n ja si n wʋsɛ na aja yɩɛ Mmʋɔ teri?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ sɛ aja yɩɛ fa wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a kʋla akpaŋta si fa wʋ wʋsɛ, ama Ɩsʋɔ asa dʋɔ bɩrɛ, wʋ ba yɩɛ akpaŋtatɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yu lɩɛdi Ɩsʋɔ naŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matiyo 6:25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ n baa nyala amɩɛ wʋsɛ amɩɛ nkpa dʋɔ bʋrʋ gaa ɩ di yaa amɩɛ wʋsɛ ŋii ɩ fu na dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Akala takɩɛ nkpa kii adiya sɛ wʋsɛ gba kii abʋrɩ afuusa. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />N kɩɛ kuakuadabi, baa duu sɛ baa karɛwʋ ʋ. Ba tana adiya disiitiŋ sɛ ba tana dichonkon n. Ama Ɩsʋɔ adisi ba. Ɩ ba yɩɛ ba kpari kii jimbisi? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Amɩɛ tɩba wʋ Mmʋɔ sɛ wʋ ga nyala naŋ a dɩlɛ mʋ saŋa pii kpi wʋ nkpa dʋɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Gʋ ɩɩ dɩlɛ yɩɛ pii ŋina gba a, be n yɩɛ sɛ ɩ nyala amɩɛ wʋsɛ ŋii ŋɩ kakaa na dʋɔ?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N kɩɛ ganaŋkʋ kasɛ fʋɩrasɛ a bɩɩ ŋɩ wɩɛ dieli, ŋii yɩɛ dɩtʋm sɛ ŋii lʋʋ abʋrɩ afuusa a. Ama maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, Juo Solomoŋ na wʋ jilima naŋ kpiniŋ gba n dɩlɛ desina wʋsɛ na wʋ a yɩɛ dieli takɩɛ fʋɩrasɛ ŋina naŋ garɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Sɛ dɩmʋŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ a fu kasɛ ŋii ɩ na ŋɛ jaŋ na chifuo ɩ tʋ ŋɛ bʋala na, be n yɩɛ sɛ wʋ aa fu amɩɛ? O amɩɛ baa amɩɛ lɩɛdi n bɔla a. <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ n baa ja bʋrʋ gaa ɩ di yaa ɩ nyʋɔ. N baa nyala amɩɛ wʋsɛ ŋɩ dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Akala takɩɛ bakpa baa ba ba jiŋ Ɩsʋɔ na, aja dɩmʋŋ abʋrɩ ŋina kpiniŋ. Ama amɩɛ Juo jiŋ gʋ ŋina kpiniŋ tiri amɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ n ja Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa na wʋ a mʋ ŋina kpiniŋ kpi amɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpaŋta ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ adugbe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matiyo 6:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma kpalɛnara baa ɩ kɩɛna takɩɛ feŋ dikpeŋ bie, n baa yɩɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ, akala takɩɛ dɩ su amɩɛ Juo asa sɛ wʋ a mʋ wʋ juori gaa fa amɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />N yaa amɩɛ akpaŋta na ɩ mʋ aterembie fa ayɔŋtina. N ja aterembie takpe gaa gaa chati na akpaŋta ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe sɛ ŋɩ dʋɔ baa kɔgɩ ɩ. Dɩmaŋ sɛ ŋmɩɛla baa dɩlɛ jʋʋ ga ŋmɩɛlɛ, sɛ tabɩrɩta aba baa dɩlɛ warɩɛ ŋɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Akala takɩɛ diele gaa nya akpaŋta wɩɛ na, dɩmaŋ sɛ n digela wɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tʋmɩra baa baa gie na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N mʋ amɩɛ wʋsɛ na ɩ kʋla daa dɩtʋm, na ɩ yela amɩɛ fitila aba a ŋmaŋi, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />takɩɛ gʋ tʋmɩra dana ba kpaŋjuo wʋŋ wʋ bɔrɛ lɩɩ sarɛ asa di tie wʋ a kɔnɛ, wʋ gaa jɔ bʋɔlɛ na baa tʋlʋ ɩ bileŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Tʋmɩra baa ba kpaŋjuo aja kɔŋ gaa mɩɛna ba yela baa gie na, baa yu asadi. Maa tawɩ sɛ n nyii na dieli sɛ wʋ a mʋ wʋ wʋsɛ na wʋ a yela baa cha na wʋ a fa ba adiya. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Tʋmɩra baa ba kpaŋjuo kɔŋ tɩɛtɩtɩba yaa tafɩlɛ yela baa gie na, ba yu asadi. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Ama n nyii ŋina tie na dieli sɛ, nafʋɔ waatɛ jiŋ saŋa gaa ŋmɩɛlɛ aja kɔŋ na, nafʋɔ wʋ a gie na wʋ n baa salɩɛ jʋʋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Amɩɛ gba ŋɩ tiri gʋ n desina amɩɛ wʋsɛ ɩ dana, akala takɩɛ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ aja kɔŋ saŋa gaa ɩ ba kɩɛna wʋ gbɩɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tʋmɩrɛ gasiŋteŋ-tɛ na wʋŋ wʋ aa di gasiŋteŋ ŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matiyo 24:45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Sɛ Petero tasɛ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, daa nyiŋeŋ sɛ nya jɔ diduu gana yaa wʋkʋma bɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Sɛ Kpaŋjuo lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N Mmʋɔ n nyina kɩɛrɛ gasiŋteŋ-tɛ na kɩɛrɛ wɩɛ jɩmɩrɛ? Wʋŋ n nyina wʋŋ wʋ kpaŋjuo yela sɛ wʋ a kɩɛ wʋ tʋmɩra ba baŋbaŋ dʋɔ sɛ wʋ a fa ba adiya saŋa bam naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Asadi n nyina tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ wʋ kpaŋjuo aja bɔrɛ kɔŋ gaa mɩɛna ɩ yela wʋ a tʋm wʋ dɩtʋm ga gbɩɛ dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Maa tawɩ sɛ n nyii na dieli sɛ kpaŋjuo wʋŋ aja mʋ wʋ akpaŋta kpiniŋ dʋ wʋ pamɩɛ naŋ sɛ wʋ n kɩɛ dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ama dɩ n mʋ takɩɛ tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ tawɩ wʋ nyinaŋ sɛ, &lt;Ma kpaŋjuo aja taŋgɩlɛ pɔɩ na wʋ a kɔŋ,&gt; sɛ wʋ fara wʋ a tugu wʋ tʋmɩra baala na tʋmɩra ala jaŋ, na wʋ a di na wʋ a nyʋɔ, na wʋ a dɩɛsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Dɩmʋŋ tʋmɩrɛ wina wʋ kpaŋjuo wʋŋ aja wʋ a purugi ɩ wɩɩ gaa wʋ aa kɩɛ wʋ gbɩɛ na saŋa gaa wʋ ba jiŋ ŋ. Wʋ a fɔŋɩ wʋ dɩlɛ na dieli na wʋ a mʋ ɩ kpi baa ba lɩɛ ba di na dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Tʋmɩrɛ kʋma wʋŋ wʋ jiŋ wʋ kpaŋjuo jawʋ sɛ wʋ n kʋla wʋ wʋsɛ na wʋ a yɩɛ ŋii wʋ a jawʋ na, wʋ kpaŋjuo wʋŋ aja ta ɩ dɩchʋchʋ na dieli <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ama tʋmɩrɛ kʋma wʋŋ wʋ ba jiŋ wʋ kpaŋjuo jawʋ na, sɛ wʋ yɩɛ bʋrʋ gaa ga daga dɩlɛ fɔŋɩwʋ na, wʋ kpaŋjuo wʋŋ aja ta ɩ dɩchʋchʋ chonii. Wʋkʋma wʋŋ ba fa ɩ abʋrɩ fɔɩ na, baa tasɛ fɔɩ lɩɩ wʋ jaŋ. Sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ ba mʋ fɔɩ dʋ wʋ pamɩɛ naŋ sɛ wʋŋ kɩɛ dʋɔ na, baa tasɛ fɔɩ lɩɩ wʋ jaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu dʋɔ bakpa aja kpara tɩba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matiyo 10:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma kɔŋ maa dʋ bʋala tibi gana dʋɔ bɛ. Ma yu na nafʋɔ ga taŋ gaa chaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ama ŋɩ daga maa mʋna awʋrʋfʋɔ Ɩsʋɔ sɔ naŋ yela maa yɩyɩɛ ga tala gʋ ŋii laŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Ɩ jiŋ sɛ wʋsɛfɩɛ naŋ sɛ ma kɔŋ tibi dʋɔ? Aye, maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, ma gaa kpara bakpa tɩba bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Lɩɩ jaŋ mʋ a ju, waa ga dʋŋdʋlʋŋ dʋɔ bakpa ba nʋŋ aja kpara tɩba, batoro aja kʋlʋ bala dʋɔ, na bala a kʋlʋ batoro dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Bakpa aja kpara tɩba. Juo a kʋlʋ bu baalɛ jaŋ dʋɔ, na bu baalɛ jaŋ dʋɔ a kʋlʋ wʋjuo dʋɔ, naa a kʋlʋ bu alʋ jaŋ dʋɔ, na bu alʋ jaŋ a kʋlʋ wʋnaa dʋɔ, awu a kʋlʋ bu baalɛ jaŋ alʋ dʋɔ, na bu baalɛ jaŋ alʋ a kʋlʋ wʋ awu dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saŋa tie nyii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matiyo 16:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ jama baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩ na gʋ duoni tanɩɛ lɩɩ dɩsalɩtɩŋ na, gabʋanaŋ sɛ ɩ tawɩ sɛ duoni aja wʋ a nɩɛ sɛ wʋ a nɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Sɛ ɩ na feliŋ jɔ lɩɩ tie sɛ ŋɩ tɩba wɩɛ dimi na, ɩ tawɩ sɛ difiŋ aja kɔŋ sɛ ŋii kɔnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Amɩɛ aluguusitina, ɩ dɩlɛ ɩ kɩɛ tie na Ɩsʋɔ adugbe na ɩ lɩsɛ tie, be n yɩɛ sɛ ɩɩ dɩlɛ kalaa ŋii Ɩsʋɔ aja wʋ a yɩɛ saŋa gana naŋ na tie?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɩɛ kɔŋ nyaŋ na n dʋɔ tɩtɩba na n desina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ amɩɛ tɩŋtɩŋ ɩɩ dɩlɛ jiŋ bʋrʋ gaa ga wɩɛ dieli naa? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />N chamɩna wʋrʋ kɩm sɛ wʋ juna nyaŋ wɩɛ didiitiŋ na, gʋ ɩ dɔŋ gbɩɛ naŋ ɩ ju na, chɩdɩsɛ na ɩ desina wɩɛ ŋii pɔɩ na ɩ tala dɩmaŋ. Sɛ nya n yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ na, wʋ a mʋ nyaŋ ga fa wɩɛ diri na wʋ a fu nyaŋ dɩpʋɛ na wʋ a mʋ nyaŋ fa gagbasɛ anyaŋnyaŋtina na baa mʋ nyaŋ ga tɔ danɛ <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, baa lɩsɛ nyaŋ lɩɩ danɛ dɩtʋɔtɩŋ ŋ, ga tala gʋ nyaa tɔ kɩm gaa taŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Biliŋi lɩɩ dɩsʋbʋ naŋ yaa sɩŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Saŋa gaa Yesu akala na, bakpa barɛ cha ba wɩɛ dɩmaŋ sɛ ba tawɩ Yesu sɛ Galaliyatina barɛ kɔŋ baa gaa diesi gadiesa Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ. Sɛ Juo Pilato yela sɛ ba kʋ ba sɛ ba asima bʋga namɩɛ baa ba mʋ kɔŋ baa gaa diesi na asima naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩ jiŋ sɛ dɩmʋŋ Galaliyatina bana n nyina dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra kii Galaliyatina baa ba kakaa na, dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ sɛ ba cha na yowu sɩŋ ŋina? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Aye, ama maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, ɩŋ biliŋi lɩɩ amɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ naŋ na, dɩmʋŋ sɛ amɩɛ kpiniŋ ɩ sɩŋ, <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />yaa ɩ jiŋ sɛ bakpa gifi jiŋinara baa danɛ jalɩŋtɛ gaa ga wɩɛ Silowam cha sala kʋ ba na yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra kii bakpa baa ba kakaa Yerusalem naa? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Aye, maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, ɩŋ biliŋi lɩɩ amɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ naŋ na, dɩmʋŋ sɛ amɩɛ kpiniŋ ɩ sɩŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Figi daŋ gaa ga n si bie na diduu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yesu jɔ ba diduu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ wʋrʋ n duu figi daŋ wʋ girepi fʋɔ naŋ. Gʋ wʋ ju wʋ a ga kɩɛ daŋ gaa dʋɔ sɛ wʋ a yu bie na, wʋ n yu u. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ fʋɔ kɩɛrɛ wʋŋ sɛ kɩɛ, bɩŋsɛ sɛ toro mɩnaŋ ma dɔŋ maa ja figi daŋ gana dʋɔ bie, ama maa yu bʋrʋ ʋ. Wʋŋ ga lɔ. Be sɛ ga sɩmɩɛɩ tibi gana dʋɔ gaa yɩɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Sɛ kɩɛrɛ wʋŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, yela ga na gaa sɩŋ bɩriŋnʋɔ garɛ kpi, na maa wuru bʋɔ logo ga tie, na maa mʋ namɩɛ bɩna dʋ ga tie. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Bɩriŋnʋɔ garɛ sɛ ga si na, wɩɛ dieli. Ama sɛ ga n si na, na nyaa wʋŋ ga lɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Chɔ alʋ wʋŋ wʋ guo na Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ garɛ, Yesu cha wʋ a kalaa Yudatina tʋm danɛ garɛ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Alʋ wʋrʋ cha wʋ wɩɛ dɩmaŋ wʋŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ yela sɛ wʋ kili bɩŋsɛ gifi jiŋinara. Wʋ guo sɛ wʋ a dɩlɛ tɩɛŋɩ wʋ wʋsɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Gʋ Yesu na ɩ na, wʋ yagɛ ɩ kɔŋ asanaŋ sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Alʋ, nya yu alaŋfiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Wʋ mʋ wʋ pam jaga wʋ dʋɔ, gabʋanaŋ sɛ wʋ tɩɛŋɩ tɩba sɛ wʋ kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Sɛ Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ bɩnɛ wʋŋ kara biŋbira sɛ Yesu chɔ lʋm fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ tawɩ bakpa baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wɩɛ lʋrʋ sɛ ba chamɩna baa tʋm. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ n kɔŋ na baa chɔ amɩɛ dɩmʋŋ gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ŋina naŋ, naa Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Sɛ Kpaŋjuo lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ aluguusitina! Amɩɛ Mmʋɔ bɛ ba aaŋ ja wʋ a buoli wʋ naa baalɛ yaa wʋ kpaŋa lɩɩ wʋ dɩkpaŋtɩŋ na wʋ a ga nyʋɔ lɩŋ Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Alʋ wina yɩɛ Abiraham ganana bie bɛ sɛ Sɩtanɩ mʋ lʋm pɔgʋ ɩ bɩŋsɛ gifi jiŋinara, dɩ n daga na maa chɔ ɩ Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Gʋ Yesu tawɩ ŋina na, sɛ asaju chaŋ wʋ badʋŋna baa kpiniŋ. Ama adaŋgana ŋii wʋ a yɩɛ dʋɔ na, bakpa baa asadi.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpeli daŋ bi dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matiyo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maakɩ 4:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ bakpa baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɩnɛ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa kɩɛna? Be bʋrʋ dʋɔ sɛ maa mʋ kɩɛsɩna? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ga kɩɛna bɛ takɩɛ kpeli daŋ bi gaa baalɛ wʋrʋ duu wʋ fʋɔnaŋ. Gaa bɩɩ sɛ gaa yɩɛ daŋ janɛ sɛ jimbisi a gaa yɩɛ gasɩsasɛ ga gayabɩsɛ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisi dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matiyo 13:33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Sɛ Yesu ti bɔrɛ tasɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be bʋrʋ dʋɔ sɛ maa mʋ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa kɩɛsɩna? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ga kɩɛna bɛ takɩɛ yiisi gaa alʋ wʋrʋ mʋ pii bʋga bodobodo mʋlʋŋ ŋii ŋɩ bɔlɩɛɩ. Sɛ dɩ yela sɛ ŋɩ yɩɛ gafʋʋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buonɔ mɔmɔkyɩ gaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matiyo 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:23">21:23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Gʋ Yesu dɔŋ gbɩɛ naŋ wʋ a ju Yerusalem na, wʋ kalaa-kalaa Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ dɩɛsɛ a janɩɛ na dɩɛsɛ bisi ŋii wʋ mʋna ŋɩ tɩba na. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Sɛ wʋrʋ tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, bakpa pii barɛ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ aja lɩɛ ba nkpa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;N chɩdɩsɛ na ɩ mʋna buonɔ mɔmɔkyɩ gaa naŋ. Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, bakpa fɔɩ aaŋ ja sɛ baa jʋʋ, ama baa dɩlɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Sɛ waatɛ wʋŋ kʋlʋ tɔ bʋɔlɛ gaa na, ɩ sɩŋ asʋŋ ɩ jɔ bʋɔlɛ gaa sʋlʋ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, tʋlʋ daa. Ama wʋ a lɩsɛ amɩɛ nʋɔ sɛ, ma ba jiŋ amɩɛ sɛ ma ba jiŋ diele gaa ɩ lɩɩ ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ ɩ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Daa na nyaŋ aaŋ di sɛ dɩ nyɔ, sɛ nya kalaa-kalaa daa dɩɛ naŋ gbɩɛsɛ bisi naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ama wʋ a tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma ba jiŋ amɩɛ na diele gaa ɩ lɩɩ ɩ. N lɩɩ ma jaŋ, amɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩ na amɩɛ duluŋ Abiraham, Isaki, Yakubu na Ɩsʋɔ bajana kpiniŋ ba wɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ juori gaa naŋ. Ama amɩɛ bɩrɛ ɩ yu gbɩɛ jʋʋ ʋ, dɩmaŋ sɛ wiiniŋ na kela naŋ tawʋ wɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bakpa aja lɩɩ dɩlɩɩtɩŋ na dɩsalɩtɩŋ, tie na adugbe na baa gaa cha lɩɛ ba asa Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Kɩɛ, wʋrʋgbɩɛtina aja yɩɛ asanaŋtina, na asanaŋtina a yɩɛ wʋrʋgbɩɛtina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wɩɩ fa Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matiyo 23:37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Saŋa gana naŋ, Farasitina baa barɛ kɔŋ gaa tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kʋlʋ lɩɩ jɩna ju gatʋŋgʋrʋ. Akala takɩɛ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ a ja nyaŋ na wʋ a kʋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N ju ga tawɩ dɩmʋŋ awʋja wina sɛ wʋ n nyii, maa gɩŋ feliŋ sʋbʋ lɩɩ bakpa naŋ na maa chɔ bakpa jaŋ na chifuo, pɔɩ na wɩɩ atorotɛ na, maa taŋ ma dɩtʋm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Gbɩɛ kʋma dʋɔ ŋɩ tiri gʋ maa ju dʋɔ maa yɩɛ ma dɩtʋm jaŋ na chifuo na chifuo wʋrʋgbɩɛ. Akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ bajana kpiniŋ baa sɩŋ gatʋŋgʋrʋ ʋ amʋɔ Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;O Yerusalemtina, Yerusalemtina! Amɩɛ baa ɩ kʋ Ɩsʋɔ bajana sɛ ɩ lɔ baa Ɩsʋɔ kpiri ba amɩɛ jaŋ na bʋɛ. Maa ja sɛ maa sila amɩɛ na maa gie amɩɛ takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ dijim naa a sila wʋ bie wʋ baŋasɛ naŋ sɛ wʋ a gie ba na. Ama ɩŋ kpa a. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />N nyii, Ɩsʋɔ aja lɩsɛ wʋ asa lɩɩ amɩɛ dɩɛ janɛ dʋɔ na gaa yɩɛ dɩtakpaŋ. Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ ɩɩ ti na maŋ ŋ ga tala saŋa gaa ɩ tawɩ sɛ, kusee n nyina wʋŋ wʋ a kɔŋ Kpaŋjuo yɩrɩɛ naŋ na.&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Num 118:26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu chɔ baalɛ wʋrʋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ garɛ Yesu ju Farasi bɩnɛ wʋrʋ waa dʋɔ na wʋ a ga di. Sɛ Farasitina baa ba wɩɛ dɩmaŋ na fara baa pɩɛtɩ ɩ na dieli. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Baalɛ wʋrʋ wʋŋ wʋ wʋsɛ cha pʋʋ na wɩɛ wʋ asanaŋ dɩmaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ Farasitina na Mosesi mbara bakalaasa baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Daa mbara fa gbɩɛ sɛ dɩ n chɔ lʋm fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ yaa dɩ n ba chɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ama ba n tawɩ bʋrʋ ʋ. Sɛ Yesu mʋ wʋ pam jaga baalɛ wʋŋ dʋɔ sɛ wʋ chɔ ɩ, sɛ wʋ yela ɩ sɛ wʋ lam.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Sɛ wʋ tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ tɩba wʋ Mmʋɔ n wɩɛna bu baalɛ yaa naa baalɛ sɛ wʋ sala ditiribuo naŋ Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ sɛ wʋ aa lɩsɛ ɩ gabʋanaŋ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ama ba n dɩlɛ lɩsɛ wʋ wɩɛ ŋii nʋɔ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔna n wʋsɛ tie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Gʋ Yesu na gʋ bakpa baa ba yagɛ ba asadi adiya di a ŋmari jilima achaatɩŋ na, sɛ wʋ jɔ ba diduu sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />&lt;&lt;Sɛ wʋrʋ yagɛ nyaŋ sarɛ tie asadi adiya di na, n baa ga cha jilima dɩchatɩŋ, a dɩlɛ kɔŋ takɩɛ wʋ yagɛ wʋŋ wʋ kii nyaŋ na. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Sɛ dɩ kɔŋ dɩmʋŋ na, wʋŋ wʋ yagɛ amɩɛ bala na, wʋ a tawɩ nyaŋ sɛ, &lt;Kʋlʋ mʋ n gbeli fa wina.&gt; Na asaju a chaŋ nyaŋ na nyaa kʋlʋ ga cha wʋrʋgbɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ama sɛ wʋrʋ yagɛ nyaŋ asadi adiya di na, ju ga cha wʋrʋgbɩɛ ganaŋkʋ wʋŋ wʋ yagɛ nyaŋ kɔnɛ na, wʋ a gaa tawɩ nyaŋ sɛ, &lt;Ma dɩɛtɛ, kʋlʋ ga cha jilima dɩchatɩŋ.&gt; Dɩmaŋ sɛ nyaa yu jilima n dɔŋa baa wʋ yagɛ ba na asanaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Akala takɩɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a jiŋna wʋ wʋsɛ na, Ɩsʋɔ aja kɔna ɩ tie, sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a kɔna wʋ wʋsɛ tie na, Ɩsʋɔ aja jiŋna ɩ adugbe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ wʋŋ wʋ yagɛ ɩ asadi adiya di tie na sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nya yagɛ bakpa wiita yaa bʋyanɔ adiya di na, n baa yagɛ n dɩɛtina, n ŋmɩɛtina, n lʋŋtina yaa akpaŋtatina baa nyaŋ na ba ɩ chaɩ tirina na. Nya yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ na, baa gba baa yagɛ nyaŋ kɔŋ ba asadi adiya di tie na baa tɔ nyaŋ kɩm. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ama nyaa yagɛ bakpa asadi adiya di na, yagɛ ayɔŋtina, buobi aba, baa ba jaɩ-jaɩ, bataŋpʋna, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />na nyaa yu kusee. Wɩɛ takɩɛ baa dɩlɛ tɔ nyaŋ kɩm m, ama Ɩsʋɔ aja tɔ nyaŋ kɩm saŋa gaa wʋ a feŋsi bachirigisa feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ wɩɩ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asadi adiya di janɛ dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matiyo 22:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Sɛ bakpa baa ba na Yesu ba chaɩ baa di na tɩba wʋrʋ nyii wɩɛ ŋina na, wʋ tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kusee n nyina wʋkpa wʋŋ wʋ a di asadi adiya di Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ wʋrʋ n yagɛ bakpa fɔɩ asadi adiya di janɛ tie.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Gʋ di saŋa talɛ na, wʋ kpiri wʋ tʋmɩrɛ sɛ wʋ n ju ga tawɩ baa wʋ yagɛ ba na sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba n kɔŋ, ma yɩɛ bʋrʋkʋma taŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Gʋ wʋ tawɩ dɩmʋŋ na, &lt;&lt;Ba wʋkʋma yu nʋɔ lɩsɛ sɛ wʋ aa dɩlɛ kɔŋ ŋ. Wʋŋ wʋ dɔŋ asanaŋ na tawɩ sɛ, dɩtɩɛna gana sɛ ma lɩɛ tibi. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ maa dɩlɛ kɔŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Sɛ, &lt;&lt;Balatɛ wʋŋ dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ dɩtɩɛna gana sɛ ma lɩɛ naa baala gifi. Ma dɔŋ gbɩɛ naŋ maa ju maa mʋ ba ga yɩɛ kɩɛ, dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ maa dɩlɛ kɔŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋfɔlɛ dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ dɩtɩɛna gana sɛ ma taa saa alʋ, dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ maa dɩlɛ kɔŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Sɛ, &lt;&lt;Tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ gaa tawɩ wɩɛ ŋii kpiniŋ fa wʋ Kpaŋjuo. Sɛ waatɛ wʋŋ kara biŋbira sɛ wʋ tawɩ wʋ tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ sɛ, yɩɛ bileŋ ju dɩɛ gbɩɛ na dɩɛ naŋ gbɩɛsɛ bisi naŋ ga yagɛ ayɔŋtina, buobi aba, bataŋpʋna na baa ba jaɩ-jaɩ na kɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Gʋ wʋ ju ga yɩɛ ŋii wʋ kpaŋjuo tawɩ ɩ taŋ na, wʋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ gaa tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, ma yɩɛ ŋii nya dʋ maŋ na taŋ, ama achaatɩŋ saŋ ŋɩ wɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Sɛ Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ ti tawɩ wʋ tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ju gbɩɛsɛ na dɩɛsɛ bisi gbɩɛsɛ naŋ ga sʋlʋ bakpa kɔŋ na ma waa a su. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, bakpa baa ma yagɛ ba sɛ ba n kɔŋ na tɩba wʋrʋ taŋ wʋ a yu asadi adiya ŋii di i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kpam wɩɛ yawʋ doŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matiyo 10:37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Jama baa kpamɩna Yesu baa ju gbɩɛ, sɛ wʋ biliŋi kɩɛ ba tawɩ sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />&lt;&lt;Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a ja sɛ wʋ a kpaŋ maŋ sɛ wʋ aa ja maŋ kii wʋ lʋrʋda, wʋ alʋ na wʋ bie, wʋ ŋmɩɛtina na wʋ diesina na wʋ tɩŋtɩŋ wʋ wʋsɛ na, wʋ aa dɩlɛ yɩɛ ma wʋrʋgbɩɛtɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ n mʋ wʋ tɩŋtɩŋ wʋ daŋ gasagasa silɛ na wʋ a kpaŋ maŋ na, wʋ aa dɩlɛ yɩɛ ma wʋrʋgbɩɛtɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩ n mʋ takɩɛ amɩɛ tɩba wʋrʋ aja sɛ wʋ a ma danɛ jalɩŋtɛ, wʋ aa chɩŋkpɩɛ cha na wʋ a kɩɛ aterembie ŋii wʋ a tiri na wʋ a mʋ ma danɛ gaa ga taŋ?. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Akala takɩɛ wʋ si tie dɩpɔrɛ ama wʋ n dɩlɛ ma danɛ gaa taŋ na, wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a na ga na, wʋ a mʋɩ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Na wʋ a tawɩ sɛ baalɛ wina fara danɛ maa, ama wʋ n dɩlɛ taŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Yaa, &lt;&lt;Dɩ n mʋ takɩɛ Juo wʋrʋ aja sɛ wʋ a ju ga yuo na wʋ dʋɔ Juo, wʋ aa chɩŋkpɩɛ cha na wʋ a kɩɛ sɛ wʋ a dɩlɛ mʋ wʋ yuora kɔrʋɔsɛ gifi (10,000) ga yuo na wʋ dʋɔ Juo wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛna yuora kɔrʋɔsɛ nkuo (20,000)? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Sɛ wʋ na gʋ wʋ aa dɩlɛ na, wʋ a kpiri gabʋɔsɛ Juo wʋ baŋbaŋ wʋŋ jaŋ saŋa gaa wʋ saŋ wʋ wɩɛ taŋasɛ wʋ a kɔnɛ na, na baa ga ja wʋsɛfɩɛ kɔŋ ba tɩtɩba. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Dɩmʋŋ sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ aa dɩlɛ yela bʋrʋkʋma gaa wʋ a jawʋ na, wʋ aa dɩlɛ yɩɛ ma kpalɛnarɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yasɛ ŋii ŋɩ taŋ dieli na</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matiyo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maakɩ 9:50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yasɛ wɩɛ dieli, ama ŋɩ jʋŋ lɩɩ ŋɩ tɩba na, sɩnɛ sɛ ɩ yɩɛ ŋɛ na ŋii tii yɩɛ jʋŋ? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ŋɩ taŋ dieli fa tibi yaa fa adiya na ŋii bɩɩ ɩ, baa chɩɛgɩ tʋsʋ bɛ. Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛna dɩla na wʋ n nyii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Fie wʋ tʋsʋsa dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matiyo 18:12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Dɩ kɔŋ takɩɛ lampo lɩɛra na dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra kpiniŋ jaŋi Yesu jaŋ na baa nyii wʋ wɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ama Farasitina na Mosesi mbara bakalaasa baa fʋlʋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ wina a lɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra sɛ wʋ na ba a di.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ ba diduu sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />&lt;&lt;Dɩ n mʋ takɩɛ amɩɛ wʋrʋ wɩɛna feŋ gafie (100) sɛ wʋrʋ tʋsʋ. Wʋ aa yela ŋɩnara sala na saŋgʋ (99) baa si kasɛnaŋ dɩmaŋ na wʋ a ju ga ja wʋdʋŋdʋlʋŋ wʋŋ wʋ tʋsʋ na ga tala gʋ wʋ a na ɩ? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Wʋ na ɩ na, aja yɩɛ ɩ jʋŋ na wʋ a mʋ ɩ baa <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />na wʋ a ju waa dʋɔ. Na wʋ a yagɛ wʋ dɩɛtina na baa wʋ na ba cha ɩ tirina gaa jaŋi wʋ jaŋ, na wʋ a tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;N kpi ma dʋɔ na dɩ lɩɛ daa asa, akala takɩɛ ma na ma fie wʋŋ wʋ tʋsʋ na.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, dɩmʋŋ sɛ asadi aja kɔŋ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe lɩɩna dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛrɛ wʋ dʋŋdʋlʋŋ wʋŋ wʋ biliŋi lɩɩ wʋ dɩsʋbʋ naŋ kii gʋ bakpa ba chirigisa ŋɩnara sala na saŋgʋ (99) baa ba n tiri sɛ baa biliŋi lɩɩ ba dɩsʋbʋ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diterembi ga fʋlʋm gaa ga tʋsʋ na dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yaa dɩ n mʋ takɩɛ alʋ wʋrʋ wɩɛna diterembi fʋlʋm bie gifi sɛ ŋɩ tɩba garɛ tʋsʋ na, wʋ aa tʋʋ fitila na wʋ a kpa waa dʋɔ dɩmaŋ na wʋ a kɩɛ na dieli ga tala gʋ wʋ a na ga?. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Wʋ na ga na, wʋ a yagɛ wʋ dɩɛtina na baa wʋ na ba chaɩ tirina na gaa jaŋi wʋ jaŋ na wʋ a tawɩ sɛ n kpi ma dʋɔ na dɩ lɩɛ daa asa, akala takɩɛ ma na ma diterembi fʋlʋm gaa ga tʋsʋ na. <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, dɩmʋŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ gba asa aja lɩɛ lɩɩna dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛrɛ wʋ dʋŋdʋlʋŋ wʋŋ wʋ biliŋi lɩɩ wʋ dɩsʋbʋ naŋ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bu baalɛ wʋŋ wʋ tʋsʋ na dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ wʋrʋ cha wʋ wɩɛ wʋ wɩɛna bie baala bala. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Wɩɩ darɛ, wʋ pii jaŋ wʋŋ tawɩ wʋ juo sɛ, &lt;Majuo, kpara nya akpaŋta naŋ na nyaa mʋ ma teri fa maŋ.&gt; Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ kparɛ wʋ akpaŋta ŋii fa baa bala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Gɩyɩɛnɩŋ pii ŋarɛ wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, wʋ pii jaŋ wʋŋ yaa wʋ akpaŋta ŋii wʋ yu na kpiniŋ sɛ wʋ mʋ aterembie ŋii ju gbɩɛ ga cha dɩɛ taŋasɛ garɛ dʋɔ. Dɩmaŋ sɛ wʋ mʋ wʋ aterembie ŋii ga yɩɛ gɩjaga wɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Gʋ wʋ di wʋ a aterembie ŋii kpiniŋ taŋ na. Sɛ dusoŋ janɛ gaa ga nʋɔ wɩɛ doŋ kɔŋ tibi gaa dʋɔ. Sɛ wʋ wʋsɛ fara ŋii chaŋ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ ju dɩɛsɛ bu wʋrʋ jaŋ sɛ wʋ n fa ɩ dɩtʋm. Sɛ wʋ mʋ ɩ ju wʋ fʋɔnaŋ sɛ wʋ n ga kɩɛ wʋ ɔvaaba dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Dusoŋ a kʋ ɩ nafʋɔ wʋ yu na wʋ a di ɔvaaba adiya, ama wʋrʋ n fa ɩ ŋarɛ na wʋ a di i.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Gʋ dɩ ŋmaŋi wʋ asa dʋɔ na, sɛ wʋ fara wʋ a fa nfɩɛrɛ chawʋ gaa wʋ wɩɛ ga tɩba na, sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Majuo tʋmɩra wɩɛna adiya baa di baa kaa, yela ma wɩɛ jɩna dusoŋ a kʋ maŋ. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Maa bɔrɛ ju majuo jaŋ, na maa ga tawɩ ɩ sɛ, Majuo, ma yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ chicha Ɩsʋɔ na nyaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ma n daga na nyaa yagɛ maŋ sɛ n bu u, mʋ maŋ yɩɛ n tʋmɩra baa tɩba wʋrʋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ kʋlʋ wʋ a ju wʋjuo jaŋ. Gʋ wʋ saŋ wʋ wɩɛ taŋasɛ wʋ a kɔnɛ na, wʋjuo na ɩ sɛ wʋ wɩɛ yɩɛ ɩ gɩyɔŋ, sɛ wʋ se ga jaŋi na ɩ sɛ wʋ puga ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Sɛ bu baalɛ jaŋ wʋŋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Majuo, ma yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ chicha Ɩsʋɔ na nyaŋ. Ma n ti daga na nyaa yagɛ maŋ sɛ n bu u.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ama wʋjuo wʋŋ tawɩ wʋ tʋmɩra baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;N yɩɛ bileŋ, na ɩ mʋ adugbe gagba jalɩŋtɛ gabam mʋ fu ɩ. Ɩ mʋ kɔrɔ dʋ wʋ pam nyiŋbie na ɩ mʋ asibita dʋ wʋ nafara tie. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />N ju ga chaŋ naa baalie nuŋtɛ na ɩ kʋ ɩ mʋ yɩɛ adiya na dɩ di na dɩ lɩɛ daa asa. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Akala takɩɛ mabu baalɛ jaŋ wina dɩ yɩɛ takɩɛ wʋ sɩŋ sɛ wʋ feŋ. Dɩ yɩɛ takɩɛ wʋ tʋsʋ sɛ dɩ na ɩ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ba fara baa lɩɛ ba asa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Gʋ ŋina kpiniŋ a ju dʋɔ na, wʋbu bɩnɛ jaŋ wʋŋ wɩɛ fʋɔnaŋ. Gʋ wʋ lɩɩ fʋɔ wʋ a tirina waa na, wʋ nyii numbasɛ na sʋɔrɛ a ju dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ yagɛ tʋmɩra baa wʋrʋ sɛ wʋ tasɛ ɩ sɛ, be aaŋ ju dʋɔ bɛ? <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnabu wʋŋ n bɔrɛ kɔŋ sɛ njuo kʋ ɩ naa baalie nuŋtɛ, akala takɩɛ wʋ kɔŋ na nkpa na alaŋfiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Gʋ bu bɩnɛ jaŋ wʋŋ nyii dɩmʋŋ na, &lt;&lt;Wʋ kara biŋbira sɛ wʋ pɩɛ wʋ aa jʋʋ waa gaa dʋɔ ɔ. Sɛ wʋjuo ga sʋlʋ ɩ sɛ wʋŋ jʋʋ. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ama wʋ lɩsɛ wʋjuo nʋɔ sɛ nyii, bɩŋsɛ ŋina kpiniŋ ma tʋm nyaŋ takɩɛ tʋmɩrɛ sɛ ma n yɩɛ dɩla naŋ doŋ n wɩɛ dʋɔ ɔ. Ama nyaŋ fa ta maŋ ajala gba na maŋ na ma dɩɛtina dɩ mʋ lɩɛ daa asa a. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ama nbu wina wʋŋ wʋ ga warɩɛ nya akpaŋta ala jaga dʋɔ kɔŋ dɩɛ na bɩrɛ, nya kʋ naa baalie nuŋtɛ fa ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Sɛ wʋjuo wʋŋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mabu, nyaŋ bɩrɛ n wɩɛ ma jaŋ saŋa kʋma sɛ bʋrʋkʋma gaa ma wɩɛna na yɩɛ n teri. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ama ŋɩ tiri gʋ dɩ di asadi adiya di na dɩ lɩɛ daa asa, akala takɩɛ n nabu wina wʋ sɩŋ sɛ wʋ feŋ, wʋ tʋsʋ sɛ dɩ na ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kɩɛrɛ kpiŋjim-tɛ dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ diduu tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Akpaŋtatɛ wʋrʋ n cha wʋ wɩɛna sɛ wʋ wɩɛna kɩɛrɛ wʋŋ wʋ a kɩɛ wʋ akpaŋta dʋɔ. Sɛ ba pʋɩ ɩ fa wʋ kpaŋjuo wʋŋ sɛ wʋ a warɩɛ wʋ akpaŋta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ yagɛ ɩ sɛ wʋ tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be wɩɛ sɛ maa nyii lɩɩ n dʋɔ n na? Gaa kalaa maŋ ma akpaŋta ŋii nyaa kɩɛ dʋɔ na kpiniŋ nʋɔ, akala takɩɛ nyaa ti dɩlɛ yɩɛ ma akpaŋta dʋɔ kɩɛrɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Sɛ kɩɛrɛ wʋŋ fa nfɩɛrɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɩnɛ sɛ maa yɩɛ dɩtɩɛna? Ma Kpaŋjuo aja wʋ a lɩɛ ma dɩtʋm lɩɩ ma pamɩɛ naŋ. Ma taŋ doŋ na maa fara a, sɛ ŋɩ wɩɛ maŋ juu na maa ga sʋlʋ. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ma jiŋ bʋrʋ gaa maa yɩɛ, ganaŋkʋ ma dɩtʋm lɩɩ ma pamɩɛ naŋ na, bakpa aja lɩɛ maŋ ba waasɛ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ yagɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ dina wʋ Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ kɩm gaa jaŋi. Sɛ wʋ tasɛ asanaŋtɛ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɩm aŋmaŋ sɛ nya dina ma Kpaŋjuo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Olifi nuŋ galɔŋ gafisi jiŋinara. Sɛ kɩɛrɛ wʋŋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ mʋ n kɩm tanɛ na nyaa cha bileŋ na nyaa sabɩɛ gafisi sɩ nara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Sɛ wʋ tasɛ balatɛ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɩm aŋmaŋ sɛ nyaŋ dʋɔ n dina? Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, gamɩsɛ bʋɔtaŋ kɔrɔ. Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ mʋ n kɩm tanɛ na nyaa sabɩɛ gafisi jiŋinara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Gʋ akpaŋtatɛ wʋŋ nyii dɩmʋŋ na, &lt;&lt;Wʋ kalɩɛ kɩɛrɛ wʋŋ wʋ aa di gasiŋteŋ na kpiŋjim gbɩɛ gaa wʋ mʋna na dʋɔ. Akala takɩɛ tibi dʋɔ bakpa chamɩna dɩsɛ karɛ ba chaɩ na ba nabie kii Ɩsʋɔ bie.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, n mʋ amɩɛ dulunya akpaŋta mʋ yɩɛ dɩbam mʋ ja dɩɛtina, sɛ akpaŋta ŋii tam na, baa mʋ amɩɛ ju dɩchatɩŋ gaa ga taŋ gɩtɛ na naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ di gasiŋteŋ bʋrʋ pii dʋɔ na, wʋ a di gasiŋteŋ abʋrɩ fɔɩ dʋɔ. Sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ n di gasiŋteŋ bʋrʋ pii dʋɔ na, wʋ aa di gasiŋteŋ abʋrɩ fɔɩ gba dʋɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ aa di gasiŋteŋ dulunya akpaŋta dʋɔ na, Ɩsʋɔ baa yela wʋ a kɩɛ adugbe akpaŋta abama dʋɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Sɛ nyaa n di gasiŋteŋ wʋrʋ akpaŋta dʋɔ na, aja yɩɛ sɩnɛ na Ɩsʋɔ a fa amɩɛ tɩŋtɩŋ akpaŋta?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Tʋmɩrɛ wʋrʋ taŋ wʋ a dɩlɛ tʋŋ Kpaŋjuo aba bala a. Sɛ dɩ kɔŋ dɩmʋŋ na, wʋ a kɔla wʋrʋ na wʋ a ja wʋrʋ wɩɛ, yaa wʋ a mʋ wʋ wʋsɛ fa wʋrʋ na wʋ a kɩɛ wʋrʋ kpakpuo. Ɩɩ dɩlɛ tʋŋ Ɩsʋɔ na aterembie e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wɩɛ a tawɩsa ŋarɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matiyo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maakɩ 10:11-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Gʋ Farasitina baa baa ja aterembie na nyii wɩɛ ŋii Yesu tawɩ na, sɛ ba mʋɩ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ aaŋ yɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ takɩɛ ɩ yɩɛ ba chirigisa bakpa asa dʋɔ, ama Ɩsʋɔ bɩrɛ wʋ jiŋ amɩɛ agela naŋ. Ŋii ŋii su wʋkpa asa na, Ɩsʋɔ asanaŋ bɩrɛ, yɩɛ akɔlɛsa bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Pɔɩ na Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ wʋŋ a kɔŋ na, Mosesi mbara na Ɩsʋɔ bajana baa sabɩɛ wɩɛ. Ama lɩɩ Yohane saŋa na, ba jɔ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa dʋɔ Wɩɛ Abama ŋii dawuta, sɛ wʋkʋma a chɩdɩsɛ wʋ a ja wʋ a yu gbɩɛ jʋʋ. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ŋɩ taŋ doŋ fa Ɩsʋɔ adugbe na tie takɩɛ ŋii laŋ, ama ŋii yɩɛ doŋ takɩɛ mbara ŋii tɩba sabɩɛ ga pii garɛ aja lɩɩ tɩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ kʋma wʋŋ wʋ yela wʋ alʋ sɛ wʋ saa alʋ fɔlɛ na, wʋ yɩɛ alʋ wʋrʋgbɩɛ lɩɩ, sɛ baalɛ kʋma wʋŋ wʋ saa alʋ wʋŋ ba yela ɩ sarɛ na, wʋ yɩɛ alʋ wʋrʋgbɩɛ lɩɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aterembie-tɛ wʋŋ na Lasarosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ jɔ diduu gana sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ aterembietɛ wʋrʋ n cha wʋ wɩɛna. Saŋa kʋma wʋ a fu kirimaŋ lɩŋ gagba na dɩkalala gagba ŋii ŋɩ yawʋ wɩɛ doŋ. Wʋ a lɩɛ wʋ asa wɩɩ kʋma. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Baalɛ ayɔŋtɛ wʋrʋ dʋɔ cha wʋ wɩɛ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Lasarosi wʋŋ wʋ wʋsɛ kpiniŋ yɩɛ awʋnda. Saŋa kʋma baa mʋ ɩ baa kɔŋ baa si aterembie-tɛ wʋŋ waa buonɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Wʋ yu na nafʋɔ wʋ a di adiya ŋii ŋii lɩɩ ŋii sala aterembie-tɛ wʋŋ tebulu tie na. Paasɛ gba gaa nyɩsɩ wʋ awʋnda ŋii naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Dɩ kɔŋ takɩɛ, &lt;&lt;Ayɔŋtɛ wʋŋ sɩŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ gaa mʋ ɩ ju Abiraham jaŋ. Sɛ aterembietɛ wʋŋ gba sɩŋ sɛ ba wuu ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Gʋ wʋ wɩɛ awʋrʋfʋɔ bʋala naŋ na, wʋ a na awʋrʋfʋɔ na, wʋ jiŋna wʋ asa sɛ wʋ na Abiraham taŋasɛ-taŋasɛ yela Lasarosi wɩɛ wʋ jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Sɛ wʋ kuusi sɛ Majuo Abiraham, wɩɩ ma gɩyɔŋ na nyaa kpiri Lasarosi na wʋ a mʋ wʋ pam nyiŋbie ga nyʋ lɩŋ naŋ na wʋ a mʋ gaa tapʋ ma nʋɔjʋlʋŋ na gaa fɩɛ maŋ, akala takɩɛ maa na awʋrʋfʋɔ bʋala gana naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ama Abiraham lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mabu, nyiŋi gʋ saŋa gaa n chaɩ nkpa naŋ na, n wʋsɛ fɩɛ nyaŋ, sɛ Lasarosi bɩrɛ, wʋ na awʋrʋfʋɔ. Ama dɩtɩɛna bɩrɛ wʋ wʋsɛ fɩɛ ɩ jɩna, sɛ nyaŋ dʋɔ, n wɩɛ awʋrʋfʋɔ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Ŋina kpiniŋ wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, ogie janɛ garɛ duwei daa na amɩɛ tɩtɩba, wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a ja sɛ wʋ a lɩɩ daa jaŋ ju amɩɛ jaŋ na, wʋ aa dɩlɛ ɛ, dɩmʋŋ sɛ wʋrʋ gba baa dɩlɛ lɩɩ amɩɛ jaŋ kɔŋ daa jaŋ jɩna a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Sɛ aterembie-tɛ wʋŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ bɩrɛ, majuo, maa sʋlʋ nyaŋ, kpiri Lasarosi majuo waa dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Akala takɩɛ ma wɩɛna nabie baala jaŋ ba nʋŋ. Yela na wʋ a ju ga jɔ ba nyienaŋ ganaŋkʋ baa kɔŋ gaa na awʋrʋfʋɔ ŋina a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Sɛ Abiraham lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mosesi mbara na Ɩsʋɔ bajana sabɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii fɩla ŋɩ wɩɛ ba jaŋ, yela baa di ŋɩ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Aye, majuo Abiraham, wʋrʋ lɩɩ sira naŋ ju ba jaŋ na, baa biliŋi lɩɩ ba dɩsʋbʋ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba n nyii Mosesi mbara na Ɩsʋɔ bajana sabɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii na, hali wʋrʋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ ju ba jaŋ gba, ba aa lɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii wʋ tawɩ na di i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Dɩsʋbʋ dʋɔ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matiyo 18:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">Matiyo 18:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maakɩ 9:42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩ yɩɛ ganaŋkʋma, bʋrʋ gaa gaa yela sɛ bakpa a yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ na aja kɔŋ. Ama wʋŋ aja pala na wʋ dʋɔ kɔŋ na, wʋŋ lakʋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ŋɩ wɩɛ dieli fa ɩ takɩɛ ba mʋ bʋɩ ganamsa janɛ pɔgʋ wʋ lafu tie na baa lɔ ɩ dʋ ɔpʋ naŋ kii gʋ wʋ a yela na ba buruburu bana tɩba wʋrʋ aja yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ &lt;&lt;N kɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ dʋɔ na dieli. N dʋɔ lɩɛdɩrɛ yɩɛ nyaŋ dɩsʋbʋ na, tawɩ ɩ. Wʋ nyii wʋ wʋsɛ tie na, mʋ chɩɛ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Wʋ yɩɛ nyaŋ dɩsʋbʋ gbɩɛta lɩkaarɛ wiitabi, sɛ wʋ kɔŋ n jaŋ gbɩɛta lɩkaarɛ gaa tawɩ nyaŋ sɛ wʋ nyii wʋ wʋsɛ tie na, mʋ chɩɛ ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɩɛdi dʋɔ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Sɛ wʋ kpirida baa tawɩ Kpaŋjuo sɛ, &lt;&lt;Suri daa lɩɛdi dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Sɛ kpaŋjuo wʋŋ lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩ wɩɛna lɩɛdi pii takɩɛ kpeli daŋ bi na, nafʋɔ ɩ dɩlɛ tawɩ daŋ janɛ gana sɛ, &lt;Kuli ga baŋ ɔpʋ naŋ,&gt; gaa nyii amɩɛ wɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tʋmɩrɛ dɩtʋm yɩɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;&lt;Dɩ n mʋ takɩɛ amɩɛ tɩba Mmʋɔ n wɩɛna tʋmɩrɛ wʋ a farɛ n fʋɔ yaa wʋ a kɩɛ n feŋ dʋɔ, sɛ wʋ lɩɩ fʋɔ kɔŋ na, wʋ kpaŋjuo wʋŋ aja tawɩ ɩ sɛ yɩɛ bileŋ gaa cha na nya di?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Aye, ama wʋ a tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;Tɩŋɛ adiya na nyaa mʋ n wʋsɛ na nyaa fa maŋ adiya na maa di na maa nyʋɔ. Wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, nyaŋ gba nyaa di na nyaa nyʋɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Wʋ aa yɩlɩ wʋ tʋmɩrɛ wʋŋ ŋii wʋ dʋ ɩ sɛ wʋŋ yɩɛ sɛ wʋ yɩɛ naa? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Dɩmʋŋ sɛ amɩɛ gba ɩ yɩɛ bʋrʋkʋma gaa ba tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ n yɩɛ na, ɩ tawɩ sɛ dɩ yɩɛ tʋmɩra baa dɩ n daga na, dɩ yɩɛ dɩtʋm gaa ga tiri gʋ dɩ n yɩɛ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu chɔ baala achalaŋa gifi barɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Sɛ dɩ kɔŋ takɩɛ Yesu dɔŋ gbɩɛ dʋɔ wʋ a ju Yerusalem dɩɛ naŋ, wʋ mʋna Samariya na Galaliya dɩkpalɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Gʋ wʋ a jʋʋ dɩɛ bie garɛ naŋ na, baala gifi barɛ baa baa kili gɩchalaŋa jaŋina ɩ. Sɛ ba sɩŋ taŋasɛ <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />sɛ ba kuusi sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo Yesu wɩɩ daa gɩyɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Gʋ Yesu na ba na sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;N pala na ɩ mʋ amɩɛ wʋsɛ ga kalaa Ɩsʋɔ seina.&gt;&gt; Gʋ baa ju na sɛ ba na gʋ ba yu lʋm chʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Gʋ ba tɩba wʋrʋ na gʋ wʋ yu alaŋfiya na, wʋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ Yesu jaŋ, sɛ wʋ kuusi na doŋ kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Wʋ laŋ duo Yesu nafara tie sɛ wʋ yɩlɩ ɩ. Wʋ cha wʋ yɩɛ Samariya wʋkpa bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Naa bakpa gifi sɛ ma chʋɔ? Saŋgʋ baa wɩɛ le? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Be n yɩɛ sɛ wʋŋ wʋ ba yɩɛ Yuda wʋkpa na nyɩŋɩŋ n bɔrɛ kɔŋ gaa yɩlɩ Ɩsʋɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kʋlʋ pala, n lɩɛdi yela sɛ nya yu lʋm chʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa kɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matiyo 24:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">Matiyo 24:37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Wɩɩ darɛ, Farasitina baa barɛ tasɛ Yesu saŋa gaa Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa aja kɔŋ. Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩsʋɔ juori gaa ba yɩɛ bʋrʋ gaa bakpa aja mʋ ba asa na a <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />yaa bakpa aja tawɩ sɛ, &lt;N kɩɛ, ga wɩɛ jɩna,&gt; yaa &lt;Gaa n wɩɛna dɩmaŋ na.&gt; Akala takɩɛ ga fɩla ga wɩɛ amɩɛ tɩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Saŋa gʋrʋ a ja kɔŋ ɩ ja sɛ nafʋɔ ɩ na Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ŋii naŋ ŋarɛ, ama ɩɩ na a. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bakpa aja tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, &lt;N kɩɛ, wʋŋ n wɩɛna jɩna na,&gt; yaa &lt;Wʋŋ n wɩɛna dɩmaŋ na.&gt; N baa kpaŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ saŋa aja yɩɛ bɛ takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ duoni ŋmaŋi a charɩɛ na ŋii ŋmaŋi Ɩsʋɔ adugbe lɩɩ salɛ garɛ mʋ ju salɛ garɛ na. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ama ŋɩ tiri gʋ wʋ a chɩŋkpɩɛ na awʋrʋfʋɔ fɔɩ na jaŋ gɩnanaŋ a pɩɛ ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Ganaŋkʋ kɩɛna Nowa saŋa na, dɩmʋŋ sɛ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ saŋa aja yɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Bakpa cha baa di baa nyʋɔ yela baa saa ga tala wɩɩ gaa Nowa jʋʋ buori janɛ naŋ. Sɛ lɩŋ gaa su walɛ kʋ ba.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ sɛ ŋɩ chaɩ Lɔtɩ saŋa gaa naŋ. Bakpa cha baa di baa nyɔ, baa lɩɛ yela baa yaa, sɛ baa du yela baa ma danɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ama saŋa gaa Lɔtɩ a lɩɩ Sodom na, sɛ bʋala na abʋrɩ ŋii baa yagɛ sɛ sɔfa tibi lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe gaa sala ŋɩɛ ba kpiniŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ sɛ aja yɩɛ saŋa gaa Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ aja lɩsɛ wʋ wʋsɛ na. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Wɩɩ gana na, wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛ danɛ adugbe na, n baa tibi jʋʋ danɛ naŋ ga mʋ bʋrʋ. Dɩmʋŋ sɛ wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛ fʋɔnaŋ na, n baa yɩɛ wʋ nfɩɛrɛ sɛ wʋ a ti bɔrɛ kɔŋ dɩɛ gaa mʋ bʋrʋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />N nyiŋi ŋii ŋɩ mɩɛna Lɔtɩ alʋ na. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a ja wʋ a yu nkpa fa wʋ wʋsɛ na, ŋii jɔ ɩ. Ama wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ nkpa jɔ ɩ lɩɩ maŋ na Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ dʋɔ na, wʋ a yu nkpa. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, ma bɔrɛ kɔŋ wɩɩ yuluma na, bakpa bala aja duo mpa garɛ dʋɔ, baa mʋ wʋrʋ na baa yela wʋrʋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Ala bala aja naŋ gamɩsɛ bʋɩ garɛ dʋɔ, baa mʋ wʋrʋ na baa yela wʋrʋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Baala bala aja wɩɛ fʋɔnaŋ, baa mʋ wʋrʋ na baa yela wʋrʋ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naa Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii kpiniŋ n wɩɛna ŋina a</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Sɛ Yesu kpalɛnara baa tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Daa Kpaŋjuo, le sɛ ŋina aja tibi?&gt;&gt; Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Diele gaa atatɛ wɩɛ na, dɩmaŋ sɛ ajɩsaŋ asila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Okulapu na wɩɛ diri wʋrʋ dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ diduu mʋ kalaa wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ ba n jɔ dɩga saŋa kʋma na ba pamɩɛ naŋ n baa yɔgɔsɛ na dɩga jɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wɩɛ diri wʋrʋ n cha wʋ wɩɛna dɩɛ garɛ naŋ wʋ aa se Ɩsʋɔ sɛ wʋ ba chamɩna wʋkpa wʋ a yagɛ bʋrʋ ʋ. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Okulapu wʋrʋ gba cha wʋ wɩɛ dɩɛ gana naŋ. Wɩɩ kʋma wʋ dɔŋ wɩɛ diri wʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ a sʋlʋ ɩ sɛ di wɩɛ ŋɩ gbɩɛ dʋɔ fa maŋ na maa di dɩlɛ ma ɔdʋŋ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Okulapu wʋŋ pala wɩɛ diri wʋŋ dʋɔ taŋgɩlɛ ama wʋ aa dʋ ɩ nʋɔ ɔ. Ama wʋrʋgbɩɛ na wʋ tawɩ wʋ wʋsɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wɩɛ tɩba sɛ maa se Ɩsʋɔ sɛ ma ba chamɩna wʋkpa maa yagɛ bʋrʋ ʋ, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ama ganaŋkʋ okulapu wina a nyala maŋ na dʋɔ, maa tawɩ wɩɛ ŋɩ gbɩɛ dʋɔ na wʋ a di dɩlɛ na wʋ a yela maŋ ga nyala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Sɛ kpaŋjuo tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyii wɩɛ ŋii wɩɛ diri wʋŋ wʋ aa di wɩɛ ŋɩ gbɩɛ dʋɔ na tawɩ. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Sɛ yɩɛ dɩmʋŋ na, be n yɩɛ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ baa di wɩɛ ŋɩ gbɩɛ dʋɔ fa bakpa baa wʋ lɩsɛ ba sɛ baa wii baa yagɛ ɩ wiita na yuluma na a di dɩlɛ? Wʋ a taŋgɩlɛ na amɩɛ chɔna? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, Ɩsʋɔ aja yela na ɩ yu wɩɛ ŋɩ gbɩɛ dʋɔ bileŋ. Ama Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ na, wʋ gaa na bakpa baa ba wɩɛna lɩɛdi na tibi dʋɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farasi wʋkpa na lampo lɩɛrɛ dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Sɛ Yesu ti bɔrɛ jɔ diduu fa baa baa kɩɛ ba wʋsɛ sɛ ba gbɩɛsɛ chirigi yela baa kɩɛ wʋkʋma kpakpuo na sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Baala bala barɛ ju Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ na baa ga jɔ dɩga. Wʋrʋ cha wʋ yɩɛ Farasi wʋkpa sɛ wʋrʋ dʋɔ yɩɛ lampo lɩɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Sɛ Farasi wʋkpa wʋŋ kʋlʋ sɩŋ jɔ dɩga mʋ wʋ wʋsɛ adugbe sɛ Ɩsʋɔ, maa yɩlɩ nyaŋ gʋ ma ba yɩɛ ŋmɩɛla baa ba chamɩna doŋ baa lɩɛ bakpa abʋrɩ, dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra, lɩɩ wʋ alʋ wʋrʋgbɩɛ yaa lɩɩ wʋ baalɛ wʋrʋgbɩɛ takɩɛ baa ba kakaa na, yaa dɩmʋŋ lampo lɩɛrɛ wina. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Maa chaŋ nʋɔ pɔgʋ bʋla suoji kʋma, sɛ maa fa ma gifi naŋ garɛ ŋii maa yu na kpiniŋ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ama lampo lɩɛrɛ wʋŋ kʋlʋ sɩŋ laraŋ gatʋŋgʋrʋ mʋ wʋ nyi wuu, sɛ wʋ mʋ wʋ pamɩɛ jaga wʋ digela dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩsʋɔ, ma yɩɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛrɛ bɛ, wɩɩ ma gɩyɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ lampo lɩɛrɛ wʋŋ n bɔrɛ ju dɩɛ takɩɛ wʋ chirigi Ɩsʋɔ asanaŋ, naa Farasi wʋkpa wʋŋ ŋ. Akala takɩɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a jiŋna wʋ wʋsɛ na, Ɩsʋɔ aja kɔna ɩ tie, sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a kɔna wʋ wʋsɛ tie na, Ɩsʋɔ aja jiŋna ɩ adugbe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yɩɛ bachaasɛ bisi kusee</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matiyo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maakɩ 10:13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Sɛ bakpa barɛ mʋ bachaasɛ bisi kɔna Yesu sɛ wʋ n mʋ wʋ pam jaga ba dʋɔ. Ama gʋ wʋ kpalɛnara baa na dɩmʋŋ na, baa gɩŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ama Yesu yagɛ bachaasɛ bisi baa kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N yela na bachaasɛ bisi baa a kɔŋ ma jaŋ, ama n baa gaa ba gbɩɛ, akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ juori gaa yɩɛ baa ba kɩɛna dɩmʋŋ na teri bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Maa tawɩ sɛ n nyii na dieli sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ n lɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ Juori di takɩɛ wʋchaa pii na, wʋ aa dɩlɛ jʋʋ ʋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na akpaŋtatɛ wʋrʋ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matiyo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maakɩ 10:17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Sɛ Yudatina bɩnɛ wʋrʋ tasɛ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa wʋbam, be n tiri gʋ ma n yɩɛ na maa yu nkpa ŋii ŋɩ taŋ gɩtɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ nyaa yagɛ maŋ sɛ wʋbam? Wʋrʋ taŋ wʋ yɩɛ wʋbam m, amʋɔ Ɩsʋɔ nyiŋeŋ. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />N jiŋ Ɩsʋɔ mbara ŋii ŋii kalaa sɛ, &lt;N baa yɩɛ baalɛ wʋrʋgbɩɛ lɩɩ yaa alʋ wʋrʋgbɩɛ lɩɩ, n baa tagapʋ, n baa ŋmɩɛlɛ, n baa di akarɩɛ seriya, na nyaa bu njuo na nnaa.&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ɛsa 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Ditiro 5:16-20</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Sɛ baalɛ wʋŋ tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, lɩɩ ma gɩchasɩtɩɛ sɛ ma kpaŋ mbara wɩɛ ŋina kpiniŋ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Gʋ Yesu nyii dɩmʋŋ na, sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩkaka nyaŋ bʋrʋ darɛ. Ju ga yaa bʋrʋkʋma gaa nya wɩɛna, na nyaa mʋ aterembie ŋii ga fa ayɔŋtina, na nyaa yu akpaŋta Ɩsʋɔ adugbe. Na nyaa gaa kpaŋ maŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Gʋ aterembie-tɛ wʋŋ nyii ŋina na, dɩ n yɩɛ ɩ jʋŋ ŋ, akala takɩɛ wʋ wɩɛna akpaŋta na dieli. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Sɛ Yesu kɩɛ ɩ sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Aja yɩɛ doŋ fa akpaŋtatina na baa jʋʋ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Aja fʋ fa nyɔma na wʋ a mʋna dɩkparɛ bʋɔ naŋ, ama aja yɩɛ wiliŋ fa akpaŋtatɛ na wʋ a jʋʋ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Sɛ baa ba nyii wɩɛ ŋii na tasɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ bɩrɛ Mmʋɔ sɛ baa mɔlɔgɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ŋii wʋkpa baa dɩlɛ yɩɛ na, Ɩsʋɔ bɩrɛ, wʋ a dɩlɛ yɩɛ bʋrʋkʋma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Sɛ Petero tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩ yela bʋrʋkʋma gaa kpaŋ nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ sɛ n nyii na dieli sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ a yela wʋ waa yaa wʋ alʋ yaa wʋ ŋmɩɛtina yaa wʋ lʋrʋda yaa wʋbie Ɩsʋɔ juori gaa dʋɔ na, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />wʋ a yu ŋarɛ kpi saŋa gana dulunya na wʋ a ti yu nkpa ŋii ŋɩ taŋ gɩtɛ dulunya gaa gaa kɔŋ na naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tawɩ butoro-tɛ lɩɩna wʋ sɩŋ dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matiyo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maakɩ 10:32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Sɛ Yesu mʋ wʋ kpalɛnara baa lɩɩ laraŋ, sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;N nyii, dɩ ju Yerusalem dɩɛ naŋ, bʋrʋkʋma gaa Ɩsʋɔ bajana baa sabɩɛ mʋ lɩɩna Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ dʋɔ si na, aja kɔŋ tɩba. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Baa lɩsɛ ɩ fa baa ba ba yɩɛ Yudatina na baa jabi ɩ, tii ɩ, tɔ mɩtalɩŋ fu ɩ, taɩ ɩ achʋchʋɛ na baa kʋ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Ama wɩɛ atoro wɩɩ na, wʋ a feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ama wʋ kpalɛnara baa n nyii wɩɛ ŋii wʋ a tawɩ na tie ɩ. Wɩɛ ŋii wʋ tawɩ na tie cha wɩsɛ ba, sɛ ba ba jiŋ wɩɛ ŋii wʋ a tawɩ na dʋɔ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu fulu ɔtaŋpʋ sʋlʋdɛ wʋrʋ asa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matiyo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maakɩ 10:46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Gʋ Yesu tirina Yeriko dɩɛ na, baalɛ ɔtaŋpʋ wʋrʋ chaɩ gbɩɛ laraŋ wʋ a sʋlʋ. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Gʋ wʋ nyii bakpa fɔɩ a yɩɛ galaŋba baa lam na, wʋ tasɛ sɛ be aaŋ ju dʋɔ bɛ? <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Sɛ ba lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesu Nasarati wʋkpa wʋŋ aaŋ lam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Sɛ wʋ kuusi tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesu, Juo Dawidi ganana bie wɩɩ ma gɩyɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Sɛ bakpa baa ba dɔŋ asanaŋ na fuba wʋ dʋɔ sɛ wʋ n fu wʋ nʋɔ dʋɔ. Ama wʋ ju dʋɔ kuusi na doŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Juo Dawidi ganana bie, wɩɩ ma gɩyɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Sɛ Yesu dʋɔsɩŋ sɛ wʋ dʋ ba sɛ ba n mʋ ɔtaŋpʋ wʋŋ kɔnɛ ɩ. Gʋ wʋ kɔŋ Yesu jaŋ na, wʋ tasɛ ɩ sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />&lt;&lt;Be sɛ nyaa ja sɛ maa yɩɛ fa nyaŋ?&gt;&gt; Sɛ ɔtaŋpʋ wʋŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, maa ja sɛ maa na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Na abʋrɩ, n lɩɛdi chɔ nyaŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Gabʋanaŋ sɛ wʋ asa fulu sɛ wʋ kpaŋ Yesu wʋ a kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ. Gʋ bakpa baa kpiniŋ na ŋii ŋɩ tibi na, ba kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Sakiyosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu jʋʋ Yeriko dɩɛ naŋ mʋna wʋ a lam. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Baalɛ wʋrʋ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Sakiyosi wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ lampo lɩɛra bɩnɛ, sɛ wʋ wɩɛna akpaŋta na cha wʋ wɩɛ dɩmaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Wʋ cha wʋ a ja sɛ wʋ a na wʋkpa wʋŋ Yesu yɩɛ na, ama jama baa dʋɔ wʋ n dɩlɛ na ɩ ɩ. Akala takɩɛ wʋ yɩɛ wʋkpa guŋ bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ se ju asanaŋ ga jiŋ sikamo daŋ na wʋ a yu gbɩɛ na Yesu, akala takɩɛ dɩmaŋ sɛ Yesu aja mʋna.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Gʋ Yesu tala daŋ gaa tie na, wʋ kɩɛ adugbe sɛ wʋ na ɩ, sɛ wʋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sakiyosi, tibi kɔŋ bileŋ n waa dʋɔ sɛ maa sui jaŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Sɛ wʋ tibi bileŋ mʋ asadi yɩɛ ɩ nsa-nsa mʋ ɩ ju wʋ waa dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Gʋ bakpa baa kpiniŋ na ŋina na, ba fara baa fʋlʋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋ ju ga sui dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ama Sakiyosi kʋlʋ sɩŋ sɛ wʋ tawɩ kpaŋjuo sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɩɛ Kpaŋjuo, maa kpara ma akpaŋta naŋ bʋla na maa mʋ bʋdʋŋdʋlʋŋ fa ayɔŋtina. Ma ŋɩrɛ wʋrʋ doŋ dʋɔ lɩɛ wʋ bʋrʋ na, maa tɔ ɩ kɩm dɩmʋŋ gbɩɛta bʋnara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Jaŋ, mɔlɔgɩ kɔŋ waa gana dʋɔ, akala takɩɛ baalɛ wina gba yɩɛ Abiraham ganana bie bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Akala takɩɛ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ kɔŋ na wʋ a gaa mɔlɔgɩ baa ba tʋsʋ na bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tʋmɩra gifi barɛ dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matiyo 25:14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Gʋ bakpa baa a nyii Yesu wɩɛ na, wʋ ju dʋɔ jɔ diduu fa ba, akala takɩɛ wʋ tirina Yerusalem dɩɛ sɛ bakpa baa jiŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa aja kɔŋ gabʋanaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ wʋkpa kpari wʋrʋ n ju dɩɛ taŋasɛ garɛ naŋ na baa ga si ɩ juo na wʋ a bɔrɛ kɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Pɔɩ na wʋ a laŋ na, wʋ yagɛ wʋ tʋmɩra gifi fa ba aterembie mina gifi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mina garɛ yɩɛ dɩtʋm yɩɛrɛ gafɩtasɛ sɩ toro kɩmtʋɔ</char></note> sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ n mʋ aterembie ŋina ga di yawʋ ga tala gʋ maa bɔrɛ kɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ama lɩɩna gʋ wʋ dɩɛnaŋtina a kɔla ɩ na dʋɔ, ba kpiri gabʋɔsɛ ju tibi kɩɛrɛ wʋjanɛ wʋŋ wʋ a si ɩ juo na jaŋ ga tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩ ja baalɛ wina a gaa yɩɛ daa Juo o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama ba si ɩ Juo na wʋ bɔrɛ kɔŋ dɩɛ. Sɛ wʋ kpiri yagɛ wʋ tʋmɩra baa wʋ fa ba aterembie na, na wʋ a kɩɛ tɔnʋɔ ŋii ba yu kpi na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Asanaŋtɛ wʋŋ kɔŋ gaa tawɩ sɛ, Kpaŋjuo, ma yu aterembie mina gifi kpi nya aterembie mina gifi ŋii nya fa maŋ na dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Sɛ wʋ Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma tʋmɩrɛ wʋbam, n sa na dɩtʋm. Ganaŋkʋ nya dɩlɛ di gasiŋteŋ pii ŋina dʋɔ na, maa fa nyaŋ yikuo na nyaa di dɩɛsɛ gifi dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />&lt;&lt;Balatɛ wʋŋ kɔŋ gaa tawɩ sɛ Kpaŋjuo, ma yu aterembie mina anʋŋ kpi nya aterembie mina ŋii nya fa maŋ na dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Sɛ wʋ Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ gba, maa yela nyaa di dɩɛsɛ anʋŋ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Sɛ ba torotɛ wʋŋ kɔŋ gaa tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, nya aterembie mina mɩnaŋ. Ma mʋ ŋɩ pɔgʋ dɩpaŋtaŋ naŋ wɩsɛ gatʋŋgʋrʋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Akala takɩɛ maa se nyaŋ sɛ n wɩɛ wɩɛ doŋ. Nyaa lɩɛ bʋrʋ gaa ga ba yɩɛ n teri na sɛ nyaa kara bʋrʋ gaa nya n duu u.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Sɛ wʋ Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ tʋmɩrɛ sʋbʋ, n wɩɛ dʋɔ sɛ maa sɩŋ fu nyaŋ dɩpʋɛ. N cha n jiŋ gʋ ma wɩɛ wɩɛ doŋ, maa lɩɛ bʋrʋ gaa ga ba yɩɛ ma teri na sɛ maa kara bʋrʋ gaa ma n duu u. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Be n yɩɛ sɛ nya n mʋ ma aterembie ga si aterembie dɩsɩɩtɩŋ ganaŋkʋ ma kɔnɛ na, maa gaa lɩɛ ŋɩ na ŋɩ tɔnʋɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ baa ba sɩmɩɛɩ dɩmaŋ na sɛ, &lt;&lt;N lɩɛ aterembie mina ŋii lɩɩ wʋ jaŋ na ɩ mʋ kpi wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛna aterembie mina gifi na dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Sɛ ba tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, wʋ fɩla wʋ wɩɛna aterembie gifi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Sɛ kpaŋjuo wʋŋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, &lt;wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛna bʋrʋ garɛ na, Ɩsʋɔ aja mʋ ŋarɛ kpi wʋ dʋɔ. Ama wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ tana bʋrʋ garɛ na, ŋii wʋ wɩɛna na gba, Ɩsʋɔ aja lɩɛ lɩɩ wʋ jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Dɩtɩɛna n mʋ ma badʋŋna baa baa ja sɛ ma n yɩɛ ba juo na, kɔna maŋ jɩna na ɩ kʋ ba ma asanaŋ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu jʋʋ Yerusalem dɩɛ naŋ takɩɛ Juo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matiyo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maakɩ 11:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Gʋ Yesu jɔ dɩmʋŋ diduu gana taŋ na, wʋ pala wʋ kpalɛnara baa asanaŋ wʋ na ba a ju Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Gʋ Yesu tirina Betifage na Betaniya dɩɛsɛ bisi ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ Olifi dasɛ bʋrɔŋ bie gaa dʋɔ na, wʋ kpiri wʋ kpalɛnara baa tɩba bala, sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />&lt;&lt;N ju dɩɛ bie gaa ga wɩɛ amɩɛ asanaŋ na naŋ. Gʋ ɩ jʋʋ na, ɩ na kpaŋa bie wʋŋ wʋrʋ n cha ta wʋ dʋɔ na pɔgaɩ. N buoli ɩ kɔna maŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Wʋrʋ tasɛ amɩɛ sɛ be n yɩɛ sɛ ɩ buoli ɩ na? N tawɩ ɩ sɛ, Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ n tiri ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Sɛ baa wʋ kpiri ba na, ju ga na ɩ takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ wʋ tawɩ ba na. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Gʋ baa buoli kpaŋa bie wʋŋ na, sɛ wʋ Kpaŋjuo aba tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ ɩ buoli ɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Sɛ ba lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ n tiri ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Gʋ ba mʋ kpaŋa bie wʋŋ kɔna Yesu na, ba mʋ ba adugbe gagbasɛ jaga wʋ dʋɔ sɛ ba chɔna ɩ sɛ wʋ cha wʋ dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Gʋ wʋ a ju na, sɛ bakpa mʋ ba adugbe gagbasɛ tɔ gbɩɛ naŋ sɛ wʋ n pala dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Gʋ Yesu tirina Yerusalem diele gaa gbɩɛ tibi gaa ju olifi dasɛ bʋrɔŋ gaa tie na, sɛ wʋ kpalɛnara jama baa kpiniŋ kuusi na doŋ asadi naŋ baa kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ lɩɩna adaŋgana ŋii ba naa na kpiniŋ dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Sɛ ba tawɩ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">&lt;&lt;Kusee n nyina Juo wʋŋ wʋ kɔŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">Ɩsʋɔ yɩrɛ naŋ!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Num 118:26</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">Wʋsɛfɩɛ wɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe sɛ jilima n ju fa Ɩsʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Sɛ Farasitina baa barɛ baa ba wɩɛ jama baa tɩba na tawɩ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, tawɩ n kpalɛnara sɛ ba n fu ba nʋɔsɛ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ ba fu ba nʋɔsɛ dʋɔ na, bʋɛ aja kuusi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wii fa Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Gʋ Yesu tirina Yerusalem sɛ wʋ na dɩɛ gaa na, wʋ wii fa ga, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nafʋɔ n jiŋ ŋii ŋii fa nyaŋ wʋsɛfɩɛ jaŋ wɩɩ gana na, ama ŋɩ wɩsɛ nyaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Saŋa garɛ aja kɔŋ, n badʋŋna aja ma dɩpɔrɛ logo nyaŋ, na baa logo nyaŋ na baa gaa nyaŋ lɩɩ laraŋ-laraŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Baa warɩɛ nyaŋ na n bie kpiniŋ. Baa yela bʋɩ garɛ a jaga ga dʋɔ-dʋɔ ɔ. Akala takɩɛ nya n na saŋa gaa Ɩsʋɔ kɔŋ gaa mɔlɔgɩ nyaŋ na a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu gɩŋ yawʋ dira lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matiyo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maakɩ 11:15-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Sɛ Yesu jʋʋ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ. Sɛ wʋ fara wʋ a geŋ baa baa di yawʋ na wʋ a lɩɩ dɩmaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba sabɩɛ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii naŋ sɛ, &lt;Ma tʋm danɛ aja yɩɛ dɩga danɛ.&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Yis 56:7</ref>.</char></note> Ama ɩ mʋ dɩmaŋ yɩɛ ŋmɩɛla baa ba chamɩna doŋ baa lɩɛ bakpa abʋrɩ na dɩchatɩŋ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Yere 7:11</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Wɩɩ kʋma wʋ a kalaa Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ, ama Ɩsʋɔ sei bɩnɩɛ, Mosesi mbara bakalaasa na dɩɛ bɩnɩɛ baa fara baa ja gbɩɛ gaa baa mʋna dʋɔ na baa kʋ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ama ba n yu gbɩɛ na baa kʋ ɩ ɩ, akala takɩɛ bakpa baa ba wɩɛ dɩmaŋ na kpiniŋ kaŋ ba dɩla baa nyii wʋ kalaa ŋii.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu yikuo dʋɔ wɩɛ tasɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matiyo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maakɩ 11:27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Gɩyɩɛ gʋrʋ, Yesu cha wʋ wɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ wʋ a kalaa Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ yela wʋ a tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ Wɩɛ Abama ŋii. Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ sei Bɩnɩɛ, Mosesi mbara bakalaasa na dɩɛ bɩnɩɛ kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Sɛ ba tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Tawɩ daa, yikuo gamʋɔ sɛ nya wɩɛna sɛ nyaa yɩɛ abʋrɩ ŋina? Mmʋɔ n fa nyaŋ dɩmʋŋ yikuo gana?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maŋ gba maa tasɛ amɩɛ wɩɛ a dʋŋdʋlʋŋ. N tawɩ maŋ, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ wʋŋ Ɩsʋɔ sɔ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ bɛ yaa wʋkpa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Sɛ ba tawɩ ba nyiŋeŋ-nyiŋeŋ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ ŋɩ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ na, wʋ a tasɛ daa sɛ be n yɩɛ sɛ dɩ n lɩɛ Yohane Ɩsʋɔ Sɔrɛ wʋŋ di? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ama sɛ dɩ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ ŋɩ lɩɩ bakpa na, bakpa baa kpiniŋ aja lɔ bʋɛ kʋ daa, akala takɩɛ ba lɩɛ di gʋ Yohane cha wʋ yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ ɔja bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, ba lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩ ba jiŋ diele gaa ga lɩɩ na a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maŋ gba, maa tawɩ amɩɛ yikuo gaa maa mʋ maa yɩɛ ŋina kpiniŋ na a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fʋɔ kɩɛra barɛ dʋɔ diduu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matiyo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maakɩ 12:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ jɔ bakpa bana diduu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ wʋrʋ n cha fara girepi fʋɔ sɛ wʋ mʋ dʋ kɩɛra barɛ pamɩɛ naŋ. Sɛ wʋ ju gbɩɛ ga taŋgɩlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Gʋ girepi bie karɩŋ saŋa talɛ na, sɛ girepi fʋɔtɛ wʋŋ kpiri wʋ tʋmɩrɛ fʋɔ kɩɛra baa jaŋ sɛ wʋ n ju ga lɩɛ wʋ teri kɔna ɩ. Ama fʋɔ kɩɛra baa tugu ɩ sɛ ba gɩŋ ɩ bɔsɩna pamɩɛ kpaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Sɛ girepi fʋɔtɛ wʋŋ ti kpiri tʋmɩrɛ wʋfɔlɛ. Wʋŋ gba, ba tugu ɩ sɛ ba du ɩ asaju sɛ ba gɩŋ ɩ bɔsɩna pamɩɛ kpaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Sɛ wʋ ti kpiri batoro-tɛ sɛ wʋŋ gba ba tugu laragi ɩ sɛ ba gɩŋ ɩ lɩɩ fʋɔ gaa naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Sɛ girepi fʋɔtɛ wʋŋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be sɛ maa yɩɛ? Maa kpiri ma tɩŋtɩŋ mabu baalɛ jaŋ wʋŋ maa ja wʋ wɩɛ, akʋtɔfɩɛ wʋŋ bɩrɛ, baa bu ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama fʋɔ kɩɛra baa tawɩ dɔŋa sɛ wina n nyina gapatɩɛ diiri wʋŋ. N kɔŋ na dɩ kʋ ɩ na gapatɩɛ gaa a yɩɛ daa teri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, ba fɔŋɩ ɩ lɩɩ girepi fʋɔ gaa naŋ sɛ ba kʋ ɩ. Sɛ Yesu tasɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be sɛ fʋɔtɛ wʋŋ aja wʋ a yɩɛ fʋɔ kɩɛra baa? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Wʋ a kɔŋ gaa kʋ fʋɔ kɩɛra baa na wʋ a mʋ fʋɔ gaa dʋ kɩɛra ba fɔlɩɛ pamɩɛ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Sɛ Yesu kɩɛ ba sɛ wʋ tasɛ ba sɛ dɩmʋŋ bɩrɛ, sɩnɛ sɛ ɩ nyii wɩɛ ŋii ba sabɩɛ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii naŋ sɛ ŋii tawɩ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;&lt;&lt;Bʋɩ gaa danɛ mara pɩɛ ga na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">gaa aaŋ ja gaa chaŋ danɛ gaa dɩkɔŋ naŋ na doŋ.&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Num 118:22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Wʋkʋma wʋŋ wʋ sala bʋɩ gaa dʋɔ na, gaa karɩɛ-karɩɛ ɩ aguŋda-aguŋda. Sɛ wʋkʋma wʋŋ bʋɩ gaa sala wʋ dʋɔ na, gaa patɩɛ ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lampo tɔ dʋɔ wɩɛ tasɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matiyo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maakɩ 12:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Sɛ Mosesi mbara bakalaasa na sei bɩnɩɛ baa ja gbɩɛ gaa baa mʋna dʋɔ na baa chaŋ ɩ dɩmaŋ gana, akala takɩɛ ba jiŋ gʋ wʋ jɔ diduu baŋ ba. Ama baa se bakpa baa.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Sɛ ba fara baa kɩɛ Yesu na dieli. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ ba kpiri pɩɛtɩra baa ba yɩɛ ba wʋsɛ takɩɛ ba yɩɛ bachirigisa na, sɛ ba n ga yii ɩ gʋdʋ ganaŋkʋ baa yu wʋ nʋɔ naŋ wɩɛ na baa chaŋ ɩ mʋ dʋ Romatina tibi kɩɛrɛ wʋŋ pamɩɛ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, pɩɛtɩra baa tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, dɩ jiŋ gʋ nyaa tawɩ sɛ nyaa kalaa ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ dieli sɛ nyaa tɔɔsɩ tɩba a, ama nyaŋ bɩrɛ, nyaa kalaa Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ yɩɛ gasiŋteŋ ŋɩ gbɩɛ dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Tawɩ daa, Mosesi mbara fa gbɩɛ sɛ dɩ n tɔ lampo fa Kayisa yaa dɩ n baa tɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ama Yesu jiŋ gʋ baa ja baa yii ɩ gʋdʋ, wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />&lt;&lt;N mʋ diterembi dinari garɛ kɔna maŋ na maa kɩɛ.&gt;&gt; Sɛ ba mʋ kɔna ɩ sɛ wʋ tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Mmʋɔ nyi na wʋ yɩrɛ n jaga na ga dʋɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Sɛ ba lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Juo Kayisa teri.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ bɩrɛ, n mʋ ŋii ŋɩ yɩɛ Juo Kayisa teri na fa Juo Kayisa na ɩ mʋ ŋii ŋɩ yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ teri na fa Ɩsʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Pɩɛtɩra baa n dɩlɛ yu wɩɛ ŋarɛ sɩŋ dʋɔ chaŋ ɩ lɩɩ ŋii wʋ tawɩ na bakpa baa tɩba dɩmaŋ ŋ. Gʋ wʋ lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ na, dɩ yɩɛ ba doba sɛ ba fu ba nʋɔsɛ dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ dʋɔ wɩɛ tasɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matiyo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maakɩ 12:18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Sɛ Sadukitina baa baa lɩɛ baa di sɛ feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ wɩɛ na barɛ kɔŋ Yesu jaŋ gaa tasɛ ɩ sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />&lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, Mosesi mbara ŋii naŋ na, wʋ sabɩɛ fa daa Yudatina sɛ, baalɛ sɩŋ yela wʋ alʋ sɛ ba n lʋrʋ na, ŋɩ tiri gʋ wʋnabu n saa okulapu wʋŋ na wʋ a lʋrʋ bie fa wʋ ŋmɩɛtɩ wʋŋ wʋ sɩŋ na. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Juo lʋrʋbie baala jaŋ lɩkaarɛ barɛ n cha ba wɩɛna. Sɛ ba tɩba bɩnɛ jaŋ wʋŋ saa alʋ, wʋ n lʋrʋ ʋ sɛ wʋ sɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Wʋnabu balatɛ saa okulapu wʋŋ. Wʋŋ dʋɔ, wʋ n lʋrʋ ʋ sɛ wʋ sɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Dɩmʋŋ sɛ dɩ mɩɛna batoro-tɛ wʋŋ. Baala lɩkaarɛ baa kpiniŋ saa alʋ wʋŋ ama ba n lʋrʋ ʋ sɛ ba sɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, sɛ alʋ wʋŋ gba sɩŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ wɩɩ na, ba tɩba Mmʋɔ alʋ n nyina alʋ wʋŋ?&gt;&gt; Akala takɩɛ juo lʋrʋbie lɩkaarɛ baa kpiniŋ saa ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dulunya gana naŋ bɩrɛ, bakpa a saa <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ama baa ba daga baa cha dulunya gaa gaa kɔŋ na naŋ, na Ɩsʋɔ a feŋsi ba feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ na, baa saa a, <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />sɛ baa ti sɩŋ ŋ, akala takɩɛ baa kɩɛna bɛ takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ na. Baa yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ bie bɛ, akala takɩɛ ba feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Dɩtɩɛna, lɩɩna atatina feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ na, ɩŋ karaŋ Mosesi tanɛ naŋ ganaŋkʋ bʋala a chaŋ dɩpʋnfa naa? Dɩmaŋ sɛ Ɩsʋɔ tawɩ Mosesi sɛ, &lt;Maŋ n nyina Abiraham Ɩsʋɔ, Isaki Ɩsʋɔ na Yakubu Ɩsʋɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Wʋ ba yɩɛ atatina Ɩsʋɔ ɔ, ama wʋ yɩɛ bakpa ba kɩɛnasa Ɩsʋɔ bɛ, akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ jaŋ na, ba kpiniŋ ba chaɩ nkpa naŋ bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Sɛ Mosesi mbara bakalaasa baa barɛ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, n lɩsɛ nʋɔ na dieli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ganaŋkʋ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ na dʋɔ, wʋrʋ n ti dɩlɛ yu digela tasɛ ɩ wɩɛ ŋarɛ ɛ.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirisito dʋɔ wɩɛ tasɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matiyo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maakɩ 12:35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be dʋɔ ɩ tawɩ sɛ Kirisito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kirisito tie akala sɛ nkpalɩɛrɛ. Girikitina a yagɛ sɛ Kirisito sɛ Yudatina a yagɛ sɛ Mesaya</char></note> wʋŋ yɩɛ Dawidi ganana bie? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Sɛ Dawidi tɩŋtɩŋ tawɩ Kirisito wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ Numba tanɛ naŋ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Ɩsʋɔ wʋŋ tawɩ ma Kpaŋjuo sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">cha ma pam jɩsaŋ dʋɔ<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />ga tala gʋ maa mʋ n badʋŋna mʋ yɩɛ n nafara dɩjagatɩŋ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Num 110:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dawidi tɩŋtɩŋ a yagɛ Kirisito sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, sɩnɛ sɛ Kirisito wʋŋ a ti dɩlɛ yɩɛ Dawidi ganana bie?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">N kɩɛ na dieli mbara bakalaasa baa dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matiyo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maakɩ 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Gʋ bakpa baa kpiniŋ kaŋ dɩlɛ baa nyii Yesu wɩɛ na, wʋ tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />&lt;&lt;N kɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ dʋɔ mbara bakalaasa baa dʋɔ. Baa fu gagbasɛ ajalɩŋtina ba dɔŋ ba dɔŋ, na bakpa a luuŋ yɩlɩ ba gɩyɩɛnɩŋ naŋ. Baa ja achaatɩŋ ajanɩɛ Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ, na achaatɩŋ ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ jilima na asadi adiya di tie. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Baa mʋna kpiŋjim gbɩɛ dʋɔ baa lɩɛ bakʋlapʋna gapatɩɛ. Baa jɔ dɩga jalɩŋtɛ takɩɛ ba yɩɛ bakpa ba bama. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ, Ɩsʋɔ aja fɔŋɩ dɩmʋŋ bakpa bana dɩlɛ fɔɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Alʋ okulapu wʋrʋ faa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maakɩ 12:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Gʋ Yesu wɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ na sɛ wʋ jiŋna wʋ asa adugbe kɩɛ, sɛ wʋ na gʋ akpaŋtatina chamɩna ba faa baa dʋ faa dɩdaka gaa naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Sɛ wʋ na alʋ okulapu ayɔŋtɛ wʋrʋ mʋ kpaŋnyɔ ala ju ga dʋ faa dɩdaka gaa naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ sɛ n nyii na dieli sɛ dɩmʋŋ alʋ okulapu ayɔŋtɛ wina mʋ aterembie dʋ faa dɩdaka gaa naŋ kii wʋkʋma. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Akala takɩɛ bakpa baa kpiniŋ lɩsɛ chonii bɛ lɩɩ ba akpaŋta naŋ dʋ faa dɩdaka naŋ. Ama okulapu ayɔŋtɛ wʋŋ bɩrɛ, wʋ lɩɩ wʋ gɩyɔŋ naŋ bɛ sɛ wʋ mʋ pii ŋii wʋ a di na kpiniŋ ju ga dʋ faa dɩdaka gaa naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ warɩɛwʋ dʋɔ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matiyo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maakɩ 13:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Yesu kpalɛnara baa tɩba barɛ cha tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ na ganaŋkʋ ba mʋ bʋɛ a janɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ dieli ma ga, na faa ŋii ba yɩɛ ŋɩ chɩrɩchɩrɩ fa Ɩsʋɔ na dʋɔ wɩɛ. Ama Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />&lt;&lt;Ŋii ɩ na jɩna n na, saŋa garɛ aja kɔŋ, bʋɩ garɛ baa ti jaga ga dʋɔ dʋɔ ɔ. Baa salɩɛ ŋɩ kpiniŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awʋrʋfʋɔ na ganyala dʋɔ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matiyo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maakɩ 13:3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Sɛ Yesu kpalɛnara baa tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋkalaasa, saŋa gamʋɔ sɛ ŋina aja tibi sɛ be daasɛ aaŋ ja kalaa gʋ ŋina aja tibi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ ba nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N kɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ dʋɔ na dieli, na wʋrʋ n baa pɩna amɩɛ. Akala takɩɛ bakpa fɔɩ aja kɔŋ ma yɩrɛ naŋ na baa gaa tawɩ sɛ, &lt;Baa n nyina Kirisito wʋŋ&gt; na &lt;Saŋa gaa tirina.&gt; Ama n baa kpaŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Ɩ nyii yuo gaa ga tirina amɩɛ na yuo gaa ga wɩɛ taŋasɛ wɩɛ na, n baa yela na amɩɛ agela a kʋlʋ. Ŋɩ tiri gʋ ŋina a chɩŋkpɩɛ tibi, ama ŋii kalaa sɛ dulunya dɩtamtɩŋ talɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Atawɩ yɩrɩ aja yuo dɔŋa na juori a yuo juori. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Tibi jigisi, wɔŋfɩrɛ na lʋmɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ nʋɔ wɩɛ doŋ aja kɔŋ akpie dʋɔ-akpie dʋɔ, na abʋrɩ ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ na daasɛ ajanɩɛ a lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe kɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Sɛ wʋ ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama ma yɩrɛ dʋɔ, baa chaŋ amɩɛ na baa yɩɛ amɩɛ awʋrʋfʋɔ, baa mʋ amɩɛ ju Yudatina tʋm danɛ naŋ na baa ga di amɩɛ wɩɛ, na baa mʋ amɩɛ ga dʋ danɛ dɩtʋɔtɩŋ, baa mʋ amɩɛ kɔŋ juoneŋ na Romatina bɩnɩɛ baa baa kɩɛ Isirali tibi dʋɔ na asanaŋ, pɔɩ na ŋina kpiniŋ a kɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ ɩ yu gbɩɛ tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ Wɩɛ Abama ŋii fa ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Ama n baa fa nfɩɛrɛ nyala amɩɛ wʋsɛ ja wɩɛ ŋii ɩ tawɩ lɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ na dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Akala takɩɛ maa fa amɩɛ wɩɛ na kpiŋjim ŋii ɩ mʋ tawɩ na amɩɛ badʋŋna n baa dɩlɛ tawɩ sɛ ŋii ɩ tawɩ na taŋ tɩba yaa ŋii ɩ tawɩ na ba yɩɛ gasiŋteŋ ŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Amɩɛ lʋrʋda, nabie, lʋŋtina, na dɩɛtina aja lɩsɛ amɩɛ fa na baa kʋ amɩɛ tɩba barɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Ma dʋɔ, bakpa kpiniŋ aja kɔla amɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ama amɩɛ nyi nyʋɔ garɛ gba baa tʋsʋ ʋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ɩ sɩŋ na doŋ na, ɩ yu nkpa ŋii ŋɩ taŋ gɩtɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tawɩ Yerusalem warɩɛwʋ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matiyo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maakɩ 13:14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩ na gʋ yuora logo Yerusalem na, n jiŋ gʋ ga warɩɛwʋ tirina. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ɩ na ŋɛ dɩmʋŋ na, n yela na baa ba wɩɛ Yudiya tibi dʋɔ na, a se ju bʋrɔŋsɛ dʋɔ, na baa ba wɩɛ Yerusalem na n lɩɩ, sɛ baa ba taŋ dɩɛ janɛ gaa naŋ na n baa jʋʋ dɩɛ gaa naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Akala takɩɛ ŋina n nyina saŋa gaa Ɩsʋɔ aja wʋ a fɔŋɩ Yerusalem dɩlɛ na ŋii yela Ɩsʋɔ wɩɛ ŋii ba sabɩɛ si na a kɔŋ tɩba. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Dɩmʋŋ gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ŋina naŋ na, fililietina na alʋsɔna baa lakʋ! Akala takɩɛ bakpa wʋsɛ aja chaŋ ba awʋrʋfʋɔ tibi gana dʋɔ, sɛ Ɩsʋɔ biŋbira aja kɔŋ Yudatina dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Baa mʋ yuo dabɩlasɛ kʋ barɛ, na baa chaŋ ba barɛ dʋɔ takɩɛ danɛtʋɔra mʋ ju dɩɛsɛ ngoriŋ-ngoriŋ dʋɔ. Sɛ baa ba ba yɩɛ Yudatina na aja baa di Yerusalem dʋɔ ga tala gʋ saŋa gaa Ɩsʋɔ mʋ fa ba na aja ju gɩtɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ aja bɔrɛ kɔŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matiyo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maakɩ 13:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Daasɛ wɩɛ aja yɩɛ wiita na gafita na achikpebi naŋ. Sɛ ɔpʋ galaŋba na apaa jʋɔ aja yela na atawɩ yɩrɩ wʋsɛ achaŋ ba tibi dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Nyɩŋtɩɛ aja chaŋ bakpa na baa kiriŋ ŋii ŋii kɔŋ tibi dʋɔ na dʋɔ, akala takɩɛ abʋrɩ ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe na kpiniŋ aja jigisi. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Dɩmʋŋ saŋa gana naŋ na, baa na Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ a kɔnɛ na yikuo na jilima janɛ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ tanɩɛ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Gʋ ŋina kpiniŋ fara ŋii tibi na, n kʋlʋ sɩŋ na ɩ jiŋna amɩɛ asa kɩɛ adugbe, akala takɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ a kɔŋ na wʋ a gaa lɩɛ amɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">N kɩɛ figi daŋ na ɩ kpalɩɛna bʋrʋ garɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matiyo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maakɩ 13:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Sɛ Yesu jɔ ba diduu garɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N kɩɛ figi daŋ na dasɛ ŋii ŋɩ kakaa na kpiniŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Ŋii pɔrɔgɩ na, n jiŋ gʋ awuluŋ tirina. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Dɩmʋŋ gba sɛ ɩ na gʋ ŋina kpiniŋ a tibi na, n jiŋ gʋ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa tirina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Maa tawɩ sɛ n nyii na dieli sɛ gɩnanaŋ gana baa laŋ ŋ ga tala saŋa gaa ŋina kpiniŋ aja tibi. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Ɩsʋɔ adugbe na tie aja laŋ, ama ma wɩɛ ŋii bɩrɛ, ŋii laŋ ŋ.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">N kɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ dʋɔ na dieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Sɛ Yesu ju dʋɔ tawɩ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;N kɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ dʋɔ na dieli, n baa mʋ amɩɛ wʋsɛ fa asadi fɔɩ, sʋlʋŋ dɩɛsɛ na chawʋ naŋ nfɩɛrɛ su amɩɛ agela naŋ, na dɩmʋŋ wɩɩ gana n baa gaa purugi amɩɛ takɩɛ gʋdʋ achaŋ nam na. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Akala takɩɛ wɩɩ gaa maa kɔŋ na aja purugi bakpa baa ba chaɩ tibi dʋɔ na kpiniŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ n kɩɛ amɩɛ wʋsɛ dʋɔ na dieli, na ɩ jɔ dɩga saŋa kʋma na e yu doŋ mʋ sɩŋ ŋii ŋii kɔŋ tibi dʋɔ na kpiniŋ naŋ. Na ɩ dɩlɛ sɩŋ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ asanaŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Wɩɩ kʋma Yesu cha wʋ a kalaa bakpa Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ. Sɛ bʋyanɔ kʋma, wʋ a ju wʋ a duo olifi dasɛ bʋrɔŋ gaa dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Sɛ nafo kʋma, bakpa baa kpiniŋ a kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ gaa naŋ baa nyii wʋ wɩɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ba jɔ Yesu wʋsɛ dʋɔ dɩkɔŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matiyo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maakɩ 14:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Gʋ Yudatina a kɔŋ baa gaa di Bodobodo gaa ga Tana Yiisi Asadi Adiya di gaa baa yagɛ sɛ Nyiŋi Asadi Adiya di<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudatina nyiŋi asadi adiya di yɩɛ gɩyɩɛnɩŋ ŋii baa di ba mʋ ba nyiŋi ganaŋkʋ Ɩsʋɔ lɩsɛ baa lɩɩ Misirim tibi dʋɔ </char></note> tirina na. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Sei Bɩnɩɛ na Mosesi mbara bakalaasa baa cha baa ja gbɩɛ gaa baa mʋna dʋɔ wɩsɛ chaŋ Yesu na baa kʋ ɩ, ama baa se bakpa baa.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi kpa gʋ wʋ a lɩsɛ Yesu fa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matiyo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maakɩ 14:10-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Sɛ Sɩtanɩ jʋʋ Yudasi, wʋŋ baa yagɛ sɛ Isikariyoti tɩba. Wʋ yɩɛ kpirida gifi bala baa tɩba wʋrʋ bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Sɛ Yudasi ju Ɩsʋɔ sei bɩnɩɛ na Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ kɩɛra jaŋ ga pɔgʋ na ba ganaŋkʋ wʋ a lɩsɛ Yesu fa ba na. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Ba asadi sɛ ba kpa gʋ baa fa ɩ aterembie. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Sɛ Yudasi kpa sɛ wʋ fara wʋ a ja gbɩɛ gaa wʋ a mʋna dʋɔ lɩsɛ Yesu fa yela jama baa n na a.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na wʋ kpalɛnara desina na baa di nyiŋi wɩɩ adiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matiyo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maakɩ 14:12-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Wɩɩ gaa Yudatina a di Bodobodo gaa ga Tana Yiisi, sɛ baa kʋ nyiŋi asadi adiya di fiebu mʋ diesi gadiesa talɛ na. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Sɛ Yesu kpiri Petero na Yohane sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba n ju ga desina diele gaa dɩ di Nyiŋi Asadi Adiya di adiya na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Sɛ ba tasɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Le sɛ nyaa ja sɛ dɩ ga desina si?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩ jʋʋ dɩɛ janɛ gaa naŋ na, ɩ jaŋina baalɛ wʋrʋ wʋ siana sapɩɛ bie na lɩŋ. N kpaŋ ɩ ju waa gaa wʋ a jʋʋ ga dʋɔ na. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />N tawɩ waatɛ wʋŋ sɛ, &lt;Wʋkalaasa wʋŋ sɛ, kalaa daa mʋɔra danɛ gaa maŋ na ma kpalɛnara dɩ cha tɩba di Nyiŋi Asadi Adiya di adiya ŋii na?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Wʋ a kalaa amɩɛ abaŋsʋrʋ danɛ janɛ garɛ ba desina ga tɩba na. Dɩmaŋ sɛ n yɩɛ nyiŋi asadi adiya di adiya ŋii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Sɛ ba ju ga na bʋrʋkʋma ganaŋkʋ Yesu tawɩ ba na. Sɛ ba yɩɛ Nyiŋi Asadi Adiya di adiya ŋii dɩmaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpaŋjuo adiya ŋii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matiyo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maakɩ 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Koronto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Gʋ saŋa gaa talɛ sɛ baa di na, Yesu na wʋ kpirida baa ga cha baa di. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Jawʋ sɛ maa ja sɛ maŋ na amɩɛ dɩ di Nyiŋi Asadi Adiya di adiya ŋii pɔɩ na maa na awʋrʋfʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, maa ti di dɩmʋŋ adiya ŋina a ga tala ganaŋkʋ ŋɩ di tie aja kɔŋ tɩba Ɩsʋɔ juori gaa naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Sɛ Yesu mʋ gafie bie gaa wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ wɩɛ tɩba sɛ wʋ yɩlɩ Ɩsʋɔ sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;N lɩɛ na ɩ nyʋɔ fa dɔŋa. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Akala takɩɛ maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, maa ti nyʋɔ bobi wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ ŋina ŋarɛ ɛ ga tala gʋ Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa aja kɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Sɛ Yesu mʋ bodobodo, sɛ wʋ yɩlɩ Ɩsʋɔ sɛ wʋ jaɩ-jaɩ tɩba mʋ fa ba tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma wʋsɛ mɩnaŋ ma chamɩna maa fa amɩɛ. N yɩɛ ŋina mʋ nyiŋi maŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Dɩmʋŋ sɛ gʋ ba di taŋ na, wʋ mʋ gafie bie na wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ ŋii ŋɩ wɩɛ gafie bie gana naŋ na n nyina ma asima ŋii ŋɩ chɩɛgɩ wʋrʋgɩ fa amɩɛ, ŋii n gaa Ɩsʋɔ na bakpa dɩkɔŋ fɔlɛ gaa ba jʋɔ na nʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Kɩɛ, wʋŋ wʋ a lɩsɛ maŋ fa na, wʋ chaɩ ma jaŋ didiitiŋ jiŋna. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ aja sɩŋ ganaŋkʋ ba sabɩɛ si na. Ama wʋkpa wʋŋ wʋ a lɩsɛ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ fa na, wʋŋ lakʋ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Sɛ ba fara baa tasɛ dɔŋa ba tɩba wʋŋ wʋ a yɩɛ ŋina na.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɩndɛ di dʋɔ noro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Sɛ dɩkɔŋ takɩɛ Yesu kpalɛnara baa a di dɔŋa noro wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ bɩnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baa ba ba yɩɛ Yudatina na juoneŋ a mʋ yikuo bɛ baa di ba bakpa dʋɔ sɛ baa yagɛ ba wʋsɛ sɛ bakpa chɔnara. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ama amɩɛ bɩrɛ, n baa yɩɛ takɩɛ ba. Ama amɩɛ tɩba wʋjaŋ-janɛ n yɩɛ wʋ wʋsɛ takɩɛ wʋ pii, sɛ wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ asanaŋtɛ amɩɛ tɩba na, n yɩɛ wʋ wʋsɛ takɩɛ tʋmɩrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Mmʋɔ n nyina wʋjanɛ, wʋŋ wʋ chaɩ tebulu gaa jaŋ wʋ a di na yaa wʋŋ wʋ a tʋm na? Naa wʋŋ wʋ chaɩ tebulu jaŋ wʋ a di naa? Ama maŋ bɩrɛ, ma wɩɛ amɩɛ jaŋ takɩɛ tʋmɩrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Amɩɛ n sɩmana ma wʋrʋgbɩɛ ma awʋrʋfʋɔ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ Majuo mʋ juori gaa fa maŋ na, dɩmʋŋ sɛ maŋ gba maa mʋ fa amɩɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />ganaŋkʋ ɩ di na ɩ nyʋɔ ma juori naŋ na ɩ cha juorigbeli gaa dʋɔ di Isirali buonɔsɛ gifi ala ŋii dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Simoŋ, Simoŋ, nyii! Sɩtanɩ sʋlʋ gbɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ jaŋ na wʋ a mʋna lɔ tɩba dʋɔ fuosi amɩɛ takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ faradɛ a fuosi gamɩsɛ duofu wʋ a lɩsɛ bie naŋ na. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ama Simoŋ, ma jɔ dɩga fa nyaŋ ganaŋkʋ nyaa yela n lɩɛdi tɩba a. Sɛ nya bɔrɛ kɔŋ ma jaŋ na, dʋ n dɔŋa baa doŋ naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Ama Petero lɩsɛ nʋɔ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, ma yɩɛ siriya takɩɛ yɩɛ danɛ dɩtʋɔtɩŋ bɛ ʋ, sɩŋ naŋ bɛ ʋ, maŋ na nyaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Petero, maa tawɩ nyaŋ sɛ, pɔɩ na dijimba akɔlɛ jaŋ na, nyaa pɩɛ butoro sɛ n ba jiŋ maŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aterembie takpe, didiku na yuo dabɩla dʋɔ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ wʋ kpalɛnara baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Gʋ ma kpiri amɩɛ sɛ ɩŋ mʋ aterembie takpe, adiku yaa asibita na, bʋrʋ garɛ tiri amɩɛ yaa?&gt;&gt; Sɛ ba lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Aye, bʋrʋ n tiri daa a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama dɩtɩɛna bɩrɛ, wʋŋ wʋ wɩɛna aterembie takpe na adiku na wʋ n mʋ. Sɛ wʋŋ wʋ n tana yuo dabɩla na, wʋŋ n yaa wʋ adugbe gagbasɛ na ɩ mʋ lɩɛ ŋarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Akala takɩɛ ba sabɩɛ ma wʋsɛ dʋɔ wɩɛ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii naŋ si sɛ, &lt;Ba kalaa maŋ kpi dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra dʋɔ.&gt; Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ ŋɩ tiri gʋ ŋina a kɔŋ tɩba ma dʋɔ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Yis 53:12</ref>.</char></note> Maa tawɩ amɩɛ sɛ, ŋɩ tiri gʋ ŋina kpiniŋ a kɔŋ tɩba. Gasiŋteŋ ŋii ba sabɩɛ si lɩɩ ma dʋɔ na aja kɔŋ tɩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Sɛ Yesu kpalɛnara baa tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo kɩɛ, yuo dabɩlasɛ ala mɩnaŋ. Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ dɩ mɩɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu jɔ dɩga Olifi dasɛ Bʋrɔŋ dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matiyo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maakɩ 14:32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu ju Olifi dasɛ bʋrɔŋ dʋɔ ganaŋkʋ wʋ fɩla wʋ a ju na. Sɛ wʋ kpalɛnara baa kpaŋ ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Gʋ ba tala dɩmaŋ na, wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;N jɔ dɩga na n baa jʋʋ lɔ tɩba naŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Sɛ Yesu ju wʋ asanaŋ chonii luuŋ wʋ dʋna dʋɔ sɛ wʋ jɔ dɩga sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Majuo, nyaa jawʋ na yela na dɩmʋŋ awʋrʋfʋɔ ŋina a giligi maŋ. Ama naa ŋii maa jawʋ na a, ama ŋii nyaa jawʋ na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔ lɩɩ Ɩsʋɔ adugbe kɔŋ wʋ jaŋ gaa dʋ ɩ doŋ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Gʋ wʋ wɩɛ gayɩyɩɛ gana naŋ na, wʋ mʋ dɩsɛ chɩbɛ jɔ dɩga sɛ wʋ wʋsɛ difɩŋ yɩɛ takɩɛ asima ŋii wʋrʋgɩ tibi naŋ.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Gʋ wʋ jɔ dɩga taŋ na, wʋ bɔrɛ ju wʋ kpalɛnara baa jaŋ, sɛ wʋ gaa na gʋ ba duo akala takɩɛ ba wʋsɛ cha yɔgɔsɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ ɩ duo? N kʋlʋ sɩŋ na ɩ jɔ dɩga na n baa jʋʋ lɔ tɩba naŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba chaŋ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matiyo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maakɩ 14:43-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Gʋ Yesu saŋ wʋ a tawɩ na, kɩɛ jama baa kɔŋ dɩmaŋ sɛ Yudasi Isikariyoti wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ wʋ kpirida gifi bala baa tɩba wʋrʋ na pala ba asanaŋ. Sɛ wʋ tirina Yesu sɛ wʋ puga ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yudasi, n chamɩna puga nyaa lɩsɛ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ nyaa fa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Gʋ Yesu kpalɛnara baa na bʋrʋ gaa ga tibi na, ba tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋjuo, dɩ n lɩsɛ daa yuo dabɩlasɛ na dɩ yuo ba yaa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Sɛ Yesu kpalɛnara baa tɩba wʋrʋ lɩsɛ yuo dabɩla kara Ɩsʋɔ sei bɩnɩɛ naŋ bɩnɛ wʋŋ tʋmɩrɛ dɩlɛ jɩsaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ama Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;N yela!&gt;&gt; Sɛ Yesu mʋ wʋ pam tapʋ baalɛ wʋŋ dɩlɛ gaa sɛ ga mataa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ sei bɩnɩɛ naŋ bɩnɛ na Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ kɩɛra na dɩɛ bɩnɩɛ baa ba kɔŋ baa gaa chaŋ ɩ na sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma yɩɛ ŋmɩɛlɛ wʋŋ wʋ chamɩna doŋ wʋ a lɩɛ bakpa abʋrɩ bɛ sɛ ɩ mʋ yuo dabɩlasɛ na akolie ɩ kɔŋ ɩ chaŋ maŋ? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Wɩɩ kʋma ma wɩɛ amɩɛ jaŋ Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ, ama ɩŋ chaŋ maŋ ŋ. Ama amɩɛ saŋa n talɛ takɩɛ Sɩtanɩ yikuo n di juo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero pɩɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matiyo 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maakɩ 14:53-54</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">14:66-72</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Yuora baa chaŋ Yesu sɛ ba mʋ ɩ ju sei bɩnɛ wʋŋ waa dʋɔ yela Petero kpamɩna ba nafarɛ-nafarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ba dʋ bʋala waa gaa tɩtɩba ba chaɩ baa wʋlʋ sɛ Petero ga cha ba jaŋ, <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Sɛ tʋmɩrɛ galibie wʋrʋ na Petero wʋ chaɩ wʋ a wʋlʋ bʋala. Sɛ wʋ kɩɛ ɩ na dieli tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ baalɛ wina cha kpi Yesu dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ama Petero pɩɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Alʋ, ma ba jiŋ ɩ ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Gʋ dɩ yɩɛ chonii na, wʋrʋ dʋɔ ti na Petero sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ gba n yɩɛ ba tɩba wʋrʋ bɛ.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Petero tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ, ma ba yɩɛ ba tɩba wʋrʋ ʋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Aja yɩɛ takɩɛ karafɩɛ garɛ wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, sɛ wʋ fɔlɛ dʋɔ ti bɔrɛ baŋ ŋɩ dʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Gasiŋteŋ baalɛ wina gba cha kpi Yesu dʋɔ, akala takɩɛ wʋ yɩɛ Galaliya wʋkpa bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Sɛ Petero lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ, ma ba jiŋ wɩɛ ŋii nyaa tawɩ na a!&gt;&gt; Gʋ wʋ saŋ wʋ a tawɩ na, sɛ dijimba kɔlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Sɛ Kpaŋjuo biliŋi kɩɛ Petero. Dɩmaŋ sɛ Petero nyiŋi wɩɛ ŋii Kpaŋjuo tawɩ ɩ na sɛ, &lt;&lt;Pɔɩ na dijimba akɔlɛ jaŋ yuluma na, n taŋ fɩla pɩɛ butoro sɛ n ba jiŋ maŋ ŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Sɛ Petero lɩɩ ju asʋŋ ga wii fɔɩ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba jabi Yesu sɛ ba tugu ɩ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matiyo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maakɩ 14:65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Baala baa baa kɩɛ Yesu dʋɔ na fara baa jabi ɩ yela baa tugu ɩ. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Ba pɔgʋ wʋ asa sɛ ba tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbala kalaa daa wʋŋ wʋ taɩ nyaŋ na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Sɛ ba ju dʋɔ tawɩ atawɩ jaga mʋ tii ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba mʋ Yesu kɔŋ wɩɛ didiitiŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matiyo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maakɩ 14:55-64</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Gʋ tɩɛna na, dɩɛnaŋ bɩnɩɛ naŋ bɩnɩɛ dikpeŋ gaa, sei bɩnɩɛ na na Mosesi mbara bakalaasa kpiniŋ kpi ba dʋɔ gaa sila, sɛ ba mʋ Yesu gaa sɩŋ ba asanaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Sɛ ba tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ n nyina Kirisito wʋŋ na, tawɩ daa.&gt;&gt; Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma tawɩ amɩɛ na ɩɩ lɩɛ maŋ di i, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />sɛ ma tasɛ amɩɛ na, ɩɩ lɩsɛ maŋ nʋɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ama lɩɩ dɩtɩɛna mʋ a ju na, Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ aja cha Ɩsʋɔ doŋtɛ wʋŋ pam jɩsaŋ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Sɛ ba kpiniŋ ba tasɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩmʋŋ bɩrɛ, nyaŋ n nyina Ɩsʋɔ Bu wʋŋ?&gt;&gt; Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;E tawɩ gasiŋteŋ bɛ maŋ mɩnaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Sɛ ba tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ dɩ ti dɩ ja seriyatina? Dɩ nyii lɩɩ wʋ tɩŋtɩŋ wʋ nʋɔnaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ba mʋ Yesu ga sɩŋ Pilato asanaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matiyo 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">11:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maakɩ 15:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Sɛ bakpa baa kpiniŋ kʋlʋ mʋ Yesu ga fa Pilato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pilato yɩɛ Romatina bɩnɛ wʋŋ wʋ a kɩɛ Yudatina tibi dʋɔ</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Sɛ ba fara baa pɔɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Dɩ na gʋ baalɛ wina a warɩɛ Yudatina barɛ nfɩɛrɛ sɛ ba n kʋlʋ sɩŋ Romatina dʋɔ na ba n baa tɔ lampo fa Juo Kayisa, sɛ wʋ ti bɔrɛ tawɩ sɛ wʋ yɩɛ Kirisito, Juo wʋŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Sɛ Pilato tasɛ Yesu sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaŋ n nyina Yudatina Juo naa?&gt;&gt; Sɛ Yesu lɩsɛ nʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ŋii sɛ n tɩŋtɩŋ nya tawɩ na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Sɛ Juo Pilato tawɩ Ɩsʋɔ sei bɩnɩɛ na jama baa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ma n na wɩɛ ŋii maa sɩŋ ŋɩ dʋɔ fu baalɛ wina dɩpʋɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ama ba saŋ ba sɩmɩɛɩ dʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋ mʋ wʋ kalaa fuosi dʋ bakpa kpiniŋ Yudiya tibi dʋɔ. Wʋ fara lɩɩ Galaliya bɛ mʋ gaa lɩɩ jɩna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Gʋ Pilato nyii wɩɛ ŋina na wʋ tasɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalɛ wina yɩɛ Galaliya wʋkpa bɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Gʋ wʋ jiŋ gʋ Yesu lɩɩ tibi gaa Juo Hɛrɔdɩ yɩɛ juo ga dʋɔ na, wʋ mʋ ɩ juna Juo Hɛrɔdɩ. Saŋa gana na wʋ wɩɛ Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Gʋ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ na Yesu na, wʋ asadi fɔɩ, akala takɩɛ gʋ wʋ a ja wʋ a na ɩ na, dɩ taŋgɩlɛ. Ŋii wʋ cha nyii lɩɩ wʋ dʋɔ na, wʋ wɩɛna tamaa gʋ wʋ a wʋ a yɩɛ adaŋgana. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Wʋ tasɛ Yesu wɩɛ fɔɩ ama Yesu n lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Sɛ Ɩsʋɔ sei bɩnɩɛ na Mosesi mbara bakalaasa baa sɩmɩɛɩ dɩmaŋ baa pɔɩ Yesu na doŋ. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Sɛ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ na wʋ yuora baa yɩɛ ɩ takɩɛ wʋkpa kpakpuo sɛ ba jabi ɩ. Sɛ ba fu ɩ adugbe gagba bam sɛ ba mʋ ɩ ga fa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Dɩmʋŋ wɩɩ gana sɛ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ na Pilato ba yɩɛ dɩɛtɩrɛ, nafʋɔ ba cha ba yɩɛ badʋŋna bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba fu Yesu sɩŋ dɩpʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matiyo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maakɩ 15:6-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Sɛ Pilato yagɛ Ɩsʋɔ sei bɩnɩɛ, dɩɛ kɩɛra na bakpa baa kpiniŋ gaa jaŋi, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩ mʋ wʋkpa wina kɔna maŋ sɛ wʋ a warɩɛ bakapa nfɩɛrɛ sɛ ba n kʋlʋ sɩŋ Romatina dʋɔ. Ama gʋ ma kɩɛ wʋ wɩɛ naŋ na dieli amɩɛ asanaŋ na, ma n na gʋ wʋ di dɩpʋɛ wɩɛ ŋii ɩ tawɩ jaga wʋ dʋɔ na tɩba a. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Dɩmʋŋ sɛ Juo Hɛrɔdɩ gba n yu wɩɛ ŋarɛ ɛ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ bɔsɩna ɩ kɔna daa. Ŋɩ yɩɛ gasiŋteŋ gʋ Yesu n yɩɛ bʋrʋ gaa ga daga wʋ a sɩŋ ŋ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ maa fɔŋɩ wʋ dɩlɛ na maa yela ɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Bɩriŋnʋɔ kʋma dɩ tala Yudatina nyiŋi asadi adiya di na, ŋɩ yɩɛ Pilato ayɩɛsa sɛ wʋ n yela bakpa baa ba tɔ baa danɛ na tɩba wʋŋ bakpa baa a jawʋ na wʋrʋ fa ba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naa Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii kpiniŋ n wɩɛ dɩmʋŋ wɩɛ ŋina a</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Sɛ bakpa baa kpiniŋ yɩɛ nʋɔ garɛ kuusi sɛ, &lt;&lt;Kʋ baalɛ wina, na nyaa yela Barabasi fa daa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Ba tɔ Barabasi danɛ dɩtʋɔtɩŋ akala takɩɛ wʋ cha kpi baa ba kʋlʋ yuo chicha Roma bɩnɩɛ baa ba wɩɛ Yudatina tibi dʋɔ sɛ wʋ kʋ ba tɩba barɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Gʋ Pilato aja wʋ a yela Yesu dʋɔ na, wʋ ti bɔrɛ tawɩ dʋ bakpa baa. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ama ba ju dʋɔ baa kuusi sɛ, &lt;&lt;Jɔ ɩ daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ, jɔ ɩ daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Sɛ Pilato ti bɔrɛ tawɩ ba butoro-tɛ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be dɩsʋbʋ sɛ baalɛ wina yɩɛ? Ma n na dɩsʋbʋ gaa wʋ yɩɛ sɛ dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ daga sɩŋ ŋ. Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ maa fɔŋɩ wʋ dɩlɛ bɛ na maa yela ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ama ba desina kuusi na doŋ sɛ n jɔ ɩ daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ. Sɛ ba kuusi ŋii di dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ Pilato yɩɛ wʋ nfɩɛrɛ sɛ wʋ a yɩɛ ba jawʋ fa ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ Barabasi wʋŋ baa jawʋ na fa ba, wʋŋ ba tɔ ɩ danɛ dɩtʋɔtɩŋ sɛ wʋ cha kpi baa ba kʋlʋ yuo chicha Roma bɩnɩɛ baa ba wɩɛ Yudatina tibi dʋɔ sɛ wʋ kʋ ba tɩba barɛ. Sɛ wʋ mʋ Yesu fa ba ganaŋkʋ baa jawʋ na.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba jɔ Yesu daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matiyo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maakɩ 15:21-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Gʋ yuora baa mʋ Yesu baa ju na baa ga jɔ ɩ daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ na, ba jaŋina baalɛ wʋrʋ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Simoŋ wʋŋ wʋ lɩɩ Kireni. Wʋ lɩɩ dɩɛ bie garɛ naŋ wʋ a ju Yerusalem. Sɛ ba chaŋ ɩ dʋ ɩ sɛ ba mʋ daŋ gasagasa gaa sɩlɛ ɩ sɛ wʋ kpaŋ Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Sɛ bakpa baa fɔɩ kpaŋ Yesu, mʋ kpi ala barɛ dʋɔ baa yɩyɩɛ yela baa wii na. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Sɛ Yesu biliŋi tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yerusalem ala, n baa wii maŋ! Ama n wii fa amɩɛ wʋsɛ na amɩɛ bie. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Akala takɩɛ saŋa garɛ aja kɔŋ ɩ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;Kusee n nyina ala pamɩɛ a kpaŋtina, na lorie ŋii ŋɩ n lʋrʋ na ade ŋii ba n ŋmasɛ ŋɛ ɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Sɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt;Baa tawɩ bʋrɔŋsɛ sɛ n sala daa dʋɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">Na baa tawɩ bʋrɔŋbisi sɛ n fu daa dʋɔ!&gt;&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Sɛ bakpa mʋ ŋina yɩɛ maŋ wʋŋ ma kɩɛna takɩɛ daŋ ga lai na, be sɛ baa mʋ yɩɛ amɩɛ baa ɩ yɩɛ dasɛ awʋlɩɛ?<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Sɛ ba mʋ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra bala barɛ kpi Yesu dʋɔ na baa ga kʋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Gʋ ba ga tala diele gaa baa yagɛ sɛ Goligato[tie akala sɛ Nyi Gafie] na, ba jɔ Yesu daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ. Sɛ ba jɔ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra bala baa gba daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ. Wʋrʋ wɩɛ wʋ jɩsaŋ dʋɔ yela wʋrʋ wɩɛ wʋ naŋbii dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Majuo, mʋ ba dɩsʋbʋ chɩɛ ba, akala takɩɛ ba ba jiŋ ŋii baa yɩɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɩsʋɔ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii ŋarɛ tana dɩmʋŋ wɩɛ ŋina a</char></note> Gʋ ba jɔ Yesu daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ taŋ na, sɛ ba lɔ wʋ gagbasɛ dʋɔ mbi mʋ kpara fa dɔŋa.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Dɩmʋŋ saŋa gana na, bakpa baa cha ba sɩmɩɛɩ dɩmaŋ baa kɩɛ ɩ. Sɛ Yuda bɩnɩɛ baa jabi ɩ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋ a mɔlɔgɩ barɛ, sɛ wʋ yɩɛ Kirisito wʋŋ Ɩsʋɔ lɩsɛ na, wʋ n mɔlɔgɩ wʋ wʋsɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Sɛ yuora baa gba kuwe ɩ sɛ ba fa ɩ wayɩŋ sʋlʋŋ aŋaŋsa. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Sɛ ba tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɛ nyaŋ n nyina Yudatina Juo na, mɔlɔgɩ n wʋsɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Sɛ ba sabɩɛ bʋrʋ garɛ jaga wʋ nyie dʋɔ daŋ gasagasa gaa dʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;WINA N NYINA YUDATINA JUO WƲŊ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Sɛ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra baa tɩba wʋrʋ wʋŋ wʋ sagaɩ daŋ gasagasa gaa dʋɔ na tii ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Naa nyaŋ n nyina Kirisito naa? Mɔlɔgɩ n wʋsɛ na nyaa mɔlɔgɩ daa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ama wʋ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra baŋbaŋ wʋŋ jɔ wʋ nʋɔ dʋɔ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyaa se Ɩsʋɔ, sɛ n ba jiŋ gʋ nyaŋ na ɩ, ɩ wɩɛ dɩpʋɛ fuu gadʋŋdʋlʋŋ naŋ? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Daa bɩrɛ, ba fɔŋɩ daa dɩlɛ na, dɩ daga daa dɩsʋbʋ ayɩɛsa. Ama baalɛ wina bɩrɛ, wʋ n yɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ taŋ dieli i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Yesu, n kɔŋ n Juori naŋ na, nyiŋi maŋ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɩsʋɔ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋarɛ wɩɛna sɛ nya kɔŋ n juori yikuo naŋ na </char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Maa tawɩ sɛ nyii na dieli sɛ jaŋ nyaa kpi ma dʋɔ paradiso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu sɩŋ wɩɛ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matiyo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maakɩ 15:33-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Gʋ dɩ tala wiita keŋkeŋ na, giteŋteŋbiri kɔŋ tibi dʋɔ kpiniŋ ga tala bʋyanɔ karafɩɛ atoro, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />sɛ wiita yela jʋɔ sɛ dukuru gaa ba mʋ gara Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ na, chati tɩba bʋla. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Sɛ Yesu kuusi sɛ, &lt;&lt;Majuo, ma mʋ ma sʋbʋ dʋ n pam naŋ.&gt;&gt; Gʋ wʋ tawɩ ŋina taŋ na sɛ wʋ sɩŋ.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Gʋ yuora gafie bɩnɛ wʋŋ na ŋii ŋɩ tibi na, wʋ kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Gasiŋteŋ, baalɛ wina yɩɛ wʋchirigisa bɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Gʋ bakpa baa ba jaŋi dɩmaŋ kpiniŋ na ŋii ŋɩ tibi na, ba mʋ ba pamɩɛ jaga ba nyie dʋɔ wii ju dɩɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ama baa ba jiŋ Yesu na ala baa ba kpaŋ ɩ lɩɩ Galaliya na cha ba sɩmɩɛɩ taŋasɛ baa kɩɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matiyo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maakɩ 15:42-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Baalɛ wʋrʋ cha wʋ wɩɛ baa yagɛ ɩ sɛ Yosefu wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ dɩɛnaŋ bɩnɩɛ naŋ bɩnɩɛ dikpeŋ naŋ tɩba wʋrʋ. Wʋ yɩɛ wʋkpa bam sɛ wʋ gbɩɛsɛ chirigi. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Wʋŋ bɩrɛ, wʋ n kpa ba gbɩɛsɛ na ŋii baa ja sɛ baa mʋ yɩɛ Yesu na a. Wʋ lɩɩ Arimatiya gaa ga wɩɛ Yudiya tibi dʋɔ bɛ. Wʋ cha wʋ dana Ɩsʋɔ Juori gaa kɔnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Sɛ wʋ ju Pilato jaŋ ga sʋlʋ sɛ wʋ n mʋ Yesu gɩtatɛ gaa fa ɩ na wʋ a mʋ ga wuu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Sɛ wʋ sagi ɩ mʋ dɩkalala pɔgʋ ɩ. Sɛ wʋ mʋ ɩ ga wuu akpanaŋ bʋɔ garɛ naŋ gaa ba n wuu ta wʋrʋ dɩmaŋ ŋ. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ŋɩ cha ŋɩ yɩɛ wɩɩ ga kʋlasa gaa baa kʋla ba wʋsɛ ba dana Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ na bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Sɛ ala baa ba kpaŋ Yesu lɩɩ Galaliya kɔŋ na kpaŋ Yosefu ju ga na gachaŋ gaa na ganaŋkʋ wʋ wuu Yesu na. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Sɛ ba bɔrɛ ju dɩɛ ga kʋla wuu fʋagɩɛ tii alifeŋsa na nuŋ alifeŋsa na baa mʋ gaa susaa wʋ gɩtatɩrɛ. Ama ba fɩɛsɛ Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ ganaŋkʋ Mosesi mbara a kalaa na.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matiyo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maakɩ 16:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Fɩɛsɛ wɩɩ wʋrʋgbɩɛ wɩɩ gaa ga dɔŋ soji asanaŋ na nafo fuu, ala baa mʋ wuu fʋagɩɛ tii alifeŋsa ŋii ba cha kʋla si na mʋ ju akpanaŋ bʋɔ gaa jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Sɛ ba na gʋ bʋɩ janɛ gaa ga fuwei akpanaŋ bʋɔ gaa nʋɔ na gbiliti ga duo laraŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Gʋ ba jʋʋ akpanaŋ bʋɔ gaa naŋ na, ba n na Kpaŋjuo Yesu gɩtatɛ ɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Gʋ baa yɩyɩɛ ŋina dʋɔ na, gabʋanaŋ sɛ ba na baala bala barɛ ba fuona gagbasɛ ŋii ŋalagi takɩɛ duoni ŋmaŋi na gaa sɩŋ ba jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ ba sɛ ba luuŋ mʋ ba asa wuu. Sɛ baala baa tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ ɩ ja wʋŋ wʋ chaɩ nkpa naŋ na atatina naŋ? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Wʋ taŋ jɩna a, wʋ feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ. N nyiŋi wɩɛ ŋii wʋ tawɩ amɩɛ saŋa gaa wʋ wɩɛ amɩɛ jaŋ Galaliya na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ŋɩ tiri gʋ ba n lɩsɛ Wʋkpa Bu wʋŋ dʋ dɩsʋbʋ yɩɛra pamɩɛ naŋ na baa jɔ ɩ daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ na wʋ a sɩŋ, wɩɛ atorotɛ na, wʋ a feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Sɛ ba nyiŋi wɩɛ ŋii wʋ tawɩ ba na.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Gʋ ba lɩɩ bʋɔ gaa jaŋ kɔŋ na, ba tawɩ bʋrʋkʋma gana fa kpirida gifi darɛ baa na baa ba kakaa na kpiniŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Ala bana n nyina Mariya Magadalini, Yowana, Mariya wʋŋ wʋ yɩɛ Jamesi wʋnaa na baa ba kpi ba dʋɔ na n tawɩ ŋina fa kpirida baa. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ama ba n lɩɛ ala baa wɩɛ ŋii di i. Akala takɩɛ ba wɩɛ ŋii yɩɛ wɩɛ a jaga bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ama Petero bɩrɛ, wʋ kʋlʋ se ju akpanaŋ bʋɔ gaa jaŋ. Gʋ wʋ luuŋ kɩɛ na, wʋ na dɩkalala atabaŋ gaa ba mʋ pɔgʋ ɩ na nyiŋeŋ n duona. Sɛ wʋ bɔrɛ ju dɩɛ wʋ a fa nfɩɛrɛ ŋii ŋɩ tibi na dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emawusi dɩɛ naŋ ju</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maakɩ 16:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Dɩmʋŋ wɩɩ gana Yesu kpalɛnara baa tɩba bala cha baa ju dɩɛ bie garɛ gaa baa yagɛ sɛ Emawusi. Lɩɩ Yerusalem mʋ ju dɩmaŋ aja yɩɛ takɩɛ mayili lɩkaarɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Gʋ baa ju na yela baa tawɩ ŋii ŋɩ tibi na kpiniŋ dʋɔ wɩɛ baa fa dɔŋa. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Gʋ ba dɔŋ baa tawɩ ŋina dʋɔ wɩɛ baa fa dɔŋa na, Yesu tɩŋtɩŋ kɔŋ gaa kpi ba dʋɔ yela wʋ na ba dɔŋ baa ju. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ama Ɩsʋɔ n yela baa jiŋ sɛ Yesu mɩnaŋ ŋ.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Sɛ wʋ tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be wɩɛ sɛ ɩ dɔŋ ɩ tawɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Sɛ ba tɩba wʋrʋ wʋŋ baa yagɛ sɛ Kilopasi tasɛ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;N nyiŋeŋ n nyina mʋɔrɛ Yerusalem sɛ n ba jiŋ wɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ tibi dɩmaŋ wɩɛ ala ŋina naŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Sɛ Yesu tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be wɩɛ n tibi bɛ?&gt;&gt; Sɛ ba lɩsɛ ɩ nʋɔ sɛ wɩɛ ŋii ŋɩ tibi lɩɩna Yesu Nasarati wʋkpa wʋŋ dʋɔ na. Ɩsʋɔ na bakpa kpiniŋ lɩɛ ɩ dʋ gʋ wʋ yɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ ɔja yikuotɛ wʋ dɩtawɩ naŋ na wʋ ayɩɛsa dʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Ɩsʋɔ sei bɩnɩɛ na daa dɩɛ naŋ bɩnɩɛ mʋ ɩ fa sɛ ba n fu ɩ sɩŋ dɩpʋɛ sɛ ba jɔ ɩ daŋ gasagasa dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ama daa bɩrɛ, nafʋɔ dɩ wɩɛna tamaa gʋ wʋŋ aaŋ ja wʋ a lɩɛ Isiralitina. Ama ŋina kpiniŋ wʋrʋgbɩɛ na, wɩɛ atorotɛ gʋ ŋina kpiniŋ tibi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Sɛ ŋii ŋɩ ti kpi na, ala baa ba kpi daa dʋɔ na tɩba barɛ tawɩ daa wɩɛ ŋarɛ sɛ dɩ yɩɛ daa doba. Ba kʋlʋ nafo fuu ju gachaŋ gaa jaŋ <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ama ba n na Yesu gɩtatɛ ɛ. Sɛ ba bɔrɛ kɔŋ gaa tawɩ daa sɛ ba na Ɩsʋɔ lɩsɛ kalaa sɛ ba na Ɩsʋɔ gabʋɔsɛ sɛ ba tawɩ daa sɛ Yesu chaɩ nkpa naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Sɛ daa dɔŋa barɛ ju gachaŋ gaa jaŋ ga na ganaŋkʋ ala baa gaa tawɩ na, ama Yesu bɩrɛ, ba n na ɩ.<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɩɛ bamalaŋpʋna, amɩɛ agela wɩɛ doŋ na ɩ lɩɛ wɩɛ ŋii Ɩsʋɔ bajana tawɩ na kpiniŋ di. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ŋɩ tiri gʋ Kirisito wʋŋ a na awʋrʋfʋɔ ŋina pɔɩ na wʋ a yu jilima?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Sɛ Yesu fara lɩɩ Mosesi sabɩɛ na Ɩsʋɔ bajana baa sabɩɛ wɩɛ kpiniŋ lɩsɛ tie fa ba bʋrʋkʋma gaa ba sabɩɛ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii kpiniŋ naŋ lɩɩ wʋ wʋsɛ dʋɔ na.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Gʋ baa tirina dɩɛ bie gaa na, Yesu yɩɛ takɩɛ wʋ a ju wʋ asanaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ama ba sʋlʋ ɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Cha daa jaŋ bʋyanɔ gana, akala takɩɛ tɩɛ tam.&gt;&gt; Dɩmʋŋ dʋɔ wʋ ju ga cha ba jaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Gʋ wʋ cha na wʋ na ba baa di na, wʋ mʋ bodobodo sɛ wʋ yɩlɩ Ɩsʋɔ sɛ wʋ jaɩ tɩba mʋ fa ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Dɩmaŋ sɛ ba asa fulu sɛ ba jiŋ gʋ Yesu bɛ sɛ wʋ ŋaŋdɛ ba asa dʋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Sɛ ba tasɛ dɔŋa sɛ, &lt;&lt;Daa asa n lɩɛ daa agela naŋ, saŋa gaa wʋ a tawɩ wʋ a fa daa yela dɩ dɔŋ gbɩɛ naŋ dɩ kɔnɛ, sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ Ɩsʋɔ Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii tie kalaa daa naa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Gabʋanaŋ sɛ ba kʋlʋ ju Yerusalem, sɛ ba ga na kpirida gifi darɛ baa na baa ba kpi ba dʋɔ na sila dikulie, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />sɛ ba tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ŋɩ yɩɛ gasiŋteŋ bɛ! Kpaŋjuo wʋŋ feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ sɛ wʋ lɩsɛ wʋ wʋsɛ kalaa Simoŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Sɛ baala bala baa tawɩ ba ŋii ŋɩ tibi gbɩɛ naŋ na ganaŋkʋ ba na ɩ jiŋ ɩ saŋa gaa wʋ a jaɩ bodobodo gaa na.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu lɩsɛ wʋ wʋsɛ kalaa wʋ kpalɛnara</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matiyo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maakɩ 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Dɩtʋm 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Gʋ kpalɛnara bala baa cha baa tawɩ ŋii ŋɩ tibi na dʋɔ wɩɛ baa fa gifi darɛ baa na, gabʋanaŋ sɛ Yesu tɩŋtɩŋ gaa sɩŋ ba jaŋ sɛ wʋ tawɩ sɛ, &lt;&lt;Wʋsɛfɩɛ n kɔŋ amɩɛ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Sɛ ba yiŋii sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ ba, akala takɩɛ ba jiŋ sɛ ba na gɩtatɩrɛ bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Sɛ Yesu tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Be n yɩɛ sɛ nyɩŋtɩɛ chaŋ amɩɛ sɛ be n yɩɛ sɛ ɩ saŋ ɩ di noro amɩɛ nfɩɛrɛ naŋ? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />N kɩɛ ma pam taŋtaŋ na ma nafara taŋtaŋ naŋ. Maŋ mɩnaŋ! N tapʋ maŋ kɩɛ. Gɩtatɩrɛ tana wʋsɛ tanɛ na ŋmaba takɩɛ ganaŋkʋ ɩ na ma wɩɛna na a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Gʋ wʋ tawɩ ŋina taŋ na, wʋ kalaa ba wʋ pam taŋtaŋ na wʋ nafara taŋtaŋ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Ama ba n lɩɛdi i, akala takɩɛ dɩ yɩɛ ba doba sɛ ba asadi ga laŋ. Dɩmaŋ sɛ Yesu tasɛ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɩ wɩɛna adiya jɩna?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Sɛ ba fa ɩ diji ga ŋansisa gaguŋ garɛ, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />sɛ wʋ lɩɛ ga tawʋ ba asanaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ŋina sɛ ma tawɩ amɩɛ saŋa gaa ma wɩɛ amɩɛ jaŋ, sɛ ŋɩ tiri gʋ wɩɛ kʋma ŋii ba sabɩɛ Mosesi mbara, Ɩsʋɔ bajana baa sabɩɛ na Numba tanɛ naŋ lɩɩna ma dʋɔ na a kɔŋ tɩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Sɛ wʋ fulu ba nfɩɛrɛ sɛ ba nyii Sabɩɛwɩɛ ŋii tie. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Sɛ wʋ tawɩ ba sɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba sabɩɛ sɛ Kirisito wʋŋ aja na awʋrʋfʋɔ na wʋ a sɩŋ, wɩɛ atoro tɛ na wʋ a feŋ lɩɩ sɩŋ naŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Wʋ yɩrɛ naŋ, baa tawɩ biliŋi lɩɩ dɩsʋbʋ naŋ na dɩsʋbʋ mʋ chɩɛ wɩɛ fa atawɩ yɩrɩ kpiniŋ. Ŋii fara lɩɩ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Amɩɛ n nyina ŋina kpiniŋ seriyatina. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Maa kpiri ŋii Majuo tawɩ si sɛ wʋ a mʋ fa amɩɛ na a kɔŋ amɩɛ dʋɔ. Ama n cha Yerusalem dɩɛ gana naŋ ga tala gʋ Ɩsʋɔ aja yela wʋ Feliŋ doŋ a kɔŋ amɩɛ dʋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ju Ɩsʋɔ adugbe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maakɩ 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Dɩtʋm 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Sɛ Yesu mʋ wʋ kpalɛnara baa lɩɩ Yerusalem dɩɛ naŋ mʋ ju Betaniya dɩɛ bie gaa naŋ. Dɩmaŋ sɛ wʋ jiŋna wʋ pamɩɛ adugbe sɛ wʋ yɩɛ ba kusee. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Gʋ wʋ a yɩɛ ba kusee na, sɛ Ɩsʋɔ mʋ ɩ lɩɩ ba jaŋ ju Ɩsʋɔ adugbe. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ba tʋm ɩ sɛ ba mʋ asadi fɔɩ bɔrɛ ju Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Sɛ saŋa kʋma baa ju Ɩsʋɔ tʋm danɛ naŋ baa kalɩɛ Ɩsʋɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>